(1039412, 125095, 20925, '<td valign="top">Love the compostion colors and subject, but the shot feels a little off technically.  I think the image suffers from what looks like a really tight crop and not enough light.  Focus seems a little soft, maybe camera shake too?</td>', 'Love the compostion colors and subject, but the shot feels a little off technically.  I think the image suffers from what looks like a really tight crop and not enough light.  Focus seems a little soft, maybe camera shake too?', '2004-12-01 00:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039415, 124053, 10432, '<td valign="top">Good concept.  But the photo seems a bit dark and could use some more contrast (milk is very grey).  Focus is a bit soft.  BOL</td>', 'Good concept.  But the photo seems a bit dark and could use some more contrast (milk is very grey).  Focus is a bit soft.  BOL', '2004-12-01 00:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039416, 124089, 28141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but which cranes are you counting?  I see more than 7.  I would also suggest cropping the top off.  The blank blueish part doesn''t add much.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but which cranes are you counting?  I see more than 7.  I would also suggest cropping the top off.  The blank blueish part doesn''t add much.', '2004-12-01 00:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
