(1039421, 125182, 20925, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but the colors seem a bit blown out.  There are some shadows up and to the left of the blue that are a little distracting, and some white speckles down the right hand side that take away from the image.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but the colors seem a bit blown out.  There are some shadows up and to the left of the blue that are a little distracting, and some white speckles down the right hand side that take away from the image.', '2004-12-01 00:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
