(1039669, 124339, 29849, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous idea!  Including the reflection really brought this photo together for me.  Is he the culprit or just a curious passer-by?  You''ve done an excellent job engaging my eye and my mind.</td>', 'What a fabulous idea!  Including the reflection really brought this photo together for me.  Is he the culprit or just a curious passer-by?  You''ve done an excellent job engaging my eye and my mind.', '2004-12-01 01:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039670, 124067, 28108, '<td valign="top">The glass is too close from the background, the shadow is quite distracting. Should have been done with no flash, more diffused light and longer shutter sp... Oh yeah... That would screw up the water splash... Yeah, okay... Just too close from the background! It still a nice picture, maybe not a 10 but...</td>', 'The glass is too close from the background, the shadow is quite distracting. Should have been done with no flash, more diffused light and longer shutter sp... Oh yeah... That would screw up the water splash... Yeah, okay... Just too close from the background! It still a nice picture, maybe not a 10 but...', '2004-12-01 01:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039672, 124034, 18197, '<td valign="top">This has to be almost off the scale for degree of difficulty. Well executed.</td>', 'This has to be almost off the scale for degree of difficulty. Well executed.', '2004-12-01 01:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039673, 125171, 20925, '<td valign="top">i like the subject and colors, but think there might be other ways to frame the shot to make it more interesting.</td>', 'i like the subject and colors, but think there might be other ways to frame the shot to make it more interesting.', '2004-12-01 01:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039675, 124998, 23913, '<td valign="top">that stuff keeps me alive nice shot way to get it so studio and yet very candid i tried to take a shot in a starbucks once and got kicked out but, i still go there for coffee u can''t beat it with a stick.<br/>the Italian Sodas are great too.-GL</td>', 'that stuff keeps me alive nice shot way to get it so studio and yet very candid i tried to take a shot in a starbucks once and got kicked out but, i still go there for coffee u can''t beat it with a stick.the Italian Sodas are great too.-GL', '2004-12-01 01:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039678, 125056, 28108, '<td valign="top">What''s going on here? No idea but I like it. Nice.</td>', 'What''s going on here? No idea but I like it. Nice.', '2004-12-01 01:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039682, 124935, 18197, '<td valign="top">Hmm ... I count 8 tracks. I would like to see this in color. The choice of B&amp;W was good for the grass but not so much for the tracks.</td>', 'Hmm ... I count 8 tracks. I would like to see this in color. The choice of B&W was good for the grass but not so much for the tracks.', '2004-12-01 01:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039683, 125202, 29849, '<td valign="top">I love the starkness and lack of color -- really sets the mood for this photo!</td>', 'I love the starkness and lack of color -- really sets the mood for this photo!', '2004-12-01 01:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039684, 124432, 18197, '<td valign="top">With the background, this feels too busy to me.</td>', 'With the background, this feels too busy to me.', '2004-12-01 01:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039685, 124048, 20925, '<td valign="top">fun, if a little dark.  i''d probably suggest a lighter background to make the edges of the controller and cartriges a little more visible, maybe a more dramatic angle too.  also a larger shot, most shots that are smaller then the 640 max take a penalty for their size.</td>', 'fun, if a little dark.  i''d probably suggest a lighter background to make the edges of the controller and cartriges a little more visible, maybe a more dramatic angle too.  also a larger shot, most shots that are smaller then the 640 max take a penalty for their size.', '2004-12-01 01:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039686, 124962, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective on SF. Love those row houses. Excellent capture.</td>', 'Very nice perspective on SF. Love those row houses. Excellent capture.', '2004-12-01 01:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039690, 124450, 20925, '<td valign="top">cool macro.  i like the purple tone/fringing of the shadow.</td>', 'cool macro.  i like the purple tone/fringing of the shadow.', '2004-12-01 01:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039692, 124822, 18197, '<td valign="top">This made me smile. Nice job. I''m not generally a fan of borders but this is a good one. Hope it does well.</td>', 'This made me smile. Nice job. I''m not generally a fan of borders but this is a good one. Hope it does well.', '2004-12-01 01:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039694, 125204, 29849, '<td valign="top">This was a really convincing illusion -- I had to do a double take!  Great idea.</td>', 'This was a really convincing illusion -- I had to do a double take!  Great idea.', '2004-12-01 01:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039697, 125202, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good photo. Dark and moody, very emotive.</td>', 'Good photo. Dark and moody, very emotive.', '2004-12-01 01:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039698, 124495, 20925, '<td valign="top">one of my favorite subjects, although i don''t know if i have any shots quite as nice as this one.  hope the lack of obviously visible 7 doesn''t hurt your score.</td>', 'one of my favorite subjects, although i don''t know if i have any shots quite as nice as this one.  hope the lack of obviously visible 7 doesn''t hurt your score.', '2004-12-01 01:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039700, 124907, 27293, '<td valign="top">Very nice, except for what appears to be noise and not grain in the shadows... I''ll come back to check it out with a fresh set of eyes though.</td>', 'Very nice, except for what appears to be noise and not grain in the shadows... I''ll come back to check it out with a fresh set of eyes though.', '2004-12-01 01:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039704, 125178, 20925, '<td valign="top">kinda interesting... but the little line of color at the top left corner is distracting.</td>', 'kinda interesting... but the little line of color at the top left corner is distracting.', '2004-12-01 01:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039705, 125066, 27293, '<td valign="top">Cool, nice composition too. Especially like the intersecting shadows.</td>', 'Cool, nice composition too. Especially like the intersecting shadows.', '2004-12-01 01:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039707, 124465, 29849, '<td valign="top">Interesting geometry -- the reflection in the orbs was a great idea.  I''m curious -- did you use a printed cone around the lens?</td>', 'Interesting geometry -- the reflection in the orbs was a great idea.  I''m curious -- did you use a printed cone around the lens?', '2004-12-01 01:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039708, 125106, 29777, '<td valign="top">very cool. I''m sure this took quite a while to get right.</td>', 'very cool. I''m sure this took quite a while to get right.', '2004-12-01 01:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039710, 125105, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good subject but I think it could have been arranged and captured better. Maybe a red background instead of the white. A bit sharper focus and less grain.This is just my opinion. It may be the your choices here were designed to give this an old world look and it certainly achieves that.</td>', 'Good subject but I think it could have been arranged and captured better. Maybe a red background instead of the white. A bit sharper focus and less grain.This is just my opinion. It may be the your choices here were designed to give this an old world look and it certainly achieves that.', '2004-12-01 01:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039711, 125214, 23913, '<td valign="top">i lov the lighting on this shot it seems just ever so slightly washed out.<br/> <br/>grayish in nature but it is 1 of the coolest i''ve seen so far.-GL</td>', 'i lov the lighting on this shot it seems just ever so slightly washed out. grayish in nature but it is 1 of the coolest i''ve seen so far.-GL', '2004-12-01 01:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039713, 124617, 20925, '<td valign="top">i kind of like this, but maybe the tight crop is taking something away for me.  nice focus.</td>', 'i kind of like this, but maybe the tight crop is taking something away for me.  nice focus.', '2004-12-01 01:17:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1039714, 125025, 18197, '<td valign="top">Brilliant silhouteet. Lover the silvery color of the water and stark tree trunks. Texture in the water is nice, too.</td>', 'Brilliant silhouteet. Lover the silvery color of the water and stark tree trunks. Texture in the water is nice, too.', '2004-12-01 01:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039715, 125171, 27293, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice shot, i mean it would be a candidate for a 10 from me, i love this kind of stuff. But: sharpness just doesn''t seem to be there. Perhaps it has to do with the allowed image size. And also, i generally like the composition, but something seems to be a little off there. I''ll put a placeholder 7 for now, but will come back another day to definitely adjust that. Won''t go lower, though. =)</td>', 'It''s a very nice shot, i mean it would be a candidate for a 10 from me, i love this kind of stuff. But: sharpness just doesn''t seem to be there. Perhaps it has to do with the allowed image size. And also, i generally like the composition, but something seems to be a little off there. I''ll put a placeholder 7 for now, but will come back another day to definitely adjust that. Won''t go lower, though. =)', '2004-12-01 01:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039716, 124486, 18197, '<td valign="top">Ha! This makes me smile. Very nicely captured!</td>', 'Ha! This makes me smile. Very nicely captured!', '2004-12-01 01:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039719, 124450, 27293, '<td valign="top">10, no questions, i like this better than my own =) Awesome composition and execution, the shadow is +1 point too.</td>', '10, no questions, i like this better than my own =) Awesome composition and execution, the shadow is +1 point too.', '2004-12-01 01:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039720, 124137, 20925, '<td valign="top">great contrast with the background.  nice comp.  did you play around with different DoF?  i like that everything is in focus, but wonder what it looked like with shallower DoF.</td>', 'great contrast with the background.  nice comp.  did you play around with different DoF?  i like that everything is in focus, but wonder what it looked like with shallower DoF.', '2004-12-01 01:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039721, 125136, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like this image better when it was smaller. It cought my eye better when I had to stare harder to figure out what it was. Nice image.</td>', 'I like this image better when it was smaller. It cought my eye better when I had to stare harder to figure out what it was. Nice image.', '2004-12-01 01:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039722, 125134, 28108, '<td valign="top">Hey! Two-nies! The lighting is very harsh, it should have been with no flash, more adequate lighting and longer shutter speed.</td>', 'Hey! Two-nies! The lighting is very harsh, it should have been with no flash, more adequate lighting and longer shutter speed.', '2004-12-01 01:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039723, 125201, 24538, '<td valign="top">aren''t those the Calgary Olympic glasses from 1988 that Petro Canada was giving out??<br/> <br/>decent setup, although not perfectly centred.  Lighting could be a little less harsh to make it "pop" a bit more.  I think a plain background might have worked a bit better as well.<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'aren''t those the Calgary Olympic glasses from 1988 that Petro Canada was giving out?? decent setup, although not perfectly centred.  Lighting could be a little less harsh to make it "pop" a bit more.  I think a plain background might have worked a bit better as well. Good luck!', '2004-12-01 01:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039725, 124090, 23913, '<td valign="top">set wise this shot is not the best...but the idea is intrusting.<br/> <br/>also 1 can see reflections in almost everyone of the monitors but in perticular the bottomright of the stack.</td>', 'set wise this shot is not the best...but the idea is intrusting. also 1 can see reflections in almost everyone of the monitors but in perticular the bottomright of the stack.', '2004-12-01 01:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039726, 124279, 29777, '<td valign="top">The angle and lack of color give a feeling of old-world nobility.</td>', 'The angle and lack of color give a feeling of old-world nobility.', '2004-12-01 01:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039728, 123753, 17103, '<td valign="top">Wow, stunning shot!  And you took it while it was snowing!  I''ve not been able to get a decent snow shot while it''s falling...... 10</td>', 'Wow, stunning shot!  And you took it while it was snowing!  I''ve not been able to get a decent snow shot while it''s falling...... 10', '2004-12-01 01:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039731, 125136, 27293, '<td valign="top">=) Awesome. Somehow this looks strangely familiar... not implying anything, i''ve just been playing with slinkies lately, so i got them on my brain. =) The only thing i''ll mention is that cyan on the right would look slightly better if it was a darker shade of blue. Would go with red in a little more appealing way.</td>', '=) Awesome. Somehow this looks strangely familiar... not implying anything, i''ve just been playing with slinkies lately, so i got them on my brain. =) The only thing i''ll mention is that cyan on the right would look slightly better if it was a darker shade of blue. Would go with red in a little more appealing way.', '2004-12-01 01:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039732, 123912, 20925, '<td valign="top">I''m usually a fan of gritty b/w shots, but it isn''t working for me here.  i assume you shot with high iso and converted b/c the color noise was unacceptable.  given the subject, focus could be sharper, or maybe it was camera shake.  like the idea though.</td>', 'I''m usually a fan of gritty b/w shots, but it isn''t working for me here.  i assume you shot with high iso and converted b/c the color noise was unacceptable.  given the subject, focus could be sharper, or maybe it was camera shake.  like the idea though.', '2004-12-01 01:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039734, 124755, 29777, '<td valign="top">Where is this? It reminds me of Italy. I would like to see a bit more detail in the statues. Maybe too many shadows.</td>', 'Where is this? It reminds me of Italy. I would like to see a bit more detail in the statues. Maybe too many shadows.', '2004-12-01 01:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039735, 124275, 23913, '<td valign="top">intrusting idea funny,...sad but true...<br/> <br/>the lighting on the wood surface seems greenish. nice over all shot</td>', 'intrusting idea funny,...sad but true... the lighting on the wood surface seems greenish. nice over all shot', '2004-12-01 01:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039737, 124277, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. [lol]Probably should have titled it 6 2/3s but whose counting. [/lol] Nice colors. String around the finger was a nice touch. Hope it does well.</td>', 'I like the composition. [lol]Probably should have titled it 6 2/3s but whose counting. [/lol] Nice colors. String around the finger was a nice touch. Hope it does well.', '2004-12-01 01:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039738, 124565, 23913, '<td valign="top">well taken, nice image</td>', 'well taken, nice image', '2004-12-01 01:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039740, 125052, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like the detail in the thread and the reflection in the table. Nice.</td>', 'I like the detail in the thread and the reflection in the table. Nice.', '2004-12-01 01:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039741, 124889, 20925, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting.  there''s a smudge near the lower edge that is somewhat distracting though.</td>', 'interesting lighting.  there''s a smudge near the lower edge that is somewhat distracting though.', '2004-12-01 01:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039742, 124771, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well done. Subject nicely focused. DOF feels about right to me. Wonder how you got ''em all to line up so nicely?</td>', 'Well done. Subject nicely focused. DOF feels about right to me. Wonder how you got ''em all to line up so nicely?', '2004-12-01 01:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039745, 124251, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette! Love the feathery texture of the trees against the sky.</td>', 'Nice silhouette! Love the feathery texture of the trees against the sky.', '2004-12-01 01:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039746, 125185, 27293, '<td valign="top">Ah, the rest of the cards should be showing why this seven is lucky... like a straight w/o the 7, or something.</td>', 'Ah, the rest of the cards should be showing why this seven is lucky... like a straight w/o the 7, or something.', '2004-12-01 01:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039747, 125140, 20925, '<td valign="top">yikes!  this makes me dizzy just looking at it.  i want to look away but i''m drawn back in.  i love it when just looking at an image gives me a response like that.  nice job.</td>', 'yikes!  this makes me dizzy just looking at it.  i want to look away but i''m drawn back in.  i love it when just looking at an image gives me a response like that.  nice job.', '2004-12-01 01:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039748, 124061, 27293, '<td valign="top">10, 10, 10!</td>', '10, 10, 10!', '2004-12-01 01:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039749, 124465, 20889, '<td valign="top">Nice, very creative.</td>', 'Nice, very creative.', '2004-12-01 01:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039750, 125057, 25952, '<td valign="top">this took some set up time. i like it. 7</td>', 'this took some set up time. i like it. 7', '2004-12-01 01:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039751, 124037, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  I hope the unlevel horizon doesn''t do it in.  Stars and sky are lovely.</td>', 'This is very nice.  I hope the unlevel horizon doesn''t do it in.  Stars and sky are lovely.', '2004-12-01 01:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039752, 125175, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am sure there are exactly 7 of something in here but I be darned if I can find that special subject.</td>', 'I am sure there are exactly 7 of something in here but I be darned if I can find that special subject.', '2004-12-01 01:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039753, 124289, 23913, '<td valign="top">great image<br/> <br/>i lov this shot it is well lit, well taken, well done, well voted, or should i say voted highly-10-GL</td>', 'great image i lov this shot it is well lit, well taken, well done, well voted, or should i say voted highly-10-GL', '2004-12-01 01:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039756, 123933, 25464, '<td valign="top">Bold, bright, simple.  I like it.</td>', 'Bold, bright, simple.  I like it.', '2004-12-01 01:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039757, 124267, 20925, '<td valign="top">i like the detail and contrast here.</td>', 'i like the detail and contrast here.', '2004-12-01 01:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039758, 125044, 28108, '<td valign="top">Ahhh! Finally! A fresh composition with CDs/DVDs - extra point for that. Light, focus (with blur effects) and colours are top notch! Great job!</td>', 'Ahhh! Finally! A fresh composition with CDs/DVDs - extra point for that. Light, focus (with blur effects) and colours are top notch! Great job!', '2004-12-01 01:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039759, 125108, 24970, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that anything is really in focus here. Nicely composed though.</td>', 'I don''t feel that anything is really in focus here. Nicely composed though.', '2004-12-01 01:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039760, 124155, 25464, '<td valign="top">Focus could have been a wee bit sharper on a couple of the berries, but I really like the overall effect.  I think this is a contender for the top.</td>', 'Focus could have been a wee bit sharper on a couple of the berries, but I really like the overall effect.  I think this is a contender for the top.', '2004-12-01 01:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039762, 125048, 20925, '<td valign="top">given the subject and the style, i find the panoramic crop a little confusing.  i like the colors and the graininess.</td>', 'given the subject and the style, i find the panoramic crop a little confusing.  i like the colors and the graininess.', '2004-12-01 01:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039763, 124907, 28108, '<td valign="top">A good picture does''nt have to be complicated. This is a good example here.</td>', 'A good picture does''nt have to be complicated. This is a good example here.', '2004-12-01 01:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039764, 124089, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this will score well.  You could enter the same shot in landmarks.  I wonder if anyone has ever done that.  Good job.</td>', 'I think this will score well.  You could enter the same shot in landmarks.  I wonder if anyone has ever done that.  Good job.', '2004-12-01 01:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039765, 124770, 20925, '<td valign="top">beer goggles?  i thought they worked the other way...  I like the subject and the arrangement, but i''m not loving the angle or the lighting.</td>', 'beer goggles?  i thought they worked the other way...  I like the subject and the arrangement, but i''m not loving the angle or the lighting.', '2004-12-01 01:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039766, 125188, 23913, '<td valign="top">great shot<br/> <br/>theres just 1 thing that bothers me about it and that is there apears to be a funny ghost line running through it looks like the edge of a table runs from the uper left cornor to the little white dot in the backround just off the longest flare of the far right candel.<br/> <br/>other than that minor thing nice image.</td>', 'great shot theres just 1 thing that bothers me about it and that is there apears to be a funny ghost line running through it looks like the edge of a table runs from the uper left cornor to the little white dot in the backround just off the longest flare of the far right candel. other than that minor thing nice image.', '2004-12-01 01:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039767, 125112, 20925, '<td valign="top">fun shot.  would probably like a tighter or a wider crop though.</td>', 'fun shot.  would probably like a tighter or a wider crop though.', '2004-12-01 01:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039768, 124295, 29849, '<td valign="top">I have to say, the more I look at this photo, the longer I think.   At first it was funny, then it was poignant.  Great creativity.  Niice job.</td>', 'I have to say, the more I look at this photo, the longer I think.   At first it was funny, then it was poignant.  Great creativity.  Niice job.', '2004-12-01 01:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039769, 124753, 25464, '<td valign="top">This one is dramatic and I am a sucker for a good silhouette; however, the seven is a little hard to count with certainty (doesn''t bother me, but I am sure it will bother some.) and the overall effect seems a little overprocessed.  Still very nice, and one of my higher scores.</td>', 'This one is dramatic and I am a sucker for a good silhouette; however, the seven is a little hard to count with certainty (doesn''t bother me, but I am sure it will bother some.) and the overall effect seems a little overprocessed.  Still very nice, and one of my higher scores.', '2004-12-01 01:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039771, 124936, 20925, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  the only thing i don''t really like is what looks like water drops or dust in the upper center of the frame.</td>', 'nice idea.  the only thing i don''t really like is what looks like water drops or dust in the upper center of the frame.', '2004-12-01 01:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039773, 125012, 20925, '<td valign="top">i like the effect.  is it a double exposure in camera?  the 7 of spades card could be in sharper focus though.</td>', 'i like the effect.  is it a double exposure in camera?  the 7 of spades card could be in sharper focus though.', '2004-12-01 01:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039774, 125099, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like this idea; however, I think it would have been improved with a more three dimensional view of the box in the foreground.  Top down view is a little flat.</td>', 'I like this idea; however, I think it would have been improved with a more three dimensional view of the box in the foreground.  Top down view is a little flat.', '2004-12-01 01:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039775, 125056, 29849, '<td valign="top">Wow ... how''d you do that?  Very interesting photo!</td>', 'Wow ... how''d you do that?  Very interesting photo!', '2004-12-01 01:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039776, 124604, 20925, '<td valign="top">fun shot, but the texture of your wall is distracting.  one way to combat that is to get your subject farther away from the wall and use a shallower DoF to blur the texture away.</td>', 'fun shot, but the texture of your wall is distracting.  one way to combat that is to get your subject farther away from the wall and use a shallower DoF to blur the texture away.', '2004-12-01 01:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039778, 125122, 28108, '<td valign="top">Very clever and the composition is great! The only thing that I would like to see different, is the hole on the page... I think it would have added more depth. Good job! Another exemple that a good picture does''nt have to be complicated. The complexity should reside in the photographer''s approach, not the subject. Most time anyways... Nice, very nice.</td>', 'Very clever and the composition is great! The only thing that I would like to see different, is the hole on the page... I think it would have added more depth. Good job! Another exemple that a good picture does''nt have to be complicated. The complexity should reside in the photographer''s approach, not the subject. Most time anyways... Nice, very nice.', '2004-12-01 01:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
