(1039895, 125153, 23913, '<td valign="top">could''ve had better lighting and a better angle would''ve helped make it more intrusting.<br/> <br/>try palm facing out and foreward then put the cam. on a timer facing up at the tips of the fingres, focus it to infinity shooting up at a white surface, so u see all the braceletes from the bottom up on the rist.(if u followed any of that it may creat a more intrusting overall pic.)<br/> <br/>the key to all the stuff that i do (in the everyday object section) is to take shots from angles not commanly seen. if u can create new intrust in an oridnary itom ppl will suddenly be stuck looking at your shots.<br/> <br/>by the way this is a great idea just try to profect it more and more, u got a little to close w/the camera(out of focus in the center) and the lighting + flash created a bad shadow.-GL in the challenge and future.</td>', 'could''ve had better lighting and a better angle would''ve helped make it more intrusting. try palm facing out and foreward then put the cam. on a timer facing up at the tips of the fingres, focus it to infinity shooting up at a white surface, so u see all the braceletes from the bottom up on the rist.(if u followed any of that it may creat a more intrusting overall pic.) the key to all the stuff that i do (in the everyday object section) is to take shots from angles not commanly seen. if u can create new intrust in an oridnary itom ppl will suddenly be stuck looking at your shots. by the way this is a great idea just try to profect it more and more, u got a little to close w/the camera(out of focus in the center) and the lighting + flash created a bad shadow.-GL in the challenge and future.', '2004-12-01 02:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
