(1039950, 124197, 16648, '<td valign="top">Too small. Needs to be about 640 pixels on the long side. Ignore DPI. The next to last step is resize, then sharpen (USM maybe 150%, .3, 7) and then when you save it as a JPG you use the Quality setting (compression setting) to get to 147k or less in file size.</td>', 'Too small. Needs to be about 640 pixels on the long side. Ignore DPI. The next to last step is resize, then sharpen (USM maybe 150%, .3, 7) and then when you save it as a JPG you use the Quality setting (compression setting) to get to 147k or less in file size.', '2004-12-01 02:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
