(1039966, 125018, 16648, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but hte shot is abit hazy. Try USM 30/60/1. The front large pawn blows out a bit, butteh board and shadows pop and sparkle more. If done to a layer you can blend it back with 50% or so opacity to reduce hte blow out. tought to fix that under basic editing rules.</td>', 'Nice idea, but hte shot is abit hazy. Try USM 30/60/1. The front large pawn blows out a bit, butteh board and shadows pop and sparkle more. If done to a layer you can blend it back with 50% or so opacity to reduce hte blow out. tought to fix that under basic editing rules.', '2004-12-01 02:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1039967, 123608, 20925, '<td valign="top">i like the sepia, but the foreground seems a little dark and oversharpened.</td>', 'i like the sepia, but the foreground seems a little dark and oversharpened.', '2004-12-01 02:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
