(1040008, 124765, 24970, '<td valign="top">Wow. Were they like that, or did you place them? Either way, it really works. A tiny bit washed out, from here at least, but otherwise very nicely done.</td>', 'Wow. Were they like that, or did you place them? Either way, it really works. A tiny bit washed out, from here at least, but otherwise very nicely done.', '2004-12-01 02:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
