(1040299, 125189, 24183, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept, although I would like to see it with color, dark blue sky, and bright green grass.  The horses in the rear of the photo could have been a little closer to the f/g  If your not busy wait around for a bit to see some other patteren the horses will take, you may get the shot of a lifetime.</td>', 'This is a great concept, although I would like to see it with color, dark blue sky, and bright green grass.  The horses in the rear of the photo could have been a little closer to the f/g  If your not busy wait around for a bit to see some other patteren the horses will take, you may get the shot of a lifetime.', '2004-12-01 07:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040300, 125038, 29111, '<td valign="top">Creative indeed - Excellent idea, and I think the only one in this comp that has captured time</td>', 'Creative indeed - Excellent idea, and I think the only one in this comp that has captured time', '2004-12-01 07:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040302, 125140, 27767, '<td valign="top">This shot is sweet.  I love the simple black and white, and the complex refraction of the lines.  Very cool :)</td>', 'This shot is sweet.  I love the simple black and white, and the complex refraction of the lines.  Very cool :)', '2004-12-01 07:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040303, 124119, 24183, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting, although there is some digital noise, to the right middle.  Try using a lens hood to reduce this,</td>', 'Very nice lighting, although there is some digital noise, to the right middle.  Try using a lens hood to reduce this,', '2004-12-01 07:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040305, 124939, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice strong composition. The color feels off somehow. It might just me that I''m expecting to see a red lantern, and I''m seeing them orange. The crop on the lower left corner is also a bit tight for me. Last but not least the lighting on lantern #5 (from the left) is a bit hot. Not sure if this is accident or design. It''s just enough brighter that it draws my eyes to that point. Overall nice job!</td>', 'Nice strong composition. The color feels off somehow. It might just me that I''m expecting to see a red lantern, and I''m seeing them orange. The crop on the lower left corner is also a bit tight for me. Last but not least the lighting on lantern #5 (from the left) is a bit hot. Not sure if this is accident or design. It''s just enough brighter that it draws my eyes to that point. Overall nice job!', '2004-12-01 07:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040307, 124465, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and creative shot.  I like the extreme white background so the balls look to be floating.</td>', 'Very interesting and creative shot.  I like the extreme white background so the balls look to be floating.', '2004-12-01 07:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040308, 125074, 24183, '<td valign="top">Love the pattern, I think you should have through a spoon in there to brake up the pattern.  Maybe if the shot was directly overhead, with a more colorfull b/g  I like the lighting it fades from the lert to right nice.</td>', 'Love the pattern, I think you should have through a spoon in there to brake up the pattern.  Maybe if the shot was directly overhead, with a more colorfull b/g  I like the lighting it fades from the lert to right nice.', '2004-12-01 07:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040312, 123731, 24183, '<td valign="top">I think the pink chips will take away from this photo.  I don''t really know why.  Also maybe only 2 colors of dice, 6 white and 1 red, like a broken patteren</td>', 'I think the pink chips will take away from this photo.  I don''t really know why.  Also maybe only 2 colors of dice, 6 white and 1 red, like a broken patteren', '2004-12-01 07:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040314, 124897, 7560, '<td valign="top">I like the crop in this shot. The last tree on the right not being smack on the corner of your crop job is nice. Beautiful shot, and looks like a great day to play camera!</td>', 'I like the crop in this shot. The last tree on the right not being smack on the corner of your crop job is nice. Beautiful shot, and looks like a great day to play camera!', '2004-12-01 07:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040315, 124684, 24183, '<td valign="top">I do not see much that pops out at me, I like the DoF but I like color maybe if you had some side lighting it would inprove</td>', 'I do not see much that pops out at me, I like the DoF but I like color maybe if you had some side lighting it would inprove', '2004-12-01 07:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040316, 125025, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really like this silhouetted trunks against the silvery water.  I also like the dark top and bottom that create this 2 sided frame for the subjects.</td>', 'I really like this silhouetted trunks against the silvery water.  I also like the dark top and bottom that create this 2 sided frame for the subjects.', '2004-12-01 07:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040318, 125111, 29111, '<td valign="top">Good idea - a little hard to isolate your main subjects on the left, but a nice lineup anyway</td>', 'Good idea - a little hard to isolate your main subjects on the left, but a nice lineup anyway', '2004-12-01 07:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040319, 124770, 24183, '<td valign="top">I like the broken pattern, I would like to see the front of all the glasses somehow,  If you scaled down the lighting I think that would inprove it also, but still a nice photo</td>', 'I like the broken pattern, I would like to see the front of all the glasses somehow,  If you scaled down the lighting I think that would inprove it also, but still a nice photo', '2004-12-01 07:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040320, 124756, 7560, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of frame within a frame. I might have positioned the bowl a bit more centered, but it''s not overly distracting. I''d love to see this reshot with a nice set of chopsticks (mayve red?) and carefully measured out. This is a very cool shot! 9</td>', 'Excellent use of frame within a frame. I might have positioned the bowl a bit more centered, but it''s not overly distracting. I''d love to see this reshot with a nice set of chopsticks (mayve red?) and carefully measured out. This is a very cool shot! 9', '2004-12-01 07:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040321, 125043, 24183, '<td valign="top">Love the b/g, lighting is good, not to sure about the post editing to the color</td>', 'Love the b/g, lighting is good, not to sure about the post editing to the color', '2004-12-01 07:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040322, 124287, 29111, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and framing The rain brings out the rich earthy colours. Pity one horse has hidden his head - but ... you can a bring a horse to rain but you can''t make him pose :-)</td>', 'Nice composition and framing The rain brings out the rich earthy colours. Pity one horse has hidden his head - but ... you can a bring a horse to rain but you can''t make him pose :-)', '2004-12-01 07:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040323, 124655, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the DOF in this case is a bit too much. You loose drill bit #7 into the blur. I''d also like to see a slight rotation of the leading bit so I can read a bit more of the text.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the DOF in this case is a bit too much. You loose drill bit #7 into the blur. I''d also like to see a slight rotation of the leading bit so I can read a bit more of the text.', '2004-12-01 07:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040324, 125039, 24183, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I think you should use the curves featue in PS to bring out the original color, other than that ok</td>', 'Good shot, I think you should use the curves featue in PS to bring out the original color, other than that ok', '2004-12-01 07:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040326, 124048, 7560, '<td valign="top">No Asteroids? What''s up with that!  I miss my Atari...As for the shot, lighting is okay, but the use of your couch as the backdrop isn''t adding anything to the composition. It''s actually taking away a bit due to the seam. Very cool idea though.</td>', 'No Asteroids? What''s up with that!  I miss my Atari...As for the shot, lighting is okay, but the use of your couch as the backdrop isn''t adding anything to the composition. It''s actually taking away a bit due to the seam. Very cool idea though.', '2004-12-01 07:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040328, 124080, 24183, '<td valign="top">The dice around the center seem to be a little soft focused,  also try to scale down the lighting some,</td>', 'The dice around the center seem to be a little soft focused,  also try to scale down the lighting some,', '2004-12-01 07:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040329, 125209, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really like the lines leading right into the center of the goblets.  Great way to draw the viewer''s eye to the circle.  I also like the simple silver and black of the shot.</td>', 'I really like the lines leading right into the center of the goblets.  Great way to draw the viewer''s eye to the circle.  I also like the simple silver and black of the shot.', '2004-12-01 07:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040334, 125051, 24183, '<td valign="top">Great concept for the Holidays, I don''t see anything special, the b/g goes nice w/ the subject, the lighting on the faces seem a bit harsh, maybe try to soften the light up and it could inprove</td>', 'Great concept for the Holidays, I don''t see anything special, the b/g goes nice w/ the subject, the lighting on the faces seem a bit harsh, maybe try to soften the light up and it could inprove', '2004-12-01 07:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040336, 124339, 24183, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, like how your upside down, that cool, the only thing i see i dont like it that line going through your neck.</td>', 'Nice concept, like how your upside down, that cool, the only thing i see i dont like it that line going through your neck.', '2004-12-01 07:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040337, 124568, 27767, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning shot.  So beautiful and delicate.  It is a little hard to differentiate 7 beams of light, but I still really like this shot.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning shot.  So beautiful and delicate.  It is a little hard to differentiate 7 beams of light, but I still really like this shot.', '2004-12-01 07:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040339, 124080, 25355, '<td valign="top">Because of the bright light on it (I guess) my eye keeps getting drawn to the die on the left - and it''s not in focus!</td>', 'Because of the bright light on it (I guess) my eye keeps getting drawn to the die on the left - and it''s not in focus!', '2004-12-01 07:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040341, 124089, 27767, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors in this shot.  I like the sun peaking from behind the statue of liberty. Cranes aren''t that interesting, but the rest of the shot is.</td>', 'Lovely colors in this shot.  I like the sun peaking from behind the statue of liberty. Cranes aren''t that interesting, but the rest of the shot is.', '2004-12-01 07:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040345, 124137, 27767, '<td valign="top">Nice petals and good contrasting colors.  I like the texture of the background, and it is not too distracting.</td>', 'Nice petals and good contrasting colors.  I like the texture of the background, and it is not too distracting.', '2004-12-01 07:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040347, 123932, 24183, '<td valign="top">I think the dof is to shallow, I would love it if the ladybugs were bright red, it would contrast really well w/ the b/g</td>', 'I think the dof is to shallow, I would love it if the ladybugs were bright red, it would contrast really well w/ the b/g', '2004-12-01 07:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040353, 124438, 24183, '<td valign="top">It hurts my eye to try to look at the 7th pole</td>', 'It hurts my eye to try to look at the 7th pole', '2004-12-01 07:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040358, 123983, 24183, '<td valign="top">This will get rated low because of the size of the photo, if you are having trouble gettin the size down to 150k try reducing the quality'' and increasing the size, you will never notice the loos of quality</td>', 'This will get rated low because of the size of the photo, if you are having trouble gettin the size down to 150k try reducing the quality'' and increasing the size, you will never notice the loos of quality', '2004-12-01 07:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
