(1040618, 124771, 27845, '<td valign="top">The petals (?) don''t come out well enough against the backgound. You made a good use of the DOF, though. Either the back- or foreground should have been more colorful.<br/>I like that the petals form a seven. A slight rotation (10 degrees) would have made it clearer, though. I didn''t notice it right away.</td>', 'The petals (?) don''t come out well enough against the backgound. You made a good use of the DOF, though. Either the back- or foreground should have been more colorful.I like that the petals form a seven. A slight rotation (10 degrees) would have made it clearer, though. I didn''t notice it right away.', '2004-12-01 09:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040620, 124152, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Clean (non-speckled) eggs down the center.  The single piece of feather down is a nice touch.  The only thing I would have changed is to use a black prop (you can see the towel? which distracts a bit).</td>', 'Nice composition.  Clean (non-speckled) eggs down the center.  The single piece of feather down is a nice touch.  The only thing I would have changed is to use a black prop (you can see the towel? which distracts a bit).', '2004-12-01 09:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1040622, 125182, 27845, '<td valign="top">Uh, I can''t count to seven I guess. I see 6x2 bubbles in the foreground. I''m sure there are seven, but I can''t see them.<br/>Nice colors, I like the saturation and the contast between warm and cold colours. The reflections are cool, but there''s too many of them. You should have used fewer light sources. There''s some dust in the lower right corner, but you probably know about that already. Perhaps a narrower DOF would have made them vanish in the blur.</td>', 'Uh, I can''t count to seven I guess. I see 6x2 bubbles in the foreground. I''m sure there are seven, but I can''t see them.Nice colors, I like the saturation and the contast between warm and cold colours. The reflections are cool, but there''s too many of them. You should have used fewer light sources. There''s some dust in the lower right corner, but you probably know about that already. Perhaps a narrower DOF would have made them vanish in the blur.', '2004-12-01 09:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
