(1042415, 125194, 3080, '<td valign="top">The white spots all over kind of bug me a bit.  I like the concept of the photo, and it''s definately cute.  7 of the subject yup.  focus seems a little soft on the men, but hard to tell since they are silhouetted.  I haven''t figured out if I like the light or not, at first I thought it was a bit distracting, and then second thought felt that it drew the viewers eyes to the hand and broken arm.  Overall creative interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'The white spots all over kind of bug me a bit.  I like the concept of the photo, and it''s definately cute.  7 of the subject yup.  focus seems a little soft on the men, but hard to tell since they are silhouetted.  I haven''t figured out if I like the light or not, at first I thought it was a bit distracting, and then second thought felt that it drew the viewers eyes to the hand and broken arm.  Overall creative interpretation of the challenge.', '2004-12-01 22:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
