(1042422, 125151, 3080, '<td valign="top">Lots of 7s here.  I do like how there are 7 dominoes, but the first 3 also total up to 7.  I think I would prefer there to be a bit more light on the fronts of the donimoes. I think that would make the color punch better.  One thing I really admire about this shot, is that although we don''t see much of the horizontal line in the back, it is perfectly level.  Nothing bugs me more than non horizontal, horizontal lines.  Creative interpretation of the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'Lots of 7s here.  I do like how there are 7 dominoes, but the first 3 also total up to 7.  I think I would prefer there to be a bit more light on the fronts of the donimoes. I think that would make the color punch better.  One thing I really admire about this shot, is that although we don''t see much of the horizontal line in the back, it is perfectly level.  Nothing bugs me more than non horizontal, horizontal lines.  Creative interpretation of the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042424, 125147, 22479, '<td valign="top">Yes there are seven guards here but the overall photo quality is dismal. Perhaps it was an artistic touch, but it doesn''t work for me because it looks raw and sloppy. For example, the 7th stake at the far right has white artifacts near the left tip. Sorry.</td>', 'Yes there are seven guards here but the overall photo quality is dismal. Perhaps it was an artistic touch, but it doesn''t work for me because it looks raw and sloppy. For example, the 7th stake at the far right has white artifacts near the left tip. Sorry.', '2004-12-01 22:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
