(1042428, 124897, 3080, '<td valign="top">lol...7 lovely trees.  the sky background is good, nothing distracting there.  focus is ok despite the wind, maybe just a little soft.  I like the green on blue.  I wish the trees were all level with each other, but not your fault. lol.  Overall interesting for the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'lol...7 lovely trees.  the sky background is good, nothing distracting there.  focus is ok despite the wind, maybe just a little soft.  I like the green on blue.  I wish the trees were all level with each other, but not your fault. lol.  Overall interesting for the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042429, 123983, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but this image is too small. Resize submissions to 600-640 on the long edge. Better luck next time around. You had a good idea here but hampered by bad execution.</td>', 'Nice try, but this image is too small. Resize submissions to 600-640 on the long edge. Better luck next time around. You had a good idea here but hampered by bad execution.', '2004-12-01 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042430, 125208, 20539, '<td valign="top">like the feel and softness, but it seems a tod overexposed digitally... a darker version might  work better.</td>', 'like the feel and softness, but it seems a tod overexposed digitally... a darker version might  work better.', '2004-12-01 22:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042432, 124197, 22479, '<td valign="top">Resize to 600-640 pixels on the long side, for all your future submissions, if possible. I think you had an interesting scene here but the image is too small to make out clear details on what''s going on.</td>', 'Resize to 600-640 pixels on the long side, for all your future submissions, if possible. I think you had an interesting scene here but the image is too small to make out clear details on what''s going on.', '2004-12-01 22:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042434, 125185, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very soft focus.  I think that with the 7 being the very first thing we look at...it should be in focus.  The lighting is good.  I like how the 7 is lit, but the rest is darkened.  the red also looks good with the cards.  angle and cropping are ok.  good idea, just needs more focus. ~Heather~</td>', 'Very soft focus.  I think that with the 7 being the very first thing we look at...it should be in focus.  The lighting is good.  I like how the 7 is lit, but the rest is darkened.  the red also looks good with the cards.  angle and cropping are ok.  good idea, just needs more focus. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042435, 125204, 20539, '<td valign="top">nicely done. very clever. 9 for originality</td>', 'nicely done. very clever. 9 for originality', '2004-12-01 22:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042439, 125147, 3080, '<td valign="top">You definatley have 7 of the subject.  The background is disturbing to me though, not sure if you used a filter, or over sharpened or what, but I don''t like the white/blue mess behind the subjects.  The subjects are ok, but I''m not jumping out of my seat with excitement.  focus and clarity are ok, and placement within the photo is alright too. ~Heather~</td>', 'You definatley have 7 of the subject.  The background is disturbing to me though, not sure if you used a filter, or over sharpened or what, but I don''t like the white/blue mess behind the subjects.  The subjects are ok, but I''m not jumping out of my seat with excitement.  focus and clarity are ok, and placement within the photo is alright too. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042442, 124724, 3080, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I like your choice of DOF here.  The front guy is way too out of focus for my personal taste.  The white specks all over the table around the group are distracting and so are the little light glares on the red gummies.  I like the idea, it''s cute, but I think that it needs a little tidy-ing up. ~Heather~</td>', 'I don''t think I like your choice of DOF here.  The front guy is way too out of focus for my personal taste.  The white specks all over the table around the group are distracting and so are the little light glares on the red gummies.  I like the idea, it''s cute, but I think that it needs a little tidy-ing up. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042444, 124448, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately 7.  I like the crop and placement of the subjects within the photo.  Very nice use of negative space.  I realize this is in the fog, but the fog makes it look all out of focus to me, and I think I wish we could have sharper focus.  Although the fog makes it interesting, so I''m not quite sure how to accomplish that.  Overall nice find! ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately 7.  I like the crop and placement of the subjects within the photo.  Very nice use of negative space.  I realize this is in the fog, but the fog makes it look all out of focus to me, and I think I wish we could have sharper focus.  Although the fog makes it interesting, so I''m not quite sure how to accomplish that.  Overall nice find! ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042447, 125039, 3080, '<td valign="top">Fitting for this challenge!  Not the most exciting photo, but it works.  I like the background color.  not typical and that makes it interesting.  focus and clarity seem ok, and although I wish there were a bit more light on the birdies themselves, I don''t think that would be possible without hurting some other aspect of the photo.  Overall nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'Fitting for this challenge!  Not the most exciting photo, but it works.  I like the background color.  not typical and that makes it interesting.  focus and clarity seem ok, and although I wish there were a bit more light on the birdies themselves, I don''t think that would be possible without hurting some other aspect of the photo.  Overall nice. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042451, 123988, 10268, '<td valign="top">Interesting to say the least.  I''m not sure how much I really like it, but I''m going to give you a 7 and come back to this later.</td>', 'Interesting to say the least.  I''m not sure how much I really like it, but I''m going to give you a 7 and come back to this later.', '2004-12-01 22:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042458, 124881, 23614, '<td valign="top">I`m not quite sure I can count the seven, but I really like this photo!</td>', 'I`m not quite sure I can count the seven, but I really like this photo!', '2004-12-01 22:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042462, 124499, 21171, '<td valign="top">The fractal reflections are mesmerizing - great shot.  The background is a little too distracting for me. Overall -very good!</td>', 'The fractal reflections are mesmerizing - great shot.  The background is a little too distracting for me. Overall -very good!', '2004-12-01 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042464, 125023, 3080, '<td valign="top">this is cute.  focus seems quite soft, and I think the crop is a bit close to the guy on the right, but probably to remove an 8th pelican?  Lighitng on the pelican closest to the camera seems a bit harsh, but not much you can do about that.  I wonder how this would have done with a crop to show just the pelicans.  a panoramic type crop.  I think that might have cut out some background noise and draw more attention to the birds.  Cute. ~Heather~</td>', 'this is cute.  focus seems quite soft, and I think the crop is a bit close to the guy on the right, but probably to remove an 8th pelican?  Lighitng on the pelican closest to the camera seems a bit harsh, but not much you can do about that.  I wonder how this would have done with a crop to show just the pelicans.  a panoramic type crop.  I think that might have cut out some background noise and draw more attention to the birds.  Cute. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042469, 124125, 23614, '<td valign="top">I love the mix of sky and snow!</td>', 'I love the mix of sky and snow!', '2004-12-01 22:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042472, 125189, 23614, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I like the natural setting. A bit too soft on some trees, but very good overall</td>', 'Very well done. I like the natural setting. A bit too soft on some trees, but very good overall', '2004-12-01 22:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042476, 124822, 3080, '<td valign="top">Focus seems generally soft in this shot.  I like it.. nice colors.  I like the orange on black.  I''m not sure the border helps at all, but oh well.  Definately a creative take on the challenge.  interesting choice of subject and nice layout.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Focus seems generally soft in this shot.  I like it.. nice colors.  I like the orange on black.  I''m not sure the border helps at all, but oh well.  Definately a creative take on the challenge.  interesting choice of subject and nice layout.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042481, 124438, 26151, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but the ships seem more like the subject to me than the poles.  But there are 7 of them.</td>', 'Nice photo, but the ships seem more like the subject to me than the poles.  But there are 7 of them.', '2004-12-01 22:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042486, 125120, 3080, '<td valign="top">These are cute.  I like the color of orange on black.  Very nice focus and clarity and your set up is cute too.  lighitng is good as well.  I have nothing to complain about.  my only reason for not scoring a 10, is the visual impact, while it is technically a great photo, it just isn''t making me jump out of my seat.  definately a nice photo though. ~Heather~</td>', 'These are cute.  I like the color of orange on black.  Very nice focus and clarity and your set up is cute too.  lighitng is good as well.  I have nothing to complain about.  my only reason for not scoring a 10, is the visual impact, while it is technically a great photo, it just isn''t making me jump out of my seat.  definately a nice photo though. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042487, 125074, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like this.  After looking long and hard at this, I think it will be my first 10.  Very nice.  focus and clarity are great, set up is very nice.  angle and framing/cropping are great.  lighting is what makes the photo though.  I really think you did a wonderful job with this shot. I wish you luck in the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like this.  After looking long and hard at this, I think it will be my first 10.  Very nice.  focus and clarity are great, set up is very nice.  angle and framing/cropping are great.  lighting is what makes the photo though.  I really think you did a wonderful job with this shot. I wish you luck in the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042488, 123912, 3080, '<td valign="top">Seems like an odd set of balls.  Aren''t the 11 and 12 suposed to be striped?  hmm.  I think the double 7 is cute, 7 balls, one of which IS a 7.  I don''t like the lighting.  makes for too many shadows and I think the focus seems just a tad soft, but wonder if that''s cause of the lighting.  interesting.</td>', 'Seems like an odd set of balls.  Aren''t the 11 and 12 suposed to be striped?  hmm.  I think the double 7 is cute, 7 balls, one of which IS a 7.  I don''t like the lighting.  makes for too many shadows and I think the focus seems just a tad soft, but wonder if that''s cause of the lighting.  interesting.', '2004-12-01 22:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042490, 123608, 26151, '<td valign="top">I like the photo. You never think of cologne bottles in the outdoors like that. This would make a good ad for cologne. The desaturation works too, but I think the bottles could have used a little more focus. Unless that''s what you were going for. And you probably could have left out the "7" from the title.</td>', 'I like the photo. You never think of cologne bottles in the outdoors like that. This would make a good ad for cologne. The desaturation works too, but I think the bottles could have used a little more focus. Unless that''s what you were going for. And you probably could have left out the "7" from the title.', '2004-12-01 22:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042491, 124180, 3080, '<td valign="top">Seems to be some strange reddish marks on each of the clips.  I am wondering if makeing this black and white would have helped there.  I don''t like the redish marks on the clips, so that would have taken care of my biggest problem with the shot, and not really taken anything bad away, since it''s practically black and white anyway.  I like the set up, and the angle and framing/cropping are good.  Lighting seem a little bright in spots, but overall ok.  The border works here. ~Heather~</td>', 'Seems to be some strange reddish marks on each of the clips.  I am wondering if makeing this black and white would have helped there.  I don''t like the redish marks on the clips, so that would have taken care of my biggest problem with the shot, and not really taken anything bad away, since it''s practically black and white anyway.  I like the set up, and the angle and framing/cropping are good.  Lighting seem a little bright in spots, but overall ok.  The border works here. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042492, 124127, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like it!  I like the background especially with the subjects.  Some matching colors, but not distracting at all, kind of makes the pic flow well.  I like the set up of the shoes, and your focus and clarity are really good.  I''m not sure how I feel about the shadows.  Sometimes I think they''re good, and sometimes I think they are a distraction.  I can''t make up my mind like that. oh well.  still a nice shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like it!  I like the background especially with the subjects.  Some matching colors, but not distracting at all, kind of makes the pic flow well.  I like the set up of the shoes, and your focus and clarity are really good.  I''m not sure how I feel about the shadows.  Sometimes I think they''re good, and sometimes I think they are a distraction.  I can''t make up my mind like that. oh well.  still a nice shot. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 22:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042494, 124296, 26151, '<td valign="top">Very nice, subtle seven. Not in your face seven. And I''m glad you didn''t put "seven" in the title. Might as well give you a seven.</td>', 'Very nice, subtle seven. Not in your face seven. And I''m glad you didn''t put "seven" in the title. Might as well give you a seven.', '2004-12-01 22:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042495, 123892, 3080, '<td valign="top">Sure is cute...but there definately are not 7 of them.  Did you enter this into the wrong challenge?  I sometimes have to wonder about people.  Did you accidently think that there were 7 droplets in the photo?  Even your title is singular, indicating a single subject.  Forgive me if I''m missing the other 6 droplets in the photo, but I have looked and looked and I cannot find any way to relate this to the challenge, which was to take a photo where there are 7 of your subject.  The photo itself is interesting, it really is.  I like the clouds, and the drop is cool, sorry for the low score, but doesnt meet the challenge at all.</td>', 'Sure is cute...but there definately are not 7 of them.  Did you enter this into the wrong challenge?  I sometimes have to wonder about people.  Did you accidently think that there were 7 droplets in the photo?  Even your title is singular, indicating a single subject.  Forgive me if I''m missing the other 6 droplets in the photo, but I have looked and looked and I cannot find any way to relate this to the challenge, which was to take a photo where there are 7 of your subject.  The photo itself is interesting, it really is.  I like the clouds, and the drop is cool, sorry for the low score, but doesnt meet the challenge at all.', '2004-12-01 22:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042496, 125204, 3080, '<td valign="top">You  know...after seeing the validation request, I tried this, and it''s really hard! lol.  So I give you props there.  Definately a cute shot.  really fitting to the challenge.  focus and clarity are great, angle and framing/cropping are great, and lighting is great minus a few small shadows that are noticable, but not distracting.  Nice take on the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'You  know...after seeing the validation request, I tried this, and it''s really hard! lol.  So I give you props there.  Definately a cute shot.  really fitting to the challenge.  focus and clarity are great, angle and framing/cropping are great, and lighting is great minus a few small shadows that are noticable, but not distracting.  Nice take on the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042498, 124266, 3080, '<td valign="top">Did you take this in negative mode?  Or apply negative after the fact?  Something seems really weird about the feel of the photo, and I am not quite sure I like it at all.  focus and clarity seem ok, hard to tell really.  lighting also seems ok.  the arrangement is interesting, but I''m just not feeling the photo. ~Heather~</td>', 'Did you take this in negative mode?  Or apply negative after the fact?  Something seems really weird about the feel of the photo, and I am not quite sure I like it at all.  focus and clarity seem ok, hard to tell really.  lighting also seems ok.  the arrangement is interesting, but I''m just not feeling the photo. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042501, 123988, 18197, '<td valign="top">Minimalist! Actually a little too much so to hold my interest.</td>', 'Minimalist! Actually a little too much so to hold my interest.', '2004-12-01 23:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042502, 124777, 3080, '<td valign="top">hehe..the little guy on the bottom left is the cutest.  definately 7 of your subject, I''m suprised how many people screwed that part of the challenge up. lol  this isn''t something I''d personally hang on my wall, but it is done very nicely.  the crop and lighting are good, and focus is good as well.  this is a fun shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'hehe..the little guy on the bottom left is the cutest.  definately 7 of your subject, I''m suprised how many people screwed that part of the challenge up. lol  this isn''t something I''d personally hang on my wall, but it is done very nicely.  the crop and lighting are good, and focus is good as well.  this is a fun shot. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
