(1042506, 124827, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot, and I like the color choices and expecially the reflections. Very interesting DOF. Would love to see it with all the dice razor sharp, too.</td>', 'I like the idea a lot, and I like the color choices and expecially the reflections. Very interesting DOF. Would love to see it with all the dice razor sharp, too.', '2004-12-01 23:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042507, 125109, 24970, '<td valign="top">This is a very soft-feeling picture, I like it. Well lit, well composed. Nice job.</td>', 'This is a very soft-feeling picture, I like it. Well lit, well composed. Nice job.', '2004-12-01 23:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042509, 125198, 21171, '<td valign="top">I think the background is too distracting. Otherwise - good idea and execution.</td>', 'I think the background is too distracting. Otherwise - good idea and execution.', '2004-12-01 23:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042510, 125189, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo.  I like the feel of it.  If I HAD to complain about something it would be that the subjects are awefully small.  Feels more like a landscape, which doesn''t generally have a ''subject'', rather a scene.  I still think you met the challenge, and it is a lovely scene.  lack of color is also nice in this photo.  I like the black and white horses standing next to each other in the back. ~Heather~</td>', 'This is a very nice photo.  I like the feel of it.  If I HAD to complain about something it would be that the subjects are awefully small.  Feels more like a landscape, which doesn''t generally have a ''subject'', rather a scene.  I still think you met the challenge, and it is a lovely scene.  lack of color is also nice in this photo.  I like the black and white horses standing next to each other in the back. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042511, 125018, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good idea and reasonably well composed. Focus seems a littl soft for my taste. Maybe because it''s because I am struggling with really sharp focus, but I seem to prefer it at the moment. In any event, hope this does well. It''s a worthy shot.</td>', 'Good idea and reasonably well composed. Focus seems a littl soft for my taste. Maybe because it''s because I am struggling with really sharp focus, but I seem to prefer it at the moment. In any event, hope this does well. It''s a worthy shot.', '2004-12-01 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042514, 125095, 3080, '<td valign="top">sweet.  I like it!  and you got all 7 colors in the rainbow.  most people leave out the second shade of purple and it irritates me. lol. focus and clarity are awesome.  I like the setup and lighting is good as well.  overall a very nice shot, and good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'sweet.  I like it!  and you got all 7 colors in the rainbow.  most people leave out the second shade of purple and it irritates me. lol. focus and clarity are awesome.  I like the setup and lighting is good as well.  overall a very nice shot, and good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042515, 125198, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the sharp focus and great capture of the reflections. Photographing something highly reflective like this is among the most difficult subjects because you are photographing the reflections, not the objects themselves. Great job. The arrange ment of the spoons is just off alignment with the borders, which helps the composition. I am generally not a border fan but this one works. Good job.</td>', 'Love the sharp focus and great capture of the reflections. Photographing something highly reflective like this is among the most difficult subjects because you are photographing the reflections, not the objects themselves. Great job. The arrange ment of the spoons is just off alignment with the borders, which helps the composition. I am generally not a border fan but this one works. Good job.', '2004-12-01 23:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042517, 125135, 18197, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge. Nice arrangement of theheads. Well focused. Background could be brought up a bit without hurting the main subject and it would add a bit more interest possibly.</td>', 'Meets the challenge. Nice arrangement of theheads. Well focused. Background could be brought up a bit without hurting the main subject and it would add a bit more interest possibly.', '2004-12-01 23:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042518, 125046, 3080, '<td valign="top">There definately are 7 stripes, but I''m quite sure I feel that the stripes are your main subject.  The main subject to me feels like the entire flag, and that would put you in the mind to expect 7 flags, but I am not too picky, so I get your point. lol.  Just an observation really.  The background is kind of bland, but that''s not all bad because then there is nothing distracting there either.  Focus seems ok. ~Heather~</td>', 'There definately are 7 stripes, but I''m quite sure I feel that the stripes are your main subject.  The main subject to me feels like the entire flag, and that would put you in the mind to expect 7 flags, but I am not too picky, so I get your point. lol.  Just an observation really.  The background is kind of bland, but that''s not all bad because then there is nothing distracting there either.  Focus seems ok. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042519, 124230, 24970, '<td valign="top">For me, it works that not all of the pieces are fully in focus. Pleasing color combination and lighting scheme.</td>', 'For me, it works that not all of the pieces are fully in focus. Pleasing color combination and lighting scheme.', '2004-12-01 23:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042520, 124924, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well, there are 7 of them. Well enough executed technically. But the subject doesn''t hold my interest. What are you trying to convey to me? If you could include something inthe frame that asks or answers a question, its appeal would go up for me.</td>', 'Well, there are 7 of them. Well enough executed technically. But the subject doesn''t hold my interest. What are you trying to convey to me? If you could include something inthe frame that asks or answers a question, its appeal would go up for me.', '2004-12-01 23:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042525, 125118, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice snap. I can feel your herding instincts here. I think if you had used the entire 604 x 640 available to you, it would have been better by showing more clearly the kids expressions. Just my opinion.</td>', 'Nice snap. I can feel your herding instincts here. I think if you had used the entire 604 x 640 available to you, it would have been better by showing more clearly the kids expressions. Just my opinion.', '2004-12-01 23:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042531, 125092, 3080, '<td valign="top">5 and 2 halves technically. lol  I think it''s funny that the 1/2 goose on the lower left is cut off at about the same place as the 1/2 goose in the upper right.  I think that my biggest problem here is that there aren''t 7 full geese.  Not even 7 heads or 7 butts.  I wish that the goose in the upper right''s head wasn''t chopped off.  That bugs me a bit.  Otherwise though, its a nice shot.  I like the DOF and I like the angle at which you took the photo as well. ~Heather~</td>', '5 and 2 halves technically. lol  I think it''s funny that the 1/2 goose on the lower left is cut off at about the same place as the 1/2 goose in the upper right.  I think that my biggest problem here is that there aren''t 7 full geese.  Not even 7 heads or 7 butts.  I wish that the goose in the upper right''s head wasn''t chopped off.  That bugs me a bit.  Otherwise though, its a nice shot.  I like the DOF and I like the angle at which you took the photo as well. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042533, 124950, 28771, '<td valign="top">I like the the way the light gracefully oozes out of the darkness.</td>', 'I like the the way the light gracefully oozes out of the darkness.', '2004-12-01 23:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042534, 125142, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is a tough on. With the calibration on my monitor, I lose most of the leaves on the flower. It''s an amazing shot. I love the high key feel to it, and it''s very, very well done. But it''s not conveying the challenge topic. 6, because it''s just an amazingly beautiful image. I can''t wait to see a print of thise one.</td>', 'This is a tough on. With the calibration on my monitor, I lose most of the leaves on the flower. It''s an amazing shot. I love the high key feel to it, and it''s very, very well done. But it''s not conveying the challenge topic. 6, because it''s just an amazingly beautiful image. I can''t wait to see a print of thise one.', '2004-12-01 23:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042535, 124936, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked and looked at this trying to understand why it leaves me feeling flat. In the end, it looks more like a composite of 2 images rather than something shot from the camera. I am sure it''s the colors of the peppers but the colors make it look like the shadows are off. In the end, I guess I feel flat because it seems a bit unreal.  Sorry. Just an opinion.</td>', 'I''ve looked and looked at this trying to understand why it leaves me feeling flat. In the end, it looks more like a composite of 2 images rather than something shot from the camera. I am sure it''s the colors of the peppers but the colors make it look like the shadows are off. In the end, I guess I feel flat because it seems a bit unreal.  Sorry. Just an opinion.', '2004-12-01 23:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042536, 124246, 3080, '<td valign="top">I wish for this challenge that there were 7 distinct subjects.  looks like 2 kind of melt together into one.  It''s a real interesting shot though.  I do like it.  The lighting is perfect and framing/cropping are good as well.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I wish for this challenge that there were 7 distinct subjects.  looks like 2 kind of melt together into one.  It''s a real interesting shot though.  I do like it.  The lighting is perfect and framing/cropping are good as well.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042537, 125136, 25464, '<td valign="top">A very uncommon take on a very common item.  The complexity created by the reflections and arrangement is very interesting.  There is a slight discoloration in the lower right corner (no biggie, just noticed it.)  The only other thing that I see that keeps this from being a 10 in my books is the lettering on the backs of the forks, but not much you could do about that.  9.</td>', 'A very uncommon take on a very common item.  The complexity created by the reflections and arrangement is very interesting.  There is a slight discoloration in the lower right corner (no biggie, just noticed it.)  The only other thing that I see that keeps this from being a 10 in my books is the lettering on the backs of the forks, but not much you could do about that.  9.', '2004-12-01 23:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042538, 124295, 28771, '<td valign="top">That is something no one on this site would have thought of doing. That''s an accomplishment. It appears one is either lying in a pool of blood, or that''s a shadow. Entertaining photo, but needs sharpening and neatimage. (5)</td>', 'That is something no one on this site would have thought of doing. That''s an accomplishment. It appears one is either lying in a pool of blood, or that''s a shadow. Entertaining photo, but needs sharpening and neatimage. (5)', '2004-12-01 23:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042539, 124724, 18197, '<td valign="top">Difficult subject because of the texture and reflectivity of the (?) Gummy Bears. I would have scored it higher if it were all in sharp focus and possibly without the dust spects mid frame.</td>', 'Difficult subject because of the texture and reflectivity of the (?) Gummy Bears. I would have scored it higher if it were all in sharp focus and possibly without the dust spects mid frame.', '2004-12-01 23:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042540, 125192, 26151, '<td valign="top">Not to be negative about your photo, because it''s a good photo, and it''s not even a negative comment, but why do eyeglasses always make into a photo like this? I did it myself in another challenge. Every photo with books on a desk or table has to include eyeglasses. Again I''m not being negative, just wondering aloud.  Nice idea and composition. But like I''m starting to tell others, there''s no need to include "seven" in the title. In this case, "Books of Wisdom" would have more impact. We know it''s seven. There''s also some kind of weird blur going on with the words, especially with the "A" in Gandhi. At least on my screen.</td>', 'Not to be negative about your photo, because it''s a good photo, and it''s not even a negative comment, but why do eyeglasses always make into a photo like this? I did it myself in another challenge. Every photo with books on a desk or table has to include eyeglasses. Again I''m not being negative, just wondering aloud.  Nice idea and composition. But like I''m starting to tell others, there''s no need to include "seven" in the title. In this case, "Books of Wisdom" would have more impact. We know it''s seven. There''s also some kind of weird blur going on with the words, especially with the "A" in Gandhi. At least on my screen.', '2004-12-01 23:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042541, 124080, 3080, '<td valign="top">crazy dice.  I like the different shapes and colors.  definately 7 dice, and I like how each has a 7 on it.  very nice set up.  Focus seems a bit soft, I think I''d prefer if all of the dice were in focus.  That would be my personal preference. lighting seems good and crop/angle are good as well.  cute fun shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'crazy dice.  I like the different shapes and colors.  definately 7 dice, and I like how each has a 7 on it.  very nice set up.  Focus seems a bit soft, I think I''d prefer if all of the dice were in focus.  That would be my personal preference. lighting seems good and crop/angle are good as well.  cute fun shot. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042542, 125029, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good workman like photo with very good technical details. The subject doesn''t compel my interest.</td>', 'Good workman like photo with very good technical details. The subject doesn''t compel my interest.', '2004-12-01 23:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042544, 123962, 25464, '<td valign="top">I have to say this is lovely.  Very simple, but lovely.  It might have added a wee bit more punch if the white background had been a contrasting color, but that doesn''t detract from this image.  Just a suggestion.  9.</td>', 'I have to say this is lovely.  Very simple, but lovely.  It might have added a wee bit more punch if the white background had been a contrasting color, but that doesn''t detract from this image.  Just a suggestion.  9.', '2004-12-01 23:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
