(1042566, 125011, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing 7 of something.  I''m afraid I must be missing the point really.  The shot in itself is a little confusing, look like it was taken and flipped upside down or something.  lighting is dark and poor and focus is soft in many places, actually, I''m not really finding a sharp focus anywhere.  I''m sorry that I''m not getting it, but the shot also just doesn''t appeal to me. Sorry. ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m not seeing 7 of something.  I''m afraid I must be missing the point really.  The shot in itself is a little confusing, look like it was taken and flipped upside down or something.  lighting is dark and poor and focus is soft in many places, actually, I''m not really finding a sharp focus anywhere.  I''m sorry that I''m not getting it, but the shot also just doesn''t appeal to me. Sorry. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042567, 125098, 28771, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what''s seveny in this photo. I''m guessing the little girl? You''re going to get hammered for this my friend. I think its a rather good photo, good sense of action, and the texture and color of the horses is perfect.  (6)</td>', 'I don''t know what''s seveny in this photo. I''m guessing the little girl? You''re going to get hammered for this my friend. I think its a rather good photo, good sense of action, and the texture and color of the horses is perfect.  (6)', '2004-12-01 23:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
