(1042613, 124438, 18197, '<td valign="top">Photo meets the challenge but offers little to hold my interest, or deliver an emotional payload. Technically, the details are all in order. For me it comes down to a weak subject. Just my opinion.</td>', 'Photo meets the challenge but offers little to hold my interest, or deliver an emotional payload. Technically, the details are all in order. For me it comes down to a weak subject. Just my opinion.', '2004-12-01 23:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042615, 124436, 18197, '<td valign="top">I live on a lake and love watching water birds. These are nice but the photo would be better if the whites weren''t blown out. I''m not sure if it was overexposed at the start or the result of post processing, but if it were me, I''d back down on it a bit.</td>', 'I live on a lake and love watching water birds. These are nice but the photo would be better if the whites weren''t blown out. I''m not sure if it was overexposed at the start or the result of post processing, but if it were me, I''d back down on it a bit.', '2004-12-01 23:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042616, 125011, 27847, '<td valign="top">Intriguing shot and I''m sure you got plenty of people telling you that this doesn''t fit the challenge, even though it does. I see 7 main subjects in this shot, but I''m not sure if all the voters have the patience to analyze the shot. Also, I''m not sure if it was done intentionally but the shot works a lot better if it was turned around. Yes, I had to flip my laptop around ;-) Hmmm, the knife though...</td>', 'Intriguing shot and I''m sure you got plenty of people telling you that this doesn''t fit the challenge, even though it does. I see 7 main subjects in this shot, but I''m not sure if all the voters have the patience to analyze the shot. Also, I''m not sure if it was done intentionally but the shot works a lot better if it was turned around. Yes, I had to flip my laptop around ;-) Hmmm, the knife though...', '2004-12-01 23:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042617, 123753, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo despite the fact that they''re are not 7 of your subject.  I like the look of the snow falling, gives it this kind of painted feel.  But were you thinking there were 7 branches?  I don''t think that enough of the one branch shows to really count it as a ''main subject''.  I do love the shot though. ~Heather~</td>', 'This is an interesting photo despite the fact that they''re are not 7 of your subject.  I like the look of the snow falling, gives it this kind of painted feel.  But were you thinking there were 7 branches?  I don''t think that enough of the one branch shows to really count it as a ''main subject''.  I do love the shot though. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042618, 124952, 27847, '<td valign="top">Any of them hatch yet? Great photo, love the usage of the light very soft but powerful.</td>', 'Any of them hatch yet? Great photo, love the usage of the light very soft but powerful.', '2004-12-01 23:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042621, 124339, 3080, '<td valign="top">Probably really hard to get the glass in focus, but I wish you could have gotten better focus on the panes of glass.  I think the subject is interesting, and I like the reflection.  lighting is a bit dull.  I''m wondering if there could have been a better angle or different crop you could have used.  seems too centered to me.  interesting take on the challenge though.  creative. ~Heather~</td>', 'Probably really hard to get the glass in focus, but I wish you could have gotten better focus on the panes of glass.  I think the subject is interesting, and I like the reflection.  lighting is a bit dull.  I''m wondering if there could have been a better angle or different crop you could have used.  seems too centered to me.  interesting take on the challenge though.  creative. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042622, 124302, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like this image. Very retro.</td>', 'I like this image. Very retro.', '2004-12-01 23:52:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1042623, 123933, 18197, '<td valign="top">I have internalized a classic DPC style with patent-pending elements: over saturated, over smoothed, and including the exclusive DPC water droplet. You have shown me the platonicly perfect example. And in spite of all that, I like it. It ought to do well in the voting if voters hold to form.</td>', 'I have internalized a classic DPC style with patent-pending elements: over saturated, over smoothed, and including the exclusive DPC water droplet. You have shown me the platonicly perfect example. And in spite of all that, I like it. It ought to do well in the voting if voters hold to form.', '2004-12-01 23:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042628, 124499, 18197, '<td valign="top">Super super reflections and composition and focus and DOF and .... They are so good I can overlook the weak background. Hope this ribbons.</td>', 'Super super reflections and composition and focus and DOF and .... They are so good I can overlook the weak background. Hope this ribbons.', '2004-12-01 23:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042629, 124432, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very colorful 7 we have here, used up the whole light spectrum here. Creative, now if only it was in order (red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, and violet)... just kidding ... good work.</td>', 'Very colorful 7 we have here, used up the whole light spectrum here. Creative, now if only it was in order (red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, and violet)... just kidding ... good work.', '2004-12-01 23:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042630, 125136, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is definately cool and interesting.  Actually I love it.  I love the color, your focus and clarity are really good and the angle and framing/cropping are also great.  I wonder though if people will count the reflections as part of your 7?  I know what you mean though.  lol ~Heather~</td>', 'This is definately cool and interesting.  Actually I love it.  I love the color, your focus and clarity are really good and the angle and framing/cropping are also great.  I wonder though if people will count the reflections as part of your 7?  I know what you mean though.  lol ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042632, 124505, 27847, '<td valign="top">Good work on this, the only thing I might have changed is the shadow from the window. Just doesn''t work, it distracts from the actual subject.</td>', 'Good work on this, the only thing I might have changed is the shadow from the window. Just doesn''t work, it distracts from the actual subject.', '2004-12-01 23:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042633, 125203, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like a night light.  Love the colors.  I think this fits the challenge nicely, and its overall appealing.  I think the background works well with the shot due to the color, and nothing distracting there.  focus and clarity seem alright as well. ~Heather~</td>', 'Looks like a night light.  Love the colors.  I think this fits the challenge nicely, and its overall appealing.  I think the background works well with the shot due to the color, and nothing distracting there.  focus and clarity seem alright as well. ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042634, 124061, 3080, '<td valign="top">interesting in a kind of creepy way.  not sure what this is, but there appears to definately be 7 of them. lol.  I like the angle, definately gives it a creative twist.  The black and white I think adds to the creepyness of the shot.  seems like something you''d see in kansas, although I have no clue what they are, and I''ve never been to kansas, just has a kansas kind of feel I think.  just ignore me.  nice shot! ~Heather~</td>', 'interesting in a kind of creepy way.  not sure what this is, but there appears to definately be 7 of them. lol.  I like the angle, definately gives it a creative twist.  The black and white I think adds to the creepyness of the shot.  seems like something you''d see in kansas, although I have no clue what they are, and I''ve never been to kansas, just has a kansas kind of feel I think.  just ignore me.  nice shot! ~Heather~', '2004-12-01 23:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042637, 124937, 3080, '<td valign="top">I can definatley see that there are 7, but it is not very clear that there are 7.  kind of have to do a bit of hunding there for that 7th one (the middle blueish color).  I like the texture of this photo and the colors are very nice as well.  I like how you added the needle, I think it would feel incomplete with out that somehow.  focus and clarity are also very good.  Nice shot.  creative twist on the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'I can definatley see that there are 7, but it is not very clear that there are 7.  kind of have to do a bit of hunding there for that 7th one (the middle blueish color).  I like the texture of this photo and the colors are very nice as well.  I like how you added the needle, I think it would feel incomplete with out that somehow.  focus and clarity are also very good.  Nice shot.  creative twist on the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-02 00:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042640, 124843, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well, you came a mile from hitting the purpose of the challenge in my opinion.  The challenge states "take a photograph which contains exactly seven of the main subject"  is the main subjec the 7?  if so, you would need 7 7''s in order to meet the challenge.  the girl? same thing.  Actually, I can''t find 7 of anything here.  The shot is sort of interesting.  I don''t quite understand it, but I like the color.  But complete challenge miss. ~Heather~</td>', 'Well, you came a mile from hitting the purpose of the challenge in my opinion.  The challenge states "take a photograph which contains exactly seven of the main subject"  is the main subjec the 7?  if so, you would need 7 7''s in order to meet the challenge.  the girl? same thing.  Actually, I can''t find 7 of anything here.  The shot is sort of interesting.  I don''t quite understand it, but I like the color.  But complete challenge miss. ~Heather~', '2004-12-02 00:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042642, 123701, 3080, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems really off here.  I think the shadows are distracting and the dots in the center of the candies right on the S are distracting as well.  The blue hue doesn''t work for me, and focus seems soft as well.  overall, the image just doesn''t appeal to me.  it''s a cute idea for the challenge, and I like the negetive space to the right, but just not pulling me in. ~Heather~</td>', 'Lighting seems really off here.  I think the shadows are distracting and the dots in the center of the candies right on the S are distracting as well.  The blue hue doesn''t work for me, and focus seems soft as well.  overall, the image just doesn''t appeal to me.  it''s a cute idea for the challenge, and I like the negetive space to the right, but just not pulling me in. ~Heather~', '2004-12-02 00:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042645, 124518, 26756, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  I''ll take your word for it that there are seven steps.  Difficult to make out.  Great light.</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  I''ll take your word for it that there are seven steps.  Difficult to make out.  Great light.', '2004-12-02 00:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042647, 124201, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I think this is nicely laid out, focus is good, and it''s a cute, fun shot.  I think the border is rediculous though. lol.  The lighting is casting some distracting shadows, maintly from the pencils that are raised up off the background.  I think you picked nice colors for the pencils.  They go well together and I like that.  Vey nice shot.  definatley creative and fun for the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like it.  I think this is nicely laid out, focus is good, and it''s a cute, fun shot.  I think the border is rediculous though. lol.  The lighting is casting some distracting shadows, maintly from the pencils that are raised up off the background.  I think you picked nice colors for the pencils.  They go well together and I like that.  Vey nice shot.  definatley creative and fun for the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-02 00:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042650, 124252, 26756, '<td valign="top">A shallower dof would have helped this photo in my opinion.  With the buildings in the background being so clear, my eyes are drifting towards them and away from your subjects.</td>', 'A shallower dof would have helped this photo in my opinion.  With the buildings in the background being so clear, my eyes are drifting towards them and away from your subjects.', '2004-12-02 00:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042651, 124279, 3080, '<td valign="top">Why yes, yes there are.  7 pillars.  Your going to hate me cause of this, but the background is bugging me.  see...in the first few to the left, there is a black space between each pillar, and then it kind of gets off spaced..then there''s a door, and then a black space between the last 2 pillars to the right.  This bugs my Obsessive Compulsive side, and sorry.  I think your focus and clarity are great and lighting is great and I like the black and white.  The angle and framing/cropping are really good.  love the dramatic angle you took it at.  those darn squares are buggin me though. lol still very nice find, and good take on the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'Why yes, yes there are.  7 pillars.  Your going to hate me cause of this, but the background is bugging me.  see...in the first few to the left, there is a black space between each pillar, and then it kind of gets off spaced..then there''s a door, and then a black space between the last 2 pillars to the right.  This bugs my Obsessive Compulsive side, and sorry.  I think your focus and clarity are great and lighting is great and I like the black and white.  The angle and framing/cropping are really good.  love the dramatic angle you took it at.  those darn squares are buggin me though. lol still very nice find, and good take on the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-02 00:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042662, 125075, 29945, '<td valign="top">Very nice rainbow..I was a the other end of it today here in Rhode Island..It was beautiful. (there was a rainbow this afternoon here) Gave you a 10...(:</td>', 'Very nice rainbow..I was a the other end of it today here in Rhode Island..It was beautiful. (there was a rainbow this afternoon here) Gave you a 10...(:', '2004-12-02 00:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042667, 124267, 29945, '<td valign="top">I would hate to be the one caught in the middle. A Big fat 10 for you~</td>', 'I would hate to be the one caught in the middle. A Big fat 10 for you~', '2004-12-02 00:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042673, 125208, 28718, '<td valign="top">I like the soft nostalgic feel.</td>', 'I like the soft nostalgic feel.', '2004-12-02 00:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042675, 125177, 29945, '<td valign="top">Good job..hats off to you. Seven Glasses, seven reflections. I would like to see a photo with this composition with six filled with liquid (alcholic something)  and the one empty one..Good impact possibilities there. Gave you a big fat 10~</td>', 'Good job..hats off to you. Seven Glasses, seven reflections. I would like to see a photo with this composition with six filled with liquid (alcholic something)  and the one empty one..Good impact possibilities there. Gave you a big fat 10~', '2004-12-02 00:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042677, 125170, 29945, '<td valign="top">Would have like to have seen this on a very light reflective surface to show pennys in reflection..kind of on the dark side.</td>', 'Would have like to have seen this on a very light reflective surface to show pennys in reflection..kind of on the dark side.', '2004-12-02 00:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042678, 125031, 24970, '<td valign="top">I bet you''re having issues with people finding all seven here. But...very interesting perspective on the watering can, and nice focus. I''m not sure what the black thing is in the upper left, replacing it by moving the small pot up there might help by allowing for a more continuous curve/frame of pots, eliminating that distraction, and making the "seven subjects" less of a treasure hunt.</td>', 'I bet you''re having issues with people finding all seven here. But...very interesting perspective on the watering can, and nice focus. I''m not sure what the black thing is in the upper left, replacing it by moving the small pot up there might help by allowing for a more continuous curve/frame of pots, eliminating that distraction, and making the "seven subjects" less of a treasure hunt.', '2004-12-02 00:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042681, 125198, 29945, '<td valign="top">Just outstanding in my book! Gave you a big fat 10~would have given you 20 if I could....(:</td>', 'Just outstanding in my book! Gave you a big fat 10~would have given you 20 if I could....(:', '2004-12-02 00:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042683, 124962, 28718, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the homes and the city behind it, also the way the houses really stand out from the background.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the homes and the city behind it, also the way the houses really stand out from the background.', '2004-12-02 00:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042687, 125172, 29945, '<td valign="top">OMG! You should have entered this in the humor one...it was so funny!</td>', 'OMG! You should have entered this in the humor one...it was so funny!', '2004-12-02 00:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042689, 124295, 29945, '<td valign="top">You have put this In the HumorChallenge it is so funny!</td>', 'You have put this In the HumorChallenge it is so funny!', '2004-12-02 00:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042693, 124518, 28718, '<td valign="top">the rays of light in the picture are fascinating. Beautiful.</td>', 'the rays of light in the picture are fascinating. Beautiful.', '2004-12-02 01:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042698, 124296, 25468, '<td valign="top">Well done. I think the finish does it much justice.</td>', 'Well done. I think the finish does it much justice.', '2004-12-02 01:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042699, 124767, 25468, '<td valign="top">well, 7-1/2. That''s ok though. A little grainy for my liking. Gives me the impression that this was cropped out of a larger shot.</td>', 'well, 7-1/2. That''s ok though. A little grainy for my liking. Gives me the impression that this was cropped out of a larger shot.', '2004-12-02 01:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042700, 124281, 25468, '<td valign="top">I am not really understanding how this is ''seven of something'' maybe I''m misled by the challenge description. I am not enjoying the angle or the tight cropping. Lighting is good.</td>', 'I am not really understanding how this is ''seven of something'' maybe I''m misled by the challenge description. I am not enjoying the angle or the tight cropping. Lighting is good.', '2004-12-02 01:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042702, 124495, 29269, '<td valign="top">If the globe was more prominent in this photo... the trees on the sides draw too much attention.</td>', 'If the globe was more prominent in this photo... the trees on the sides draw too much attention.', '2004-12-02 01:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042704, 123839, 29269, '<td valign="top">If you could have taken this one at an angle, from the right, to eliminate those drops above and below the main line, that may have been more prominent 7 drops...</td>', 'If you could have taken this one at an angle, from the right, to eliminate those drops above and below the main line, that may have been more prominent 7 drops...', '2004-12-02 01:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042705, 124127, 29269, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped the top and the bottom a bit more. There is enough color variation in the planks to the left of the group, there was no need to leave the extra vertical space.</td>', 'I would have cropped the top and the bottom a bit more. There is enough color variation in the planks to the left of the group, there was no need to leave the extra vertical space.', '2004-12-02 01:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042706, 125207, 24784, '<td valign="top">more than seven</td>', 'more than seven', '2004-12-02 01:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042710, 125113, 24784, '<td valign="top">7 of what ?</td>', '7 of what ?', '2004-12-02 01:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042724, 125159, 29269, '<td valign="top">7? Where is #7 - or am I too tired?</td>', '7? Where is #7 - or am I too tired?', '2004-12-02 02:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042725, 124879, 29269, '<td valign="top">Pity that their natural color does not stand out against the background. Nothing to do there now...  only a 7 for what could have been a 10.</td>', 'Pity that their natural color does not stand out against the background. Nothing to do there now...  only a 7 for what could have been a 10.', '2004-12-02 02:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042753, 124294, 29777, '<td valign="top">This is cool. What is it? Where is it? Meets the challenge.</td>', 'This is cool. What is it? Where is it? Meets the challenge.', '2004-12-02 02:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042754, 124952, 29777, '<td valign="top">Looks good. I think I might like it better if all the eggs were in focus. nice color.</td>', 'Looks good. I think I might like it better if all the eggs were in focus. nice color.', '2004-12-02 03:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042755, 125056, 29777, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. What is going on here? How did you do it?</td>', 'Very cool shot. What is going on here? How did you do it?', '2004-12-02 03:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042756, 125018, 29777, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of impending doom. I like how the background pieces are out of focus.</td>', 'Nice sense of impending doom. I like how the background pieces are out of focus.', '2004-12-02 03:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042761, 124252, 29269, '<td valign="top">there''s too much below the pigeons. Cropping about half of the blue&amp;yellow stripes would;ve made this much better. only a 7 though.</td>', 'there''s too much below the pigeons. Cropping about half of the blue&yellow stripes would;ve made this much better. only a 7 though.', '2004-12-02 03:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042763, 124295, 18757, '<td valign="top">over-exposed and noisy</td>', 'over-exposed and noisy', '2004-12-02 03:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042767, 125066, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement! The fork edges line up nicely to create pleasing lines. Excellent lighting...I think the lighting is what makes this one work.</td>', 'Nice arrangement! The fork edges line up nicely to create pleasing lines. Excellent lighting...I think the lighting is what makes this one work.', '2004-12-02 03:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042770, 125144, 18757, '<td valign="top">excellent picture.i like it.9</td>', 'excellent picture.i like it.9', '2004-12-02 03:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042772, 125025, 24970, '<td valign="top">Having the foreground in full silhouette would make this even stronger. And I think I''d like a bit more on top, it seems a little harshly cut off.</td>', 'Having the foreground in full silhouette would make this even stronger. And I think I''d like a bit more on top, it seems a little harshly cut off.', '2004-12-02 03:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042775, 125198, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very nicely in focus, sharp, well-composed shot. Too bad the reflections in the spoons are so distracting, is there a way you could have draped some sort of  shield and still had good lighting?</td>', 'Very nicely in focus, sharp, well-composed shot. Too bad the reflections in the spoons are so distracting, is there a way you could have draped some sort of  shield and still had good lighting?', '2004-12-02 03:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042777, 125042, 24970, '<td valign="top">Haha. Nice capture. Would love to have the gulls &amp; posts stand out a little more from the background -maybe a day where the sky''s not so grey- though I realize this is not exactly a set-up, controlled shot.</td>', 'Haha. Nice capture. Would love to have the gulls & posts stand out a little more from the background -maybe a day where the sky''s not so grey- though I realize this is not exactly a set-up, controlled shot.', '2004-12-02 03:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042780, 124230, 24983, '<td valign="top">good idea I like the way you have arranged the colours.</td>', 'good idea I like the way you have arranged the colours.', '2004-12-02 03:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042781, 125062, 24983, '<td valign="top">Nice one watch out for open season!!!!!</td>', 'Nice one watch out for open season!!!!!', '2004-12-02 03:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042782, 124608, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The top is a little blown out for my taste, I''d prefer to be able to see the full curve of the tops of the glasses. Otherwise, a very striking photo.</td>', 'Nice shot. The top is a little blown out for my taste, I''d prefer to be able to see the full curve of the tops of the glasses. Otherwise, a very striking photo.', '2004-12-02 03:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042783, 124089, 24983, '<td valign="top">Oh what it would be like to live in a photographers heaven like you, a really nice shot</td>', 'Oh what it would be like to live in a photographers heaven like you, a really nice shot', '2004-12-02 03:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042784, 125210, 24983, '<td valign="top">excellent idea, The colours work together well</td>', 'excellent idea, The colours work together well', '2004-12-02 03:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042785, 125013, 24983, '<td valign="top">I wont play patience with you again!!!!!!</td>', 'I wont play patience with you again!!!!!!', '2004-12-02 03:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042786, 124295, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I think it would work better on a darker background so they stood out more, right now it''s a bit too overwhelmingly white. Even though this way lends more impact to the blood, it''s just a little too hard to distinguish shapes.</td>', 'Very interesting. I think it would work better on a darker background so they stood out more, right now it''s a bit too overwhelmingly white. Even though this way lends more impact to the blood, it''s just a little too hard to distinguish shapes.', '2004-12-02 03:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042788, 124037, 24983, '<td valign="top">What an original ikdea.well thought out.</td>', 'What an original ikdea.well thought out.', '2004-12-02 03:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042789, 123892, 16241, '<td valign="top">makes a change :)</td>', 'makes a change :)', '2004-12-02 03:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042790, 124777, 24970, '<td valign="top">Humorous. I might have played with the arrangement of them a little, the fuzzy yellow guy seems to stick out on the side and might do better in a more central location.</td>', 'Humorous. I might have played with the arrangement of them a little, the fuzzy yellow guy seems to stick out on the side and might do better in a more central location.', '2004-12-02 03:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042793, 123839, 16241, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2004-12-02 03:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042794, 124753, 16241, '<td valign="top">this is gorgeous, hope you get lucky!</td>', 'this is gorgeous, hope you get lucky!', '2004-12-02 03:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042795, 124770, 16241, '<td valign="top">there''s always hope :)</td>', 'there''s always hope :)', '2004-12-02 03:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042796, 124448, 16241, '<td valign="top">this be my best so far!</td>', 'this be my best so far!', '2004-12-02 03:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042797, 123930, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the simple dominant green and black of this shot.  The base add some interest to the bottom of the photo, and the shadows are not too harsh on the bamboo.</td>', 'I like the simple dominant green and black of this shot.  The base add some interest to the bottom of the photo, and the shadows are not too harsh on the bamboo.', '2004-12-02 03:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042800, 124314, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think this idea is good. I like the shadows and tilt of the shot to give a nice diagonal from top left to bottom right.  One thing I might suggest for improvement is to use a deeper depth of field so that the details of all the marbles can be shown.  This current depth of field seems to blur out the closest and furthest marbles</td>', 'I think this idea is good. I like the shadows and tilt of the shot to give a nice diagonal from top left to bottom right.  One thing I might suggest for improvement is to use a deeper depth of field so that the details of all the marbles can be shown.  This current depth of field seems to blur out the closest and furthest marbles', '2004-12-02 04:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042803, 124518, 16241, '<td valign="top">i like this a lot!</td>', 'i like this a lot!', '2004-12-02 04:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042808, 125068, 16241, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2004-12-02 04:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042817, 124089, 24970, '<td valign="top">Wow. gorgeous silhouettes. It works without the top half too and makes for a more intense picture, though I''m not sure which way I like better. A bit of a stretch to say the distant cranes are the subject, but I''ll give you that.</td>', 'Wow. gorgeous silhouettes. It works without the top half too and makes for a more intense picture, though I''m not sure which way I like better. A bit of a stretch to say the distant cranes are the subject, but I''ll give you that.', '2004-12-02 04:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042823, 125134, 24970, '<td valign="top">With less harsh lighting this would be a striking photo. As it is, a lot of the color and detail are lost in the glare.</td>', 'With less harsh lighting this would be a striking photo. As it is, a lot of the color and detail are lost in the glare.', '2004-12-02 04:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042827, 124089, 30173, '<td valign="top">It''s simply incredible...<br/>Congrats for the top ten !</td>', 'It''s simply incredible...Congrats for the top ten !', '2004-12-02 04:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042828, 124049, 24970, '<td valign="top">Wow. This feels 3D. The glare on the pen is a little harsh, other than that I do like this, it draws me in somehow.</td>', 'Wow. This feels 3D. The glare on the pen is a little harsh, other than that I do like this, it draws me in somehow.', '2004-12-02 04:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042829, 123839, 30173, '<td valign="top">Wow ! Top ten !</td>', 'Wow ! Top ten !', '2004-12-02 04:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042830, 124827, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the focus. I feel the 6 &amp; 1 dice could be closer to the camera, as a balance thing I guess. The 4 &amp; 3 seem so far away in comparison....but maybe you did it this way to keep them all appearing the same size. Oh, also - the lighting and color really work. It doesn''t hurt me to look at this one for a long time, as I am.</td>', 'Nice job with the focus. I feel the 6 & 1 dice could be closer to the camera, as a balance thing I guess. The 4 & 3 seem so far away in comparison....but maybe you did it this way to keep them all appearing the same size. Oh, also - the lighting and color really work. It doesn''t hurt me to look at this one for a long time, as I am.', '2004-12-02 04:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042832, 124296, 24970, '<td valign="top">The tease of the curving road really completes the line our eyes are led along. And with the foggy view of the trees, it makes for a great mood. I''d love just a little more of this first section, it''s cut off so abruptly.</td>', 'The tease of the curving road really completes the line our eyes are led along. And with the foggy view of the trees, it makes for a great mood. I''d love just a little more of this first section, it''s cut off so abruptly.', '2004-12-02 04:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1042835, 123587, 24970, '<td valign="top">This has no effect on my score, more of a curiosity: What do you mean by your title? I know autorretrato translates to self-portrat.....but......are you a clothespin? Must be deeper meaning that I''m missing. <br/>About your picture: It''s very nicely in focus, and composed/cropped well. Thank you for providing a focal point rather than seven brown ones.</td>', 'This has no effect on my score, more of a curiosity: What do you mean by your title? I know autorretrato translates to self-portrat.....but......are you a clothespin? Must be deeper meaning that I''m missing. About your picture: It''s very nicely in focus, and composed/cropped well. Thank you for providing a focal point rather than seven brown ones.', '2004-12-02 05:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
