(1042883, 123824, 29513, '<td valign="top">Mmmm.  Deviled, of course!<br/>I think I would try to get the egg halves toward the rear a little sharper.  That is, if I could keep from eating them first.</td>', 'Mmmm.  Deviled, of course!I think I would try to get the egg halves toward the rear a little sharper.  That is, if I could keep from eating them first.', '2004-12-02 07:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
