(1043116, 124157, 29148, '<td valign="top">Novel idea.</td>', 'Novel idea.', '2004-12-02 10:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043117, 124155, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and comp. DOF feels awkward to me. I amnot a fan of borders and this one doesn''t help in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice colors and comp. DOF feels awkward to me. I amnot a fan of borders and this one doesn''t help in my opinion.', '2004-12-02 10:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043119, 124192, 18197, '<td valign="top">Superb idea. I had thought to do this but couldn''t find the nested dolls in time.</td>', 'Superb idea. I had thought to do this but couldn''t find the nested dolls in time.', '2004-12-02 10:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043122, 125208, 29783, '<td valign="top">the lighting is very soft and nice.</td>', 'the lighting is very soft and nice.', '2004-12-02 10:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043123, 125056, 29148, '<td valign="top">I''m dying to know how you did it. Nice shot.</td>', 'I''m dying to know how you did it. Nice shot.', '2004-12-02 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043124, 124321, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am sure that it was difficult to capture all the seagulls exactly sharp and motionless. But the sharper focus would have received a higher score from me.</td>', 'I am sure that it was difficult to capture all the seagulls exactly sharp and motionless. But the sharper focus would have received a higher score from me.', '2004-12-02 10:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043127, 124267, 29148, '<td valign="top">They are stuffed, right? I gave them a 7 as well.</td>', 'They are stuffed, right? I gave them a 7 as well.', '2004-12-02 10:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043129, 125043, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture brought out by B&amp;W treatment and relatively high contrast. Composition is nice. The flow and texture remind me of Van Gogh.  And the background contributes to this feeling.</td>', 'Very nice texture brought out by B&W treatment and relatively high contrast. Composition is nice. The flow and texture remind me of Van Gogh.  And the background contributes to this feeling.', '2004-12-02 10:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043135, 125108, 18197, '<td valign="top">Improbable image. Once I get past Woody (fast becoming the mother of cliche), I find I like the gradient background and the placement of the subject. Focus could be a bit stronger and I''d like it better.</td>', 'Improbable image. Once I get past Woody (fast becoming the mother of cliche), I find I like the gradient background and the placement of the subject. Focus could be a bit stronger and I''d like it better.', '2004-12-02 10:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043138, 125194, 16241, '<td valign="top">cute &amp; clever</td>', 'cute & clever', '2004-12-02 11:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043141, 124505, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lookout, the apples are going to fall out of the bowl! The angle adds a certain tension I like. The blurred background is nice but the harsh shadows detract a bit. IMO, the colors could stand to be slightly  more highly saturated.</td>', 'Lookout, the apples are going to fall out of the bowl! The angle adds a certain tension I like. The blurred background is nice but the harsh shadows detract a bit. IMO, the colors could stand to be slightly  more highly saturated.', '2004-12-02 11:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043143, 124936, 16241, '<td valign="top">ha, this must have been a piece of glass?  clever</td>', 'ha, this must have been a piece of glass?  clever', '2004-12-02 11:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043145, 124025, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m counting to get to seven. Flow of the lights and darks leads my eye around nicely. Darks are a bit too dark on my monitor. If you''re using photoshop, you might want to use Shadow/Highlight to bring up the darks or levels to make them go away entirely.  The eneven half border left and right is a pretty major distraction. Suggest losing the white border entirely. All just my opinion.</td>', 'Not sure what I''m counting to get to seven. Flow of the lights and darks leads my eye around nicely. Darks are a bit too dark on my monitor. If you''re using photoshop, you might want to use Shadow/Highlight to bring up the darks or levels to make them go away entirely.  The eneven half border left and right is a pretty major distraction. Suggest losing the white border entirely. All just my opinion.', '2004-12-02 11:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043149, 124962, 29783, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2004-12-02 11:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043154, 124049, 29783, '<td valign="top">cute, but I don''t think he would have written in English...</td>', 'cute, but I don''t think he would have written in English...', '2004-12-02 11:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043158, 125038, 29269, '<td valign="top">This would have been a 10 if you could have configured the light in such a way to enhance the second hand - or if you''d used a different watch with a more prominent second hand...</td>', 'This would have been a 10 if you could have configured the light in such a way to enhance the second hand - or if you''d used a different watch with a more prominent second hand...', '2004-12-02 11:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043162, 125204, 29269, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! It took me a few moments to realize how you have done this! Marvelous idea and perfect execution - I can''t see the other hand behind this one!</td>', 'Wonderful! It took me a few moments to realize how you have done this! Marvelous idea and perfect execution - I can''t see the other hand behind this one!', '2004-12-02 11:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043164, 125201, 27839, '<td valign="top">I think this picture would have been even better with a plain white background.</td>', 'I think this picture would have been even better with a plain white background.', '2004-12-02 11:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043166, 125203, 27839, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I really like this photo</td>', 'Nice!  I really like this photo', '2004-12-02 11:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043169, 125172, 27839, '<td valign="top">Zoloft in capsules?  I have never seen them like.  Zoloft Myfriend :-)~</td>', 'Zoloft in capsules?  I have never seen them like.  Zoloft Myfriend :-)~', '2004-12-02 11:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043177, 124295, 27839, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Seems like the photo has a lot of noise and/or grain in the photo.</td>', 'Very cute.  Seems like the photo has a lot of noise and/or grain in the photo.', '2004-12-02 11:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043182, 125136, 29148, '<td valign="top">An intriguing setup. Very appealing. 8</td>', 'An intriguing setup. Very appealing. 8', '2004-12-02 11:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043190, 124448, 29440, '<td valign="top">Getting 7 of any thing wild is a challenge.  The foreground reflections add to the photo and I am glad they were not cropped out.  The fog adds to the calmness of the scene.  Great photo and ahould be a winner<br/></td>', 'Getting 7 of any thing wild is a challenge.  The foreground reflections add to the photo and I am glad they were not cropped out.  The fog adds to the calmness of the scene.  Great photo and ahould be a winner', '2004-12-02 11:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043195, 125195, 29148, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Should win about any contest, except b&amp;w.</td>', 'Beautiful! Should win about any contest, except b&w.', '2004-12-02 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043224, 124962, 23816, '<td valign="top">didnt i see this in an ad??? (cept it was nite)</td>', 'didnt i see this in an ad??? (cept it was nite)', '2004-12-02 12:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043228, 124357, 23962, '<td valign="top">Reflection device has been used  alot lately. This arrangement is nice. The folds on bottom right help fill the space and the colours are relaxing. You have me the challenge with style. I would have put a border on it to contain the elements but judging by comments that I get, I woould be deducted for that.</td>', 'Reflection device has been used  alot lately. This arrangement is nice. The folds on bottom right help fill the space and the colours are relaxing. You have me the challenge with style. I would have put a border on it to contain the elements but judging by comments that I get, I woould be deducted for that.', '2004-12-02 12:19:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1043238, 124127, 29958, '<td valign="top">Superb composition!<br/>I found this image really interesting and pleasing image.<br/>Well done<br/>John</td>', 'Superb composition!I found this image really interesting and pleasing image.Well doneJohn', '2004-12-02 12:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043242, 124777, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cute. You might have put them on a tree.</td>', 'Cute. You might have put them on a tree.', '2004-12-02 12:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043247, 125103, 18403, '<td valign="top">I find this very appealing. 7</td>', 'I find this very appealing. 7', '2004-12-02 12:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043251, 124936, 27845, '<td valign="top">Hot! I love chilli! I have to admit I can''t figure out the setup for sure. No matter how you did it, it looks as if you had just thrown the chillis into the air. If you did not, I''d have arranged them in a more homogenuous (uh, spelling? :) way. Some noise there, but that doesn''t matter. I like the contrast between the hot chillis and the cold autumn/winter day (bare trees).</td>', 'Hot! I love chilli! I have to admit I can''t figure out the setup for sure. No matter how you did it, it looks as if you had just thrown the chillis into the air. If you did not, I''d have arranged them in a more homogenuous (uh, spelling? :) way. Some noise there, but that doesn''t matter. I like the contrast between the hot chillis and the cold autumn/winter day (bare trees).', '2004-12-02 12:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043252, 125074, 27845, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the forks'' composition. I''d have preferred either something more regular (a circle perhaps) or more chaotic, with their heads looking into completely different directions. They blend with their own shadows (lower right). 4.</td>', 'I don''t like the forks'' composition. I''d have preferred either something more regular (a circle perhaps) or more chaotic, with their heads looking into completely different directions. They blend with their own shadows (lower right). 4.', '2004-12-02 12:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043253, 125199, 18403, '<td valign="top">Superb composition!</td>', 'Superb composition!', '2004-12-02 12:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043255, 125191, 29958, '<td valign="top">Excellent fun image<br/>well done<br/>John</td>', 'Excellent fun imagewell doneJohn', '2004-12-02 12:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043257, 125095, 27845, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked to see a brighter background and a tighter crop. You might have used new pencils, the scratches on these take some of the harmony.</td>', 'I''d have liked to see a brighter background and a tighter crop. You might have used new pencils, the scratches on these take some of the harmony.', '2004-12-02 12:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043259, 125061, 18403, '<td valign="top">Bet you get some comments on this !! 6</td>', 'Bet you get some comments on this !! 6', '2004-12-02 12:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043260, 124879, 27845, '<td valign="top">The deers did exactly what they are supposed to do in real life: blend with the background. They are barely perceptible because it''s brown on brown. And they''re too small. You might have waited for them to be in a more compact constellation, which would have allowed a tighter crop and thus, larger animals. A more narrow DOF might have helped as well.</td>', 'The deers did exactly what they are supposed to do in real life: blend with the background. They are barely perceptible because it''s brown on brown. And they''re too small. You might have waited for them to be in a more compact constellation, which would have allowed a tighter crop and thus, larger animals. A more narrow DOF might have helped as well.', '2004-12-02 12:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043261, 124281, 18403, '<td valign="top">How nice!!! 9</td>', 'How nice!!! 9', '2004-12-02 12:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043264, 125147, 27845, '<td valign="top">Too much contrast. There''s a blue halo around the horizontal line. The noise between the blue and the white area is no good. I guess you took the shot from below and wanted the fence to stick out against the blue background. Changing levels might have been more useful than pushing the contrast. 2. Sorry.</td>', 'Too much contrast. There''s a blue halo around the horizontal line. The noise between the blue and the white area is no good. I guess you took the shot from below and wanted the fence to stick out against the blue background. Changing levels might have been more useful than pushing the contrast. 2. Sorry.', '2004-12-02 12:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043267, 125112, 27845, '<td valign="top">Did it occur to you to take the shot from behind the mice? They would e in the foreground, and the cat''s face, dominant, in the background.</td>', 'Did it occur to you to take the shot from behind the mice? They would e in the foreground, and the cat''s face, dominant, in the background.', '2004-12-02 12:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043268, 125099, 27845, '<td valign="top">The gifts in the background are too important to be out of focus. The golden pack might be closer the others, that would have taken some of that empty space in the middle.</td>', 'The gifts in the background are too important to be out of focus. The golden pack might be closer the others, that would have taken some of that empty space in the middle.', '2004-12-02 12:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043271, 124157, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I''d have burned only one of the sticks. The black tops just don''t look good. You might have removed the head which fell off the third from the left. Taking the matches as lightsource would have given a more dramatic look.</td>', 'Nice idea. I''d have burned only one of the sticks. The black tops just don''t look good. You might have removed the head which fell off the third from the left. Taking the matches as lightsource would have given a more dramatic look.', '2004-12-02 12:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043276, 124608, 27845, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked a solid background, but that''s a matter of taste. The colours are nice, but the middle three look too similar. Nice idea, though, well done.</td>', 'I''d have liked a solid background, but that''s a matter of taste. The colours are nice, but the middle three look too similar. Nice idea, though, well done.', '2004-12-02 12:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043279, 124197, 27845, '<td valign="top">I guess I can''t count to seven :) I see only four. But that''s unimportant. There''s no composition in here, nothing to focus on, no lines to follow. It''s just a big mess, as most junkyards are. Try submitting your pictures with larger dimensions in the future.</td>', 'I guess I can''t count to seven :) I see only four. But that''s unimportant. There''s no composition in here, nothing to focus on, no lines to follow. It''s just a big mess, as most junkyards are. Try submitting your pictures with larger dimensions in the future.', '2004-12-02 12:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043281, 123932, 27845, '<td valign="top">Aren''t those bugs supposed to be bright red? That would have made this picture, which has a nice composition and DOF much better. The bugs are just simply too pale.</td>', 'Aren''t those bugs supposed to be bright red? That would have made this picture, which has a nice composition and DOF much better. The bugs are just simply too pale.', '2004-12-02 12:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043285, 125204, 27845, '<td valign="top">When somebody suggested taking a shot of seven fingers in one of the forums, I laughed about it. You did a great job putting seven fingers on one hand without editing! I''d have desaturated it completely, and used a different light angle to get some more shadows. If the light came from the right, it wouldn''t be possible to see your second hand in the lower left corner. Cool. 6.</td>', 'When somebody suggested taking a shot of seven fingers in one of the forums, I laughed about it. You did a great job putting seven fingers on one hand without editing! I''d have desaturated it completely, and used a different light angle to get some more shadows. If the light came from the right, it wouldn''t be possible to see your second hand in the lower left corner. Cool. 6.', '2004-12-02 12:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043287, 124289, 29309, '<td valign="top">nice photo, I think a greater DOF would help the impact</td>', 'nice photo, I think a greater DOF would help the impact', '2004-12-02 13:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043288, 124952, 29309, '<td valign="top">too dimm</td>', 'too dimm', '2004-12-02 13:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043291, 124201, 29309, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the bordere is quite distracting</td>', 'I like the composition, but the bordere is quite distracting', '2004-12-02 13:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043292, 124881, 27845, '<td valign="top">Okay, I see 4 chimneys, 10 windows, 5 peaks, but no sisters. Ah, I got it. They''re in the houses, right? ;)<br/>I guess you meant the 5+2 peaks. The two in the background are really hard to see, and it''s not obvious that they''re the picture''s subject. They''re in the background, and the houses are more important to the eye.<br/>If I got it all wrong and you really referred to the sisters in the buidings, I apologize for not getting it :]</td>', 'Okay, I see 4 chimneys, 10 windows, 5 peaks, but no sisters. Ah, I got it. They''re in the houses, right? ;)I guess you meant the 5+2 peaks. The two in the background are really hard to see, and it''s not obvious that they''re the picture''s subject. They''re in the background, and the houses are more important to the eye.If I got it all wrong and you really referred to the sisters in the buidings, I apologize for not getting it :]', '2004-12-02 13:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043294, 125052, 29177, '<td valign="top">Good colors and nice reflections! Nicely done.. congrats</td>', 'Good colors and nice reflections! Nicely done.. congrats', '2004-12-02 13:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043295, 124067, 29309, '<td valign="top">nice photo. the shadow of the glass is distracting. perhaps a white background far enough  a way to prevent the shadow would enhance the impact</td>', 'nice photo. the shadow of the glass is distracting. perhaps a white background far enough  a way to prevent the shadow would enhance the impact', '2004-12-02 13:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043298, 125134, 27845, '<td valign="top">Spelling mistake in the title. S**t happens. Irregular composition, the coins don''t touch each other everywhere. The flashlight destroyed most of the relief. The lower coin is too dark, the upper right is too bright. Good idea to put another coin into the middle than on the outside. It''s hard to find out about that, though. They should all be straightened, too, with the bears looking all into the same direction. See Murphy''s Law...</td>', 'Spelling mistake in the title. S**t happens. Irregular composition, the coins don''t touch each other everywhere. The flashlight destroyed most of the relief. The lower coin is too dark, the upper right is too bright. Good idea to put another coin into the middle than on the outside. It''s hard to find out about that, though. They should all be straightened, too, with the bears looking all into the same direction. See Murphy''s Law...', '2004-12-02 13:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043303, 125029, 27845, '<td valign="top">Strange title. I''d have used identical bottles. The blue one fits in least of all. The left part might have been cropped off almost completely.</td>', 'Strange title. I''d have used identical bottles. The blue one fits in least of all. The left part might have been cropped off almost completely.', '2004-12-02 13:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1043305, 124049, 27845, '<td valign="top">Gregar Mendel? Never heard of him. I''m ignorant, I guess. Nice composition. I like the look of the pen, but I don''t like that the text doesn''t help me understand what Mendel dicovered.</td>', 'Gregar Mendel? Never heard of him. I''m ignorant, I guess. Nice composition. I like the look of the pen, but I don''t like that the text doesn''t help me understand what Mendel dicovered.', '2004-12-02 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
