(1043586, 124486, 3032, '<td valign="top">Win Or Lose, Sink Or Swim<br/>One Thing Is Certain We''ll Never Give In<br/>Side By Side, Hand In Hand<br/>We All Stand Together<br/> <br/>(Paul McCartney)<br/> <br/>Now you''ve done it, I''ve got that frog song in my head. Owww, this is going to last the whole evening. Bom bom bom pady-ap......<br/></td>', 'Win Or Lose, Sink Or SwimOne Thing Is Certain We''ll Never Give InSide By Side, Hand In HandWe All Stand Together (Paul McCartney) Now you''ve done it, I''ve got that frog song in my head. Owww, this is going to last the whole evening. Bom bom bom pady-ap......', '2004-12-02 15:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
