(1043618, 125057, 20679, '<td valign="top">this is a very cute picture - very original and well thought out. With the addition of some colored gels on the lighting (to make it loo a little more "stage-like" this would be stunning! And I''m not yolking! ;)</td>', 'this is a very cute picture - very original and well thought out. With the addition of some colored gels on the lighting (to make it loo a little more "stage-like" this would be stunning! And I''m not yolking! ;)', '2004-12-02 16:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
