(1043628, 124938, 6667, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  Why the black and white here?  I think the color of the beer would have been a more dramatic presentation. .  imho.  BOL</td>', 'Neat idea.  Why the black and white here?  I think the color of the beer would have been a more dramatic presentation. .  imho.  BOL', '2004-12-02 16:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
