(1043634, 123824, 29777, '<td valign="top">I am a total newbie and I understand that food can be very difficult to photograph. This photo does not make me want to eat the eggs. The lack of focus doesn''t help. I don''t think I would order this from a menu displaying this photo.</td>', 'I am a total newbie and I understand that food can be very difficult to photograph. This photo does not make me want to eat the eggs. The lack of focus doesn''t help. I don''t think I would order this from a menu displaying this photo.', '2004-12-02 16:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
