(1043642, 125023, 29777, '<td valign="top">beautiful. I had no idea that pelecans ever swam together like this.I might like it more if it were cropped just below the closest duck.</td>', 'beautiful. I had no idea that pelecans ever swam together like this.I might like it more if it were cropped just below the closest duck.', '2004-12-02 16:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
