(1043687, 125187, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its good perspective and nice colors... just background bit distractiog. Would like to see it in bigger size aswell.</td>', 'Its good perspective and nice colors... just background bit distractiog. Would like to see it in bigger size aswell.', '2004-12-02 16:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
