(1044171, 124197, 18197, '<td valign="top">Please, next time can you make your entry bigger. Your max dimension is 276. Try and use all or nearly all the 640 pixels allowed. I think this would be a worthy photo, but it''s so small I can''t really make out much of it.</td>', 'Please, next time can you make your entry bigger. Your max dimension is 276. Try and use all or nearly all the 640 pixels allowed. I think this would be a worthy photo, but it''s so small I can''t really make out much of it.', '2004-12-02 23:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044174, 125140, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very stark. Very ... mathmatical. I like the refractions and the way they manipulate the lines. There are some jpeg artifacts that distract a bit. At this size, not much to do. Maybe slightly smaller (say 600 instead of 640) would do the trick. Just a suggestion. Well done.</td>', 'Very stark. Very ... mathmatical. I like the refractions and the way they manipulate the lines. There are some jpeg artifacts that distract a bit. At this size, not much to do. Maybe slightly smaller (say 600 instead of 640) would do the trick. Just a suggestion. Well done.', '2004-12-02 23:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044178, 124678, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good technical study. Shows mastery of camera and editing. Good contrast with background. Would do well as stock photo, I think. Saturation feels a bit over the top but since most stock is cartoon, over the top often works.</td>', 'Good technical study. Shows mastery of camera and editing. Good contrast with background. Would do well as stock photo, I think. Saturation feels a bit over the top but since most stock is cartoon, over the top often works.', '2004-12-03 00:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044183, 124448, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the fog and I love the amount of background you can see through it. Well done. Good reflections. A bit stronger focus on the birds and this would be perfect.</td>', 'Nice capture of the fog and I love the amount of background you can see through it. Well done. Good reflections. A bit stronger focus on the birds and this would be perfect.', '2004-12-03 00:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044184, 123839, 18197, '<td valign="top">This feels like a classic DPC ribbon to me. It has water, reflections, stark contrast, strong color and a good dynamic composition. Good focus and DOF. Hope it does well.</td>', 'This feels like a classic DPC ribbon to me. It has water, reflections, stark contrast, strong color and a good dynamic composition. Good focus and DOF. Hope it does well.', '2004-12-03 00:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044185, 125044, 24970, '<td valign="top">Oooo. Took me a while. Are people missing the CD you''re shooting through? It''s a neat concept. Lighting is maybe a bit bright, but otherwise...nice job on an original idea.</td>', 'Oooo. Took me a while. Are people missing the CD you''re shooting through? It''s a neat concept. Lighting is maybe a bit bright, but otherwise...nice job on an original idea.', '2004-12-03 00:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044186, 125063, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very good technical execution of the subject. Nice contrast with background. Weak composition, in my opinion, doesn''t grab or hold my interest. I can see it in an ad though, for a mint coin set. Good job there.</td>', 'Very good technical execution of the subject. Nice contrast with background. Weak composition, in my opinion, doesn''t grab or hold my interest. I can see it in an ad though, for a mint coin set. Good job there.', '2004-12-03 00:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044187, 124089, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. A few too many cranes but I can''t hold it against you.</td>', 'Fantastic shot. A few too many cranes but I can''t hold it against you.', '2004-12-03 00:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044190, 125214, 18197, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of little reasons I shouldn''t like this but the whole transcends the parts. Very well done.</td>', 'There are a lot of little reasons I shouldn''t like this but the whole transcends the parts. Very well done.', '2004-12-03 00:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044195, 124755, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition ... risky ... but well enough done to succeed. I''d love to lose the verticle line on the right but with basic editing, I''m not sure how. Good. Job!</td>', 'Very interesting composition ... risky ... but well enough done to succeed. I''d love to lose the verticle line on the right but with basic editing, I''m not sure how. Good. Job!', '2004-12-03 00:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044196, 125159, 4891, '<td valign="top">um, unless i counted wrong, i got six unless you count the partial head in the very right side</td>', 'um, unless i counted wrong, i got six unless you count the partial head in the very right side', '2004-12-03 00:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044198, 125039, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the stark erector set feel of the branches. If you had included a strong white point, this would have "felt" better to me. But in fact, I''m not sure where you would have gotten it.</td>', 'I like the colors and the stark erector set feel of the branches. If you had included a strong white point, this would have "felt" better to me. But in fact, I''m not sure where you would have gotten it.', '2004-12-03 00:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044200, 124037, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the composition (slanted horizon and all). Stark silhouette is nice. Good use of implied lines. Sunsets usually do well here and this is a nice one. I am generally not a fan of borders but this one works well because of the dimension of it and the color. Well done.</td>', 'I like the composition (slanted horizon and all). Stark silhouette is nice. Good use of implied lines. Sunsets usually do well here and this is a nice one. I am generally not a fan of borders but this one works well because of the dimension of it and the color. Well done.', '2004-12-03 00:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044201, 125046, 18197, '<td valign="top">Clearly meets the challenge. Focus of the moving flag is well done. Nice vibrant colors. Sky could be a bit more dramatic but with basic editing, there''s not much you can do except wait for thunderstorms. I am as patriotic as the next guy, but the subject doesn''t grab or hold my interest.</td>', 'Clearly meets the challenge. Focus of the moving flag is well done. Nice vibrant colors. Sky could be a bit more dramatic but with basic editing, there''s not much you can do except wait for thunderstorms. I am as patriotic as the next guy, but the subject doesn''t grab or hold my interest.', '2004-12-03 00:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044203, 125113, 29777, '<td valign="top">Something about the perspective makes these look like toys. What a great image. I see nine boats rather than seven, but I still like the photo.</td>', 'Something about the perspective makes these look like toys. What a great image. I see nine boats rather than seven, but I still like the photo.', '2004-12-03 00:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044205, 125098, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderful reflections. The white point / black point on the horses is very nice. Good job.</td>', 'Wonderful reflections. The white point / black point on the horses is very nice. Good job.', '2004-12-03 00:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044208, 125174, 29777, '<td valign="top">nice. Did you make these? I might like the whole thing a little better with less shadows.</td>', 'nice. Did you make these? I might like the whole thing a little better with less shadows.', '2004-12-03 00:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044209, 125211, 18197, '<td valign="top">There have been a lot of coin shots this challenge. They all suffer from weak compositions in my opinion, as does this one. Otherwise a well executed and workmanlike photo.</td>', 'There have been a lot of coin shots this challenge. They all suffer from weak compositions in my opinion, as does this one. Otherwise a well executed and workmanlike photo.', '2004-12-03 00:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044211, 124465, 29777, '<td valign="top">Interesting. What is it? cool shot.</td>', 'Interesting. What is it? cool shot.', '2004-12-03 00:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044214, 125207, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. You lost me a bit with the title, but I can''t hold it against you. There would be a number of refinements that would improve it in advanced editing but all would get you DQ''e here. Good job.</td>', 'Nice photo. You lost me a bit with the title, but I can''t hold it against you. There would be a number of refinements that would improve it in advanced editing but all would get you DQ''e here. Good job.', '2004-12-03 00:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
