(1044231, 125020, 18197, '<td valign="top">Hey, this is good! + points for creative. Nice implied lines. Good range of tones. It feels a little tipped to me, but that adds a sense of dynamics to it. Nicely done.</td>', 'Hey, this is good! + points for creative. Nice implied lines. Good range of tones. It feels a little tipped to me, but that adds a sense of dynamics to it. Nicely done.', '2004-12-03 00:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
