(1044239, 125077, 26151, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but you should have told that one ant to straighten himself out a little.  :) Like the composition. I like how there is a definitive edge to the goo (honey?), and that it''s not jagged. Not that it would be jagged, but i like that it''s not.</td>', 'Very nice, but you should have told that one ant to straighten himself out a little.  :) Like the composition. I like how there is a definitive edge to the goo (honey?), and that it''s not jagged. Not that it would be jagged, but i like that it''s not.', '2004-12-03 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
