(1044796, 124765, 25095, '<td valign="top">Cute idea but being your subject is supposed to be 7 of the same object (which you have done) I feel your title makes the person think more the ball than the worms which makes the worms unnecessary and maybe even distracting.  Maybe something like "Hey thats our hole!"<br/>Ok just noticed the 7 black grate holes surrounding the ball in the hole and maybe you were going after that but then why the worms?  I''m confused.  Sorry</td>', 'Cute idea but being your subject is supposed to be 7 of the same object (which you have done) I feel your title makes the person think more the ball than the worms which makes the worms unnecessary and maybe even distracting.  Maybe something like "Hey thats our hole!"Ok just noticed the 7 black grate holes surrounding the ball in the hole and maybe you were going after that but then why the worms?  I''m confused.  Sorry', '2004-12-03 14:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1044800, 125106, 28299, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot! Yeah, I really like this - the color, background, transparency ...</td>', 'Very cool shot! Yeah, I really like this - the color, background, transparency ...', '2004-12-03 14:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
