(1044862, 123839, 26756, '<td valign="top">Great idea for a subject.  The lighting is really great and the whole compostion of the droplets, not just the seven for your subject really makes this photo pleasant to look at.</td>', 'Great idea for a subject.  The lighting is really great and the whole compostion of the droplets, not just the seven for your subject really makes this photo pleasant to look at.', '2004-12-03 15:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
