(1044874, 123892, 25095, '<td valign="top">where is the 7 items?  I admit the shape of the pipe and the droplet do sort of make a 7 but still a stretch for the challenge.  If your seven items are here I would recommend the title reflecting that somehow instead of the droplet.</td>', 'where is the 7 items?  I admit the shape of the pipe and the droplet do sort of make a 7 but still a stretch for the challenge.  If your seven items are here I would recommend the title reflecting that somehow instead of the droplet.', '2004-12-03 15:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
