(1045218, 125195, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and the cropping is just right.  Far from being the typical flower shot.  It has a strong resemblance to a expressionistic painting.  It''s subtle and smooth / explosive and aggressive at the same time.</td>', 'Very good composition and the cropping is just right.  Far from being the typical flower shot.  It has a strong resemblance to a expressionistic painting.  It''s subtle and smooth / explosive and aggressive at the same time.', '2004-12-03 20:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045219, 124289, 22384, '<td valign="top">For a photo like this, I would set aperture low so that you can get a larger depth of field so that all of your grapes would be in focus. I am not a stickler about every detail being in focus, but it would lend itself well to this photo, however. The shadows and reflections below the grapes are a nice touch.</td>', 'For a photo like this, I would set aperture low so that you can get a larger depth of field so that all of your grapes would be in focus. I am not a stickler about every detail being in focus, but it would lend itself well to this photo, however. The shadows and reflections below the grapes are a nice touch.', '2004-12-03 20:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045220, 124037, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is a striking image.The range of colors in the sky is amazing. Nice shot.</td>', 'This is a striking image.The range of colors in the sky is amazing. Nice shot.', '2004-12-03 20:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
