(1045238, 125209, 22384, '<td valign="top">In this shot with all the elegant silver and black and clean lines, all the images should be crisp and in focus. I am not a stickler for everything being in focus in every photo, but with this composition, I think it is essential. Having everything in focus would bump it up to the top end of the scale.</td>', 'In this shot with all the elegant silver and black and clean lines, all the images should be crisp and in focus. I am not a stickler for everything being in focus in every photo, but with this composition, I think it is essential. Having everything in focus would bump it up to the top end of the scale.', '2004-12-03 20:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045241, 125064, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like this one, it''s raw and random.</td>', 'I like this one, it''s raw and random.', '2004-12-03 20:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045244, 124230, 24642, '<td valign="top">Cheap and clever.  Very nice work with colours and light.  I would have used more negative space at the top.</td>', 'Cheap and clever.  Very nice work with colours and light.  I would have used more negative space at the top.', '2004-12-03 20:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045247, 124639, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good work with texture and light.  The placement of the handles is a bit distracting.  If placed at the sides they could have been cropped out.</td>', 'Good work with texture and light.  The placement of the handles is a bit distracting.  If placed at the sides they could have been cropped out.', '2004-12-03 20:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045250, 124827, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of having  dice of a different color, but I think it would have been more effective if both of the colored dice were the same different color (does that even make sense?) The dots showing through the pink die are distracting. I like the choice of having the dice in the background in softer focus. Great blue background. The reflection is interesting. Maybe you could play that up a bit.</td>', 'I like the idea of having  dice of a different color, but I think it would have been more effective if both of the colored dice were the same different color (does that even make sense?) The dots showing through the pink die are distracting. I like the choice of having the dice in the background in softer focus. Great blue background. The reflection is interesting. Maybe you could play that up a bit.', '2004-12-03 20:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045252, 124879, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very good title.</td>', 'Very good title.', '2004-12-03 20:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045255, 124025, 22384, '<td valign="top">Oh, there it is. I missed the gloved hand for a minute. Interesting photo. It is fascinating how different hands can look. The composition is a bit messy or unbalanced, but you would have to play around with it to see what would be better.  Fun idea.</td>', 'Oh, there it is. I missed the gloved hand for a minute. Interesting photo. It is fascinating how different hands can look. The composition is a bit messy or unbalanced, but you would have to play around with it to see what would be better.  Fun idea.', '2004-12-03 20:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
