(1045262, 124565, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like this minimalistic shot.  Nice work with reflections and the composition is good.</td>', 'I like this minimalistic shot.  Nice work with reflections and the composition is good.', '2004-12-03 20:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045263, 124061, 24579, '<td valign="top">amazing shot 9</td>', 'amazing shot 9', '2004-12-03 20:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045265, 124125, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  The blue area of the sky has a perfect placing.</td>', 'Good composition.  The blue area of the sky has a perfect placing.', '2004-12-03 20:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045266, 125052, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like this. This is the rare case where I would like to see the image centered and the end spools within the frame. I would crop up the bottom a bit. The reflection is nice, but you allow it to dominate the photo; it should simply enhance the main subject.The fact that the spools are not perfect and symetrical really adds interest, but that is the reason that this image needs to be centered; their imperfections, and of course the color,  should be what capture the viewers attention. Great idea and your color choices work well.</td>', 'I like this. This is the rare case where I would like to see the image centered and the end spools within the frame. I would crop up the bottom a bit. The reflection is nice, but you allow it to dominate the photo; it should simply enhance the main subject.The fact that the spools are not perfect and symetrical really adds interest, but that is the reason that this image needs to be centered; their imperfections, and of course the color,  should be what capture the viewers attention. Great idea and your color choices work well.', '2004-12-03 20:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045272, 123988, 22384, '<td valign="top">Risky and daring, which I normally like, but this is just a little too sparse for me. I am not sure what this is the foundation of... oh...wait...maybe I get it...it''s seven cornerstones...no? I guess,  I just don''t get it.</td>', 'Risky and daring, which I normally like, but this is just a little too sparse for me. I am not sure what this is the foundation of... oh...wait...maybe I get it...it''s seven cornerstones...no? I guess,  I just don''t get it.', '2004-12-03 21:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045275, 125189, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice dreamy effect. I would like a focal point of some sort or a hint of one. I know, I know, with seven, how does one accomplish a focal point? Fair enough.</td>', 'Nice dreamy effect. I would like a focal point of some sort or a hint of one. I know, I know, with seven, how does one accomplish a focal point? Fair enough.', '2004-12-03 21:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
