(1045281, 124778, 24642, '<td valign="top">I would like less tight cropping.  Otherwise flawless composition, beautiful colours and very good lighting.</td>', 'I would like less tight cropping.  Otherwise flawless composition, beautiful colours and very good lighting.', '2004-12-03 21:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045282, 124778, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color. Simple elegance. The tips of some of the leaves look oversharpened. Forgive me if I am wrong and it is a natural lighting effect. Beautiful image.</td>', 'Nice composition and color. Simple elegance. The tips of some of the leaves look oversharpened. Forgive me if I am wrong and it is a natural lighting effect. Beautiful image.', '2004-12-03 21:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045287, 124152, 22384, '<td valign="top">Soft, smooth, earthy, and so elegant. Although the crabby cynics will probably criticize the feather, I think it is the perfect touch. The soft, fuzzy, fluff contrasts so well with the smooth clean lines of the eggs. An easy 8. Nice job.</td>', 'Soft, smooth, earthy, and so elegant. Although the crabby cynics will probably criticize the feather, I think it is the perfect touch. The soft, fuzzy, fluff contrasts so well with the smooth clean lines of the eggs. An easy 8. Nice job.', '2004-12-03 21:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045289, 124119, 15029, '<td valign="top">the brown streak is a bit destracting, but I like the lighting</td>', 'the brown streak is a bit destracting, but I like the lighting', '2004-12-03 21:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045290, 124396, 15029, '<td valign="top">this shot looks a bit overexposed</td>', 'this shot looks a bit overexposed', '2004-12-03 21:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045293, 125185, 22384, '<td valign="top">Now, why didn''t I think of this. Great line and color. I would like to see the thumb in focus. Also, and I admit that I am being a bit a.r. here, but I would like to see a clean fingernail since this shot is all about clean lines and neat colors.</td>', 'Now, why didn''t I think of this. Great line and color. I would like to see the thumb in focus. Also, and I admit that I am being a bit a.r. here, but I would like to see a clean fingernail since this shot is all about clean lines and neat colors.', '2004-12-03 21:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045294, 125098, 15029, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I don''t see seven of anything. The shot looks blurred and over-sharpened. The colors are nice though. Maby using a faster shutter would make the shot sharper.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t see seven of anything. The shot looks blurred and over-sharpened. The colors are nice though. Maby using a faster shutter would make the shot sharper.', '2004-12-03 21:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045295, 125194, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Very fun. The brilliance is in the concept. Nice execution, too. The point of view, from under the cookie sheet, is the perfect touch.</td>', 'Great idea. Very fun. The brilliance is in the concept. Nice execution, too. The point of view, from under the cookie sheet, is the perfect touch.', '2004-12-03 21:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045296, 124275, 15029, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but for some reason, the shot feels alkward. maby a larger aperature would help</td>', 'I like the idea, but for some reason, the shot feels alkward. maby a larger aperature would help', '2004-12-03 21:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045298, 124767, 15029, '<td valign="top">This shot seems very grainy</td>', 'This shot seems very grainy', '2004-12-03 21:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045300, 125201, 27639, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but the background is too busy.</td>', 'nice idea, but the background is too busy.', '2004-12-03 21:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045301, 124518, 15029, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot. I love how the light flters through. Unfourtunately, I can''t see seven steps, and they are not the subject. This would have don well if it had met the challenge.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot. I love how the light flters through. Unfourtunately, I can''t see seven steps, and they are not the subject. This would have don well if it had met the challenge.', '2004-12-03 21:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045303, 125043, 22384, '<td valign="top">This would be a cool idea for a calendar; I like the simple elegance of it.  Nice textures and composition. What do these look like in color? How about desaturated 50%? Maybe with a little color there would be a whisper of their past life. REally nice shot.</td>', 'This would be a cool idea for a calendar; I like the simple elegance of it.  Nice textures and composition. What do these look like in color? How about desaturated 50%? Maybe with a little color there would be a whisper of their past life. REally nice shot.', '2004-12-03 21:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045304, 125074, 15029, '<td valign="top">I like the seemingly random layout of the forks. Maby this shot would look better if the background was more white.</td>', 'I like the seemingly random layout of the forks. Maby this shot would look better if the background was more white.', '2004-12-03 21:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045306, 125210, 15029, '<td valign="top">The orientation of the candles makes this shot look really funky. It looks like the shot was taken with the paper pattern on the bottom, and inverted.</td>', 'The orientation of the candles makes this shot look really funky. It looks like the shot was taken with the paper pattern on the bottom, and inverted.', '2004-12-03 21:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045309, 124635, 15029, '<td valign="top">nice. The color of the pennies is beautifull, and the 7 is well shaped. If only there wasn''t all that white stuff on the background.</td>', 'nice. The color of the pennies is beautifull, and the 7 is well shaped. If only there wasn''t all that white stuff on the background.', '2004-12-03 21:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045310, 125140, 22384, '<td valign="top">Oh, I get it now. When I saw the thumbnail, I was wondering how the artist did this. Great idea. Dazzling image. My teenage daughter just walked in and saw this image. Her response was, "Hey, cool. Did you do that?" Sadly, I had to admit I didn''t. Most excellent!  A 9, no doubt.</td>', 'Oh, I get it now. When I saw the thumbnail, I was wondering how the artist did this. Great idea. Dazzling image. My teenage daughter just walked in and saw this image. Her response was, "Hey, cool. Did you do that?" Sadly, I had to admit I didn''t. Most excellent!  A 9, no doubt.', '2004-12-03 21:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045311, 124314, 15029, '<td valign="top">the lighting gives a really neat effect. I like how the focal point is the large marble.</td>', 'the lighting gives a really neat effect. I like how the focal point is the large marble.', '2004-12-03 21:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045312, 125029, 15029, '<td valign="top">very neat. I like the reflection on the ground.</td>', 'very neat. I like the reflection on the ground.', '2004-12-03 21:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045313, 124927, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great color and line. The harsh reflection on the first brush and the stray thread are a distraction. Fascinating framing.</td>', 'Great color and line. The harsh reflection on the first brush and the stray thread are a distraction. Fascinating framing.', '2004-12-03 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045314, 125171, 15029, '<td valign="top">It''s wierd, but I feel that the focal point is the sock thingy sticking out in the gottom left hand corner. The lockers seem a bit OOF</td>', 'It''s wierd, but I feel that the focal point is the sock thingy sticking out in the gottom left hand corner. The lockers seem a bit OOF', '2004-12-03 21:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045315, 124721, 15029, '<td valign="top">sorry, but without the title, this wouldn''t have anything to do with 7</td>', 'sorry, but without the title, this wouldn''t have anything to do with 7', '2004-12-03 21:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045316, 124155, 15029, '<td valign="top">beautifull. I like the idea of using a macro shot</td>', 'beautifull. I like the idea of using a macro shot', '2004-12-03 21:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045317, 123712, 22384, '<td valign="top">How about a seven-seven with your clubs? The liquid in the glass is the true focal point, and it is dazzling. The cards are slightly out of focus. I would like them to either be softer focus or crisp and tight like the glass. Nice shot.</td>', 'How about a seven-seven with your clubs? The liquid in the glass is the true focal point, and it is dazzling. The cards are slightly out of focus. I would like them to either be softer focus or crisp and tight like the glass. Nice shot.', '2004-12-03 21:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045318, 125137, 15029, '<td valign="top">the shadows make it look litke there''s more.</td>', 'the shadows make it look litke there''s more.', '2004-12-03 21:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045319, 124383, 15029, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the perspective</td>', 'I like the lighting and the perspective', '2004-12-03 21:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045320, 125134, 15029, '<td valign="top">seems a bit OOF</td>', 'seems a bit OOF', '2004-12-03 21:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045321, 124975, 22384, '<td valign="top">Very nice. If you could have shot it so that there were no shadows it would have been amazing. Great idea and nice execution.</td>', 'Very nice. If you could have shot it so that there were no shadows it would have been amazing. Great idea and nice execution.', '2004-12-03 21:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045323, 123930, 15029, '<td valign="top">his is really nice. I like the composition and the color of the stalks</td>', 'his is really nice. I like the composition and the color of the stalks', '2004-12-03 21:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045327, 125011, 15029, '<td valign="top">this is really disorienting. I''m not sure I like the angle of view. it seems a bit OOF</td>', 'this is really disorienting. I''m not sure I like the angle of view. it seems a bit OOF', '2004-12-03 21:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045328, 125134, 27639, '<td valign="top">where did you get green toonies?</td>', 'where did you get green toonies?', '2004-12-03 21:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045329, 125175, 15029, '<td valign="top">sorry, but there''s not 7 in the picture at all</td>', 'sorry, but there''s not 7 in the picture at all', '2004-12-03 21:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045331, 124684, 15029, '<td valign="top">Maby this shot would be better if it were a tighter crop.</td>', 'Maby this shot would be better if it were a tighter crop.', '2004-12-03 21:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045333, 124811, 22384, '<td valign="top">Now, where in the world would a person find this? Fascinating image. Didn''t these people use know about Soft Scrub? Actually, the rust and stains are a nice touch. Great idea. Seven "S" words in your title, too. Imagine that. Great fun.</td>', 'Now, where in the world would a person find this? Fascinating image. Didn''t these people use know about Soft Scrub? Actually, the rust and stains are a nice touch. Great idea. Seven "S" words in your title, too. Imagine that. Great fun.', '2004-12-03 21:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045334, 125170, 15029, '<td valign="top">the brown smudge is destracting</td>', 'the brown smudge is destracting', '2004-12-03 21:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045335, 124150, 22384, '<td valign="top">Elegant and fascinating. What is it? Should I know?</td>', 'Elegant and fascinating. What is it? Should I know?', '2004-12-03 21:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045337, 124137, 27639, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous shot! I love frangipanis. They look perfect in this photo.</td>', 'What a gorgeous shot! I love frangipanis. They look perfect in this photo.', '2004-12-03 21:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045339, 124777, 27639, '<td valign="top">heehee...very cute.</td>', 'heehee...very cute.', '2004-12-03 21:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045343, 125188, 22384, '<td valign="top">I tried candles, too, but I got nothing like this. I really like it. Soothing and elegant, a difficult combination to achieve. Red and black with candle flames: always a good choice.</td>', 'I tried candles, too, but I got nothing like this. I really like it. Soothing and elegant, a difficult combination to achieve. Red and black with candle flames: always a good choice.', '2004-12-03 21:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045348, 125199, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great shiny and shimery sparkles: appropriate for the season. The only thing I would change is the soft focus on the glitter swirl in the foreground. Beautiful colors and composition.</td>', 'Great shiny and shimery sparkles: appropriate for the season. The only thing I would change is the soft focus on the glitter swirl in the foreground. Beautiful colors and composition.', '2004-12-03 21:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045361, 124119, 22384, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the elegant simplicity of this. Great use of lighting to enhance texture. Beautiful.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the elegant simplicity of this. Great use of lighting to enhance texture. Beautiful.', '2004-12-03 21:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045363, 125093, 15029, '<td valign="top">the tiles are a bit OOF</td>', 'the tiles are a bit OOF', '2004-12-03 21:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045367, 125018, 15029, '<td valign="top">I like the humor of the huge pieces</td>', 'I like the humor of the huge pieces', '2004-12-03 21:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045370, 123912, 15029, '<td valign="top">interesting feel. very dark.</td>', 'interesting feel. very dark.', '2004-12-03 21:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045419, 125042, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a cute shot.  Definately seven of the subject.  Focus on the birds seems a little soft, but they are small subjects, so I wouldn''t expect too much detail in them anyway, so it''s ok.  The lighting looks like it could have been a pretty overcast day, which makes the birds look a little dark.  I like the horizontal way you framed the photo as well.  Almost perfect from lower left to upper right.  Cute shot for the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'This is a cute shot.  Definately seven of the subject.  Focus on the birds seems a little soft, but they are small subjects, so I wouldn''t expect too much detail in them anyway, so it''s ok.  The lighting looks like it could have been a pretty overcast day, which makes the birds look a little dark.  I like the horizontal way you framed the photo as well.  Almost perfect from lower left to upper right.  Cute shot for the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 22:44:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1045421, 125153, 3080, '<td valign="top">Focus is quite soft on the bracelets.  I would prefer this with crisp focus.  The lighting is also not right. looks like a low light shot with flash.  See the horrible shadow under the arm on the wall.  Some ways to fix this would be to not use the flash, use as much other light as possilbe and move away from the wall some.  The subjects are interesting and there are definately 7 of them.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Focus is quite soft on the bracelets.  I would prefer this with crisp focus.  The lighting is also not right. looks like a low light shot with flash.  See the horrible shadow under the arm on the wall.  Some ways to fix this would be to not use the flash, use as much other light as possilbe and move away from the wall some.  The subjects are interesting and there are definately 7 of them.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 22:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045425, 124314, 3080, '<td valign="top">I found them!  There they are.  I like the creative way you used lighting to give this visual appeal.  I like the background, nothing distracting about that.  I think that the colors in the marbles are good, and focus and clarity are also good.  I like the arrangement very much.  The shadows are what make this for me I think.  Nice fun shot or a simple subject...7 simple subjects.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'I found them!  There they are.  I like the creative way you used lighting to give this visual appeal.  I like the background, nothing distracting about that.  I think that the colors in the marbles are good, and focus and clarity are also good.  I like the arrangement very much.  The shadows are what make this for me I think.  Nice fun shot or a simple subject...7 simple subjects.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 22:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045433, 125098, 3080, '<td valign="top">This photo is really busy.  There ARE 7 of the horses, but I think they don''t stand out enough to make for a very exciting photo.  all of the horses are incomplete.  I would like to have seen at least one complete horse.  (not cropped off by the border, or hidden behind another horse)  the focus is ok on the horses, but the girl is really blurred, which creates a distraction.   One thing that is really bothering me is the vertical line which seperates the photo directly in half running from top to bottom in the center of the photo.  Generally, stong lines that divide a photo are not good, and this is no exception.  Nice color near the top of the photo though. ~Heather~</td>', 'This photo is really busy.  There ARE 7 of the horses, but I think they don''t stand out enough to make for a very exciting photo.  all of the horses are incomplete.  I would like to have seen at least one complete horse.  (not cropped off by the border, or hidden behind another horse)  the focus is ok on the horses, but the girl is really blurred, which creates a distraction.   One thing that is really bothering me is the vertical line which seperates the photo directly in half running from top to bottom in the center of the photo.  Generally, stong lines that divide a photo are not good, and this is no exception.  Nice color near the top of the photo though. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 22:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045439, 124721, 3080, '<td valign="top">I can''t actually SEE 7 of anything.  Your title implies that there are 7 of something, but without your title, I would not know that.  I think this is a poor stretch at the challenge.  As for the photo itself, The sky is bland, the focus is soft, and it''s quite busy, with nothing interesting for my eyes to rest on.  I''m just not drawn into this shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'I can''t actually SEE 7 of anything.  Your title implies that there are 7 of something, but without your title, I would not know that.  I think this is a poor stretch at the challenge.  As for the photo itself, The sky is bland, the focus is soft, and it''s quite busy, with nothing interesting for my eyes to rest on.  I''m just not drawn into this shot. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 22:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045445, 125187, 3080, '<td valign="top">That last one kind of blend into the background, not knowing that I am suposed to be looking for 7 of them, I may not even notice it at all.  The lighting on that post to the right of the photo is harsh, making that post stand out quite a bit.  I think that the DOF is good, and focus is right where it should be.  the horizontal post running through the center of the photo is distracting.  I think that the color of the barbs is cool, and looks good against the color of the background.  interesting take on the challenge, wish we could see that last barb better. ~Heather~</td>', 'That last one kind of blend into the background, not knowing that I am suposed to be looking for 7 of them, I may not even notice it at all.  The lighting on that post to the right of the photo is harsh, making that post stand out quite a bit.  I think that the DOF is good, and focus is right where it should be.  the horizontal post running through the center of the photo is distracting.  I think that the color of the barbs is cool, and looks good against the color of the background.  interesting take on the challenge, wish we could see that last barb better. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045453, 124823, 3080, '<td valign="top">I can''t really tell what that little figuring is, which makes it distracting.  It kind of looks like a little pewter girl, but I''m not sure.  She''s awefully dark and small.  doesn''t seem to fit in well with the cards.  I think if it were not there, it wouldn''t hurt the photo at all in my opinion.  I like the card tower, and there are definately 7 cards.  focus appears good, and there is nothing distracting in the background.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I can''t really tell what that little figuring is, which makes it distracting.  It kind of looks like a little pewter girl, but I''m not sure.  She''s awefully dark and small.  doesn''t seem to fit in well with the cards.  I think if it were not there, it wouldn''t hurt the photo at all in my opinion.  I like the card tower, and there are definately 7 cards.  focus appears good, and there is nothing distracting in the background.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045456, 124813, 3080, '<td valign="top">I came across this shot the other day, and wasn''t sure what I could say about it.  What I wanted to say was that you can''t really see all the leaves well, and the bottom leaf on the left has some really strange motion marks on it.  trailing from the top.  I don''t think I prefer that.  Not sure what purpose it plays.  I like the color of the shot, and the lighitng is interesting, just not quite bright enough on the right side leaves.  I like the lighting on the bottom left leaf, just not the lines coming from the top of it.  overall very interesting shot though, and fits the challenge.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I came across this shot the other day, and wasn''t sure what I could say about it.  What I wanted to say was that you can''t really see all the leaves well, and the bottom leaf on the left has some really strange motion marks on it.  trailing from the top.  I don''t think I prefer that.  Not sure what purpose it plays.  I like the color of the shot, and the lighitng is interesting, just not quite bright enough on the right side leaves.  I like the lighting on the bottom left leaf, just not the lines coming from the top of it.  overall very interesting shot though, and fits the challenge.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045462, 124881, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think I''m missing something, because I''m not seeing 7 of anything in this shot.  I see 1 house, with 8 chimneys, 2 roofs, 11 windows, one fence, one driveway, a mountain with 8 humps, a sky and some water.  I have looked at this for a long time, and do not see 7 of any subject.  Sorry.  Now, as for the photo itself, it''s stunning...I couldn''t imaging having that view.  very beautiful.  the angle and framing/cropping is nice, and the scene is great.  My only small complaint is that the house seems to be a bit dark.  Overall lthough, very nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'I think I''m missing something, because I''m not seeing 7 of anything in this shot.  I see 1 house, with 8 chimneys, 2 roofs, 11 windows, one fence, one driveway, a mountain with 8 humps, a sky and some water.  I have looked at this for a long time, and do not see 7 of any subject.  Sorry.  Now, as for the photo itself, it''s stunning...I couldn''t imaging having that view.  very beautiful.  the angle and framing/cropping is nice, and the scene is great.  My only small complaint is that the house seems to be a bit dark.  Overall lthough, very nice. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045464, 124354, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Not quite sure the purpose of the little man, but he does help to add something interesting to the shot as well...it''s now not JUST a photo of some cards.  The background is very nice, I like the blue.  Focus and clarity are really great on the cards, and DOF is good as well.  I think that I do like this shot, my only tiny nitpic is the black line across the bottom of the photo in the lower left hand corner.  Kind of a distraction in an otherwise bright and fun photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Not quite sure the purpose of the little man, but he does help to add something interesting to the shot as well...it''s now not JUST a photo of some cards.  The background is very nice, I like the blue.  Focus and clarity are really great on the cards, and DOF is good as well.  I think that I do like this shot, my only tiny nitpic is the black line across the bottom of the photo in the lower left hand corner.  Kind of a distraction in an otherwise bright and fun photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045471, 125192, 3080, '<td valign="top">I wonder if anyone is going to be a jerk enough to count the noteBOOK as a book, and say you don''t meet the challenge. lol. Some people amaze me these days with how picky they are with these challenges.  Anyway, I like the feel of this photo.  Looks very educational.  Focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  I like the darkness of the photo, but the brightness of the whites.  makes it interesting that way.  I would not remove or add anything to the photo.  I like the cup and glasses, and it is not too busy, but gives the eyes lots to look at.  nice. ~Hether~</td>', 'I wonder if anyone is going to be a jerk enough to count the noteBOOK as a book, and say you don''t meet the challenge. lol. Some people amaze me these days with how picky they are with these challenges.  Anyway, I like the feel of this photo.  Looks very educational.  Focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  I like the darkness of the photo, but the brightness of the whites.  makes it interesting that way.  I would not remove or add anything to the photo.  I like the cup and glasses, and it is not too busy, but gives the eyes lots to look at.  nice. ~Hether~', '2004-12-03 23:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045475, 125172, 3080, '<td valign="top">My brain wants to tell me that the 7 pills laying on the table are subject, but there are more than 7 pills in the photo.  Sooo...since there are 7 days in the week, and 7 little cups for pills, I''ll say this meets the challenge.  On that note, I don''t find it very interesting though.  Guess I''m just not drawn in.  Maybe it''s cause I have to take 9 different medications a day, and find the subject just unappealing.  The lighting on the pills is also very bright and the pills closest to the bottom of the photo are quite blown out and too bright.  Focus seems a bit soft on the pills, but ok on the orange pill box.  background color makes the photo also seem like the white balance was off.  definately a different take on the challenge though. ~heather~</td>', 'My brain wants to tell me that the 7 pills laying on the table are subject, but there are more than 7 pills in the photo.  Sooo...since there are 7 days in the week, and 7 little cups for pills, I''ll say this meets the challenge.  On that note, I don''t find it very interesting though.  Guess I''m just not drawn in.  Maybe it''s cause I have to take 9 different medications a day, and find the subject just unappealing.  The lighting on the pills is also very bright and the pills closest to the bottom of the photo are quite blown out and too bright.  Focus seems a bit soft on the pills, but ok on the orange pill box.  background color makes the photo also seem like the white balance was off.  definately a different take on the challenge though. ~heather~', '2004-12-03 23:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045476, 124743, 3080, '<td valign="top">Kind of cute, but why are they outside on what looks like a roof?  seems a bit odd product placement to me.  Like the commercial that has the breast enlargement pills sitting in a stream of really cold looking water.  what?? lol.  anyway, I like the colors, and they look good against the sky...the lower 1/4 of the photo is not appealing to me, and I think could be cropped out without any bad side effects.  focus and calrity seem good and otherwise, a nice fun shot.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Kind of cute, but why are they outside on what looks like a roof?  seems a bit odd product placement to me.  Like the commercial that has the breast enlargement pills sitting in a stream of really cold looking water.  what?? lol.  anyway, I like the colors, and they look good against the sky...the lower 1/4 of the photo is not appealing to me, and I think could be cropped out without any bad side effects.  focus and calrity seem good and otherwise, a nice fun shot.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045477, 124267, 3080, '<td valign="top">Creepy looking birds.  Funny shot though.  The whole photo is too grey.  not very much tonal range.  any way to boost up the white without blowing parts of the photo out?  kind of reminds me of a photo which is in a newspaper.  really grey, you know?  I like how the birds are set up, I think that''s funny.  The background is good, nothing distracting there.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Creepy looking birds.  Funny shot though.  The whole photo is too grey.  not very much tonal range.  any way to boost up the white without blowing parts of the photo out?  kind of reminds me of a photo which is in a newspaper.  really grey, you know?  I like how the birds are set up, I think that''s funny.  The background is good, nothing distracting there.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045481, 125013, 3080, '<td valign="top">I want some of that!  lol.  Fun shot.  focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping you chose is also good.  I like how you placed the cards and money.  I can''t say this is the only shot of cards in the challenge, but still ok.  I like the background, nothing distracting there.  Overall a fun shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'I want some of that!  lol.  Fun shot.  focus and clarity are good, and the angle and framing/cropping you chose is also good.  I like how you placed the cards and money.  I can''t say this is the only shot of cards in the challenge, but still ok.  I like the background, nothing distracting there.  Overall a fun shot. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045486, 124894, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your main subject being the meatballs are wuite out of focus.  The word 7 is nicely focussed, making that appear to be the main subject, however, that''s not what you have 7 of.  There are times when that little doll works, and some times when he doesn''t.  I think this is one of the times he doesn''t.  I think this shot has potential, but would definately like to see the main subject IN focus.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Your main subject being the meatballs are wuite out of focus.  The word 7 is nicely focussed, making that appear to be the main subject, however, that''s not what you have 7 of.  There are times when that little doll works, and some times when he doesn''t.  I think this is one of the times he doesn''t.  I think this shot has potential, but would definately like to see the main subject IN focus.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045488, 124765, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is the second time I''ve ran across this shot, and really am not quite sure what to say.  Without trying to be mean, it doesn''t appeal to me at all.  Maybe you have to be a golfer to get it?  There are 7 of the subject, I''ll give you that, but they don''t attract my attention nor does the golf theme.  Focus and clarity seem good, and lighting is ok, except on the ball which is a little dark, but that''s ok.  I like how you placed the ball and cup to the left of the photo, definately better than directly in the center of the shot.  Technically good, just not my thing. ~Heather~</td>', 'This is the second time I''ve ran across this shot, and really am not quite sure what to say.  Without trying to be mean, it doesn''t appeal to me at all.  Maybe you have to be a golfer to get it?  There are 7 of the subject, I''ll give you that, but they don''t attract my attention nor does the golf theme.  Focus and clarity seem good, and lighting is ok, except on the ball which is a little dark, but that''s ok.  I like how you placed the ball and cup to the left of the photo, definately better than directly in the center of the shot.  Technically good, just not my thing. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045494, 124289, 3080, '<td valign="top">Why yes, yes they are.  2 things bugging me about this shot right away.  first, the strong horizontal line in the background is not straight.  my big pet peeve.  it''s very close, but seems to round near the right edge of the photo.  blame it on my OCD. lol.  second, is the reflections on the grapes of the lighting.  It''s really bright and stands out on the second grape from the back.  that one is a distraction.  Also, the 3rd grape from the back is crooket compared to the rest.  In a photo where the main impact is the line up, I think it''s really important to get the line up straight.  I think this is a fun shot, and there are definately 7 of your subject.  I also like the DOF.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Why yes, yes they are.  2 things bugging me about this shot right away.  first, the strong horizontal line in the background is not straight.  my big pet peeve.  it''s very close, but seems to round near the right edge of the photo.  blame it on my OCD. lol.  second, is the reflections on the grapes of the lighting.  It''s really bright and stands out on the second grape from the back.  that one is a distraction.  Also, the 3rd grape from the back is crooket compared to the rest.  In a photo where the main impact is the line up, I think it''s really important to get the line up straight.  I think this is a fun shot, and there are definately 7 of your subject.  I also like the DOF.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045497, 124778, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like it. Definately 7 of the subject.  Focus and clarity are good, lighting is what really makes this for me though.  I like the orange feel of the whole photo even though the background is black, it still is a very warm looking shot.  I think there is nothing distracting from the subject.  guess my only small pick is that I wish the stem going into the left corner were shorter, but then the leaves would be too close to the edges of the photo, if not cropped off, and that would be bad too, so I think you made a good choice with the framing.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I like it. Definately 7 of the subject.  Focus and clarity are good, lighting is what really makes this for me though.  I like the orange feel of the whole photo even though the background is black, it still is a very warm looking shot.  I think there is nothing distracting from the subject.  guess my only small pick is that I wish the stem going into the left corner were shorter, but then the leaves would be too close to the edges of the photo, if not cropped off, and that would be bad too, so I think you made a good choice with the framing.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045500, 124764, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think this will be a winner.  I really do.  I like the colors, your focus and clarity are great, your angle and set up is great.  very visually appealing and you have 7 of the subject.  I feel like I should request the original now, cause I''m just going to have to do it when the challenge ends and you place in the top anyway. lol.  beautiful shot.  congrats and good luck in the challenge. not like you''ll need it. ~Heather~</td>', 'I think this will be a winner.  I really do.  I like the colors, your focus and clarity are great, your angle and set up is great.  very visually appealing and you have 7 of the subject.  I feel like I should request the original now, cause I''m just going to have to do it when the challenge ends and you place in the top anyway. lol.  beautiful shot.  congrats and good luck in the challenge. not like you''ll need it. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
