(1045514, 124936, 3080, '<td valign="top">Can obviously tell these are on a glass because of the random speckles in the sky.  I guess my real problem with this shot is WHY?  Why are there ''pepers in the sky''.  There are definately 7 of them...but horrible ''product placement'' so to speak.  Focus seems ok.  the trees in the background are distracting and I''m just not drawn into the photo.  Seems to out of place.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Can obviously tell these are on a glass because of the random speckles in the sky.  I guess my real problem with this shot is WHY?  Why are there ''pepers in the sky''.  There are definately 7 of them...but horrible ''product placement'' so to speak.  Focus seems ok.  the trees in the background are distracting and I''m just not drawn into the photo.  Seems to out of place.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045518, 124771, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wonder how many people will notice that the 7 little plants are in the shape OF a 7?  I noticed! lol.  Focus seems good, lighting seems good.  set up is nice.  background is a bit busy.  lots going on back there.  sticks going one way, sticks going another way...would prefer some other background on this.  Otherwise cute shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'Wonder how many people will notice that the 7 little plants are in the shape OF a 7?  I noticed! lol.  Focus seems good, lighting seems good.  set up is nice.  background is a bit busy.  lots going on back there.  sticks going one way, sticks going another way...would prefer some other background on this.  Otherwise cute shot. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045521, 124294, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m going to blame my obsessive compulsive disorder for this...but this shot bugs the heck out of me. lol.  You have all the colors of the rainbow, but they aren''t in the rainbow ORDER.  Totally not your fault...but my brain really wants to see them in order...that''s like taking the alphabet, mixing it all up, and then looking at it.  I would never be able to look at these every day...it would bug the hell out of me.  About your shot...Good focus, good lighting, nice bright colors, blue sky, don''t like the bushes in front, not your fault.  fun shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m going to blame my obsessive compulsive disorder for this...but this shot bugs the heck out of me. lol.  You have all the colors of the rainbow, but they aren''t in the rainbow ORDER.  Totally not your fault...but my brain really wants to see them in order...that''s like taking the alphabet, mixing it all up, and then looking at it.  I would never be able to look at these every day...it would bug the hell out of me.  About your shot...Good focus, good lighting, nice bright colors, blue sky, don''t like the bushes in front, not your fault.  fun shot. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045522, 125181, 3080, '<td valign="top">This could work cute on a xmas card, or a birthday card most likely.  I think it''s cute.  I like how they are not all ''looking'' at the camera, a couple are sideways, not perfectly lined up.  makes it interesting.  I think you did a good job with placement.  My only thing I would change is that I wouldn''t put the 2 with blue dresses together.  I''d seperate them maybe switch the second one from the left with the one on the right.  that way, the 2 blues are on the end.  good focus and clarity, nice background, like the shelf too.  very nice shot...oh..and definately 7 of the subject. ~Heather~</td>', 'This could work cute on a xmas card, or a birthday card most likely.  I think it''s cute.  I like how they are not all ''looking'' at the camera, a couple are sideways, not perfectly lined up.  makes it interesting.  I think you did a good job with placement.  My only thing I would change is that I wouldn''t put the 2 with blue dresses together.  I''d seperate them maybe switch the second one from the left with the one on the right.  that way, the 2 blues are on the end.  good focus and clarity, nice background, like the shelf too.  very nice shot...oh..and definately 7 of the subject. ~Heather~', '2004-12-03 23:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045523, 125013, 24074, '<td valign="top">good photo but over done</td>', 'good photo but over done', '2004-12-03 23:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045525, 125136, 4585, '<td valign="top">Me thinks this is gonna place 1st.  Colors are exceptional and I think that it is well-balanced.  The only negative comment I can muster is that the reflections of the forks  make it more than 7...but heck, who''s countin''...;)  GL.  10 from me.</td>', 'Me thinks this is gonna place 1st.  Colors are exceptional and I think that it is well-balanced.  The only negative comment I can muster is that the reflections of the forks  make it more than 7...but heck, who''s countin''...;)  GL.  10 from me.', '2004-12-03 23:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045528, 124998, 3080, '<td valign="top">There are definately 7 of your subject, but I''m afraid I don''t find it interesting to me on a personal level.  The perspective is all weird, focus is soft, background is tilted, lighting is a bit too dark.  Just doesn''t seem well set up, more like a quick shot to me.  Would have been lots better had you just taken the time to straighten up the bottles, to where the labels were all facing the same way.  or the caps were straight with each other.  I think that would have made a big difference for me.  ~Heather~</td>', 'There are definately 7 of your subject, but I''m afraid I don''t find it interesting to me on a personal level.  The perspective is all weird, focus is soft, background is tilted, lighting is a bit too dark.  Just doesn''t seem well set up, more like a quick shot to me.  Would have been lots better had you just taken the time to straighten up the bottles, to where the labels were all facing the same way.  or the caps were straight with each other.  I think that would have made a big difference for me.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045531, 124321, 3080, '<td valign="top">omg...more seagulls.  I''m sorry you had to be like the 7th pic of seagulls in my line of pics.  They kind of lose their originality after awhile.  As for the pic...it is cute, fun and definately has 7 of the subject.  The birds seem a little too bright in places, and the thing in the water in the background is a bit distracing.  focus seems ok and I like how you framed the pic.  just too many darn seagulls. lol ~Heather~</td>', 'omg...more seagulls.  I''m sorry you had to be like the 7th pic of seagulls in my line of pics.  They kind of lose their originality after awhile.  As for the pic...it is cute, fun and definately has 7 of the subject.  The birds seem a little too bright in places, and the thing in the water in the background is a bit distracing.  focus seems ok and I like how you framed the pic.  just too many darn seagulls. lol ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045532, 124752, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your ''white'' background is blue.  Not sure if you planned it that way, but it kind of just looks liek your white ballance was off.  Definatley 7 nuts in the shot.  lighting is good, no distracting shadow or bright spots.  not the most visually appealing photo, I mean, there is nothing personally drawing me in.  But focus and clarity are good, and technically, it''s a good shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'Your ''white'' background is blue.  Not sure if you planned it that way, but it kind of just looks liek your white ballance was off.  Definatley 7 nuts in the shot.  lighting is good, no distracting shadow or bright spots.  not the most visually appealing photo, I mean, there is nothing personally drawing me in.  But focus and clarity are good, and technically, it''s a good shot. ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045535, 124357, 3080, '<td valign="top">Doh!  I see the start of the 8th one.  Seeing that one, lets me know that there weren''t really just 7 of these, that you cheated and cropped it just to make it look like there were 7 of them...but oh well...you got it anyway. lol.  I think the thing about this shot that bugs me a little is the lighting.  seems dark.  when I think of roses, I think of bright, glowing flowers.  play with the brightness/contrast and maybe up the saturation a bit.  I think that could make this really punch.  Fucs on the flower seems a slight bit soft.  I like the repetition.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Doh!  I see the start of the 8th one.  Seeing that one, lets me know that there weren''t really just 7 of these, that you cheated and cropped it just to make it look like there were 7 of them...but oh well...you got it anyway. lol.  I think the thing about this shot that bugs me a little is the lighting.  seems dark.  when I think of roses, I think of bright, glowing flowers.  play with the brightness/contrast and maybe up the saturation a bit.  I think that could make this really punch.  Fucs on the flower seems a slight bit soft.  I like the repetition.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045536, 125018, 4585, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft.  I think you''ll get dinged for it quite a bit.  But I love the concept and the DOF.  GL.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft.  I think you''ll get dinged for it quite a bit.  But I love the concept and the DOF.  GL.', '2004-12-04 00:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045537, 124889, 3080, '<td valign="top">Lighting on this shot is a little darker than what I think I would prefer.  I see that not only are there 7 dice, but all opposite sides of a dice add up to 7 as well.  hard to see that from just looking at the shot, but I know that, and I think that''s what you were going for here.  focus and clarity are good, ad I like the arrangement, but just would like to see this brighter with more punch. ~Heather~</td>', 'Lighting on this shot is a little darker than what I think I would prefer.  I see that not only are there 7 dice, but all opposite sides of a dice add up to 7 as well.  hard to see that from just looking at the shot, but I know that, and I think that''s what you were going for here.  focus and clarity are good, ad I like the arrangement, but just would like to see this brighter with more punch. ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045539, 124924, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately 7 of the subject, unfortunatley, I don''t find them too visually appealing.  Not to me anyway. It is just lacking something that draws my attention in.  Technically, I think it''s a good shot.  lighting is a little odd in places, and focus may be just a slight soft, but just doesn''t hold me on a personal level. ~heather~</td>', 'Definately 7 of the subject, unfortunatley, I don''t find them too visually appealing.  Not to me anyway. It is just lacking something that draws my attention in.  Technically, I think it''s a good shot.  lighting is a little odd in places, and focus may be just a slight soft, but just doesn''t hold me on a personal level. ~heather~', '2004-12-04 00:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
