(1045553, 125176, 3080, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I understand this pic, but there ARE 7 hand in the pic, so it does fit the challenge.  can''t say that it is visually appealing to me on a personal level, but maybe i''m just not familiar with this odd behavior. lol.  I lke how you got 7 people to do this, not 4 people with both their hands.  Makes me smile to think that you all got together to make this photo.  Looks like a fun cute photo. ~Heather~</td>', 'I don''t think I understand this pic, but there ARE 7 hand in the pic, so it does fit the challenge.  can''t say that it is visually appealing to me on a personal level, but maybe i''m just not familiar with this odd behavior. lol.  I lke how you got 7 people to do this, not 4 people with both their hands.  Makes me smile to think that you all got together to make this photo.  Looks like a fun cute photo. ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045555, 124432, 3080, '<td valign="top">egad...the background here is horrid.  Your subject blends right in with the mess in the background making it hard to look at.  I definatley see that there are 7 colored squares, and in the shape of the 7, but the background is just so busy and it kind of engulft the subject.  that''s my only problem with this shot, but it''s a pretty big problem in my eyes.  focus looks ok, set up looks ok.  everything seems ok, but that aweful background.</td>', 'egad...the background here is horrid.  Your subject blends right in with the mess in the background making it hard to look at.  I definatley see that there are 7 colored squares, and in the shape of the 7, but the background is just so busy and it kind of engulft the subject.  that''s my only problem with this shot, but it''s a pretty big problem in my eyes.  focus looks ok, set up looks ok.  everything seems ok, but that aweful background.', '2004-12-04 00:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045557, 125169, 3080, '<td valign="top">cute.  I like the little bulbs, and in light of (no pun intended) the upcomming holiday, I think this is a fun shot.  My only real complaint would be the shadows under the bulbs.  wonder if some side lighting could have taken care of those, or if you wanted it that way.  I would prefer it without the shadows, but that''s just me.  I like the placement of the bulbs within the photo, and the line up is good as well.  very cute. ~Heather~</td>', 'cute.  I like the little bulbs, and in light of (no pun intended) the upcomming holiday, I think this is a fun shot.  My only real complaint would be the shadows under the bulbs.  wonder if some side lighting could have taken care of those, or if you wanted it that way.  I would prefer it without the shadows, but that''s just me.  I like the placement of the bulbs within the photo, and the line up is good as well.  very cute. ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045568, 125197, 3080, '<td valign="top">A person really has to hunt for those other 2 ''bananas''  They are really actually just banana stems really.  I think i''d really like to SEE the 7 subjects.  focus and clarity are really good though, and I think the lighting is alright too.  The crop seems odd, maybe a little too close.  ~Heather~</td>', 'A person really has to hunt for those other 2 ''bananas''  They are really actually just banana stems really.  I think i''d really like to SEE the 7 subjects.  focus and clarity are really good though, and I think the lighting is alright too.  The crop seems odd, maybe a little too close.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045580, 123731, 3080, '<td valign="top">This photo is a little dark for me.  I think that if there were a bit more light, it would be a lot brighter and have more punch.  I almost missed the dark dice in the lower left.  also, I''m sure you heard this already, the plural of dice, IS dice.  I think the brightly colored chips takes away from the dice.  ~Heather~</td>', 'This photo is a little dark for me.  I think that if there were a bit more light, it would be a lot brighter and have more punch.  I almost missed the dark dice in the lower left.  also, I''m sure you heard this already, the plural of dice, IS dice.  I think the brightly colored chips takes away from the dice.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045581, 125112, 24970, '<td valign="top">Lighting''s a little bright, the mice got pretty washed out and the cat''s not as deep black as it could be. Amusing shot though, with decent composition.</td>', 'Lighting''s a little bright, the mice got pretty washed out and the cat''s not as deep black as it could be. Amusing shot though, with decent composition.', '2004-12-04 00:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045582, 125048, 3080, '<td valign="top">At first, I thought there were 7 panels on the wall...but really there are like 8 or 9, there''s 1 coat, so I''m not really sure how this fits the challenge?  maybe this was easier to see in person, but I think that the photo is just confusing me.  on the other hand, that doesn''t seem too hard to do sometimes, so I wouldn''t blame you for that. lol.  It''s a dark shot, not sure what I''m looking at, and not sure how it relates to the challenge. sorry. ~Heather~</td>', 'At first, I thought there were 7 panels on the wall...but really there are like 8 or 9, there''s 1 coat, so I''m not really sure how this fits the challenge?  maybe this was easier to see in person, but I think that the photo is just confusing me.  on the other hand, that doesn''t seem too hard to do sometimes, so I wouldn''t blame you for that. lol.  It''s a dark shot, not sure what I''m looking at, and not sure how it relates to the challenge. sorry. ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045584, 124805, 3080, '<td valign="top">The MAIN subject to me looks like the dice.  There are not 7 dice in the pic, which makes this a stretch on the challenge.  I DO see 7 red hotels though, so at least there are 7 of something in the pic.  As a photo, I think this is good.  Nice focus and DOF, good lighting, good angle and framing/cropping, I just think that it could have been different for this particular challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'The MAIN subject to me looks like the dice.  There are not 7 dice in the pic, which makes this a stretch on the challenge.  I DO see 7 red hotels though, so at least there are 7 of something in the pic.  As a photo, I think this is good.  Nice focus and DOF, good lighting, good angle and framing/cropping, I just think that it could have been different for this particular challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045586, 125061, 3080, '<td valign="top">I supose that people will either hate this or love it.  But setting all personal preferences on politics aside, I don''t much care for the actual photo.  there are 7 of the subject, I''ll give you that, but the background just makes this look cluttered.  The lighting is creating some bad shaddows around the buttons.  focus seems good, and I like that the 7 buttons make a physical 7, but it''s just not drawing me in.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I supose that people will either hate this or love it.  But setting all personal preferences on politics aside, I don''t much care for the actual photo.  there are 7 of the subject, I''ll give you that, but the background just makes this look cluttered.  The lighting is creating some bad shaddows around the buttons.  focus seems good, and I like that the 7 buttons make a physical 7, but it''s just not drawing me in.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045588, 124119, 24970, '<td valign="top">This is cool - feels like they''re leaning into the picture. I''d love it with a fully black background.</td>', 'This is cool - feels like they''re leaning into the picture. I''d love it with a fully black background.', '2004-12-04 00:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045589, 124505, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I''m not totally sure why, but I think I like the angle and where you placed your subjects within the photo.  focus and clarity are great, the lighting is what I think really makes this shot for me though.  Overall very nice.  I really have no complaints about this.  Had it been an editing challenge, I may have cloned out a couple little reflections, but they really don''t affect the photo at all.  Very nice shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like this.  I''m not totally sure why, but I think I like the angle and where you placed your subjects within the photo.  focus and clarity are great, the lighting is what I think really makes this shot for me though.  Overall very nice.  I really have no complaints about this.  Had it been an editing challenge, I may have cloned out a couple little reflections, but they really don''t affect the photo at all.  Very nice shot. ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045590, 123944, 3080, '<td valign="top">Is this a hacky sack?  I''m thinking that I don''t really care for this pic.  I guess you just can''t use this technique on everything. lol.  Might have been a tad better if they were in some kind of pattern, but they look like a screwed up circle.  focus seems ok, but hard to tell.  I don''t like the texture of the background, I find it very distracting. ~Heather~</td>', 'Is this a hacky sack?  I''m thinking that I don''t really care for this pic.  I guess you just can''t use this technique on everything. lol.  Might have been a tad better if they were in some kind of pattern, but they look like a screwed up circle.  focus seems ok, but hard to tell.  I don''t like the texture of the background, I find it very distracting. ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 00:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045591, 125214, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting.  I think that''s what makes this shot good for me.  The 7th ball almost gets lost back there, but still visible.  the focus and DOF are really good, shadows add interest to the shot as well.  My only little problem is that the balls all seem solid in color except the 3rd one from the front.    that''s a bit of a distraction as it really stands out in the crowd.  a nice simple shot though.  I like it. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like the lighting.  I think that''s what makes this shot good for me.  The 7th ball almost gets lost back there, but still visible.  the focus and DOF are really good, shadows add interest to the shot as well.  My only little problem is that the balls all seem solid in color except the 3rd one from the front.    that''s a bit of a distraction as it really stands out in the crowd.  a nice simple shot though.  I like it. ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 01:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045593, 125214, 24970, '<td valign="top">I like the line of the balls and the effect the shadows create. The lighting/glare hurts the sharpness of this, and the coloring seems a little bland and washed out. Cool concept though.</td>', 'I like the line of the balls and the effect the shadows create. The lighting/glare hurts the sharpness of this, and the coloring seems a little bland and washed out. Cool concept though.', '2004-12-04 01:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045594, 124939, 3080, '<td valign="top">This should be up there in a top percentage.  nice focus, beautiful lighting, I like the reflections.  DOF is good.  I really love the color.  background is great, nothing to complain about there.  no distractions.  really nothing to complain about at all.  love the set up, nice placement of the subjects.  guess I should count them...lol  yup 7.  I see no reason not to give this a 10.  great shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'This should be up there in a top percentage.  nice focus, beautiful lighting, I like the reflections.  DOF is good.  I really love the color.  background is great, nothing to complain about there.  no distractions.  really nothing to complain about at all.  love the set up, nice placement of the subjects.  guess I should count them...lol  yup 7.  I see no reason not to give this a 10.  great shot. ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 01:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045597, 124639, 24128, '<td valign="top">this is a really nice pic but the white border makes the crop feel too close, it adds a clinical harshness to an otherwise warm and inviting image.</td>', 'this is a really nice pic but the white border makes the crop feel too close, it adds a clinical harshness to an otherwise warm and inviting image.', '2004-12-04 01:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045599, 124950, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have looked and looked and I can''t find 7 of anything.  actually, all I can really see is 5 sections of what looks like lights in windows?  not really being able to tell exactly what I''m looking at, I guess I''m not getting it.  it''s an interesting shot, just not sure what it is, nor how it fits into the challenge. sorry ~Heather~</td>', 'I have looked and looked and I can''t find 7 of anything.  actually, all I can really see is 5 sections of what looks like lights in windows?  not really being able to tell exactly what I''m looking at, I guess I''m not getting it.  it''s an interesting shot, just not sure what it is, nor how it fits into the challenge. sorry ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 01:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045604, 125035, 3080, '<td valign="top">definately 7 of the subject yes, but I fail to see how they really all fit together.  it''s an interesting technique, but I don''t think it works in all situations.  theree doesn''t seem to be a ''point'' to this photo.  focus and clarity are good, and the spacing is good, and nice symetry, but I''m just not drawn into the shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'definately 7 of the subject yes, but I fail to see how they really all fit together.  it''s an interesting technique, but I don''t think it works in all situations.  theree doesn''t seem to be a ''point'' to this photo.  focus and clarity are good, and the spacing is good, and nice symetry, but I''m just not drawn into the shot. ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 01:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045606, 124037, 24970, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. I like the silhouettes, and the line of the stars is engaging. A slightly different composition would work better for me, maybe the stars farther left in the frame. And more ground with a bit less on top so it can play the rule of thirds game. Gorgeous shot though.</td>', 'This is really cool. I like the silhouettes, and the line of the stars is engaging. A slightly different composition would work better for me, maybe the stars farther left in the frame. And more ground with a bit less on top so it can play the rule of thirds game. Gorgeous shot though.', '2004-12-04 01:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045608, 125075, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think would have more impact for the challenge if we were able to actually see all 7 colors.  in a rainbow, you never really see all 7 colors.  it is definately implied that they are all there, but we don''t really see them too well.  oh well..I know they''re there. lol.  this is a really peaceful shot.  like how the rainbow is to the left of the photo, and I like the clouds, and the blue sky is really pretty too. ~Heather~</td>', 'I think would have more impact for the challenge if we were able to actually see all 7 colors.  in a rainbow, you never really see all 7 colors.  it is definately implied that they are all there, but we don''t really see them too well.  oh well..I know they''re there. lol.  this is a really peaceful shot.  like how the rainbow is to the left of the photo, and I like the clouds, and the blue sky is really pretty too. ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 01:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
