(1045622, 125159, 24970, '<td valign="top">Interesting. With the expression on the boy''s face, I''d assume the guy in the window shouldn''t be there? Or maybe I''m just making up my own story. Is there an angle where you could have gotten eyes in the first head too? This way seems a little strange.</td>', 'Interesting. With the expression on the boy''s face, I''d assume the guy in the window shouldn''t be there? Or maybe I''m just making up my own story. Is there an angle where you could have gotten eyes in the first head too? This way seems a little strange.', '2004-12-04 01:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
