(1045624, 125189, 29651, '<td valign="top">wow, how did you do the fussy trees? I thought about if you had that horse on the left to come in closer with the rest. But, I also thought this is a great way to get a panoramic photo. I love it!</td>', 'wow, how did you do the fussy trees? I thought about if you had that horse on the left to come in closer with the rest. But, I also thought this is a great way to get a panoramic photo. I love it!', '2004-12-04 01:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045625, 124289, 24970, '<td valign="top">That they are! Lighting''s a little bright, they seem to be glowing. Unless that''s the effect you wanted. Composition works, though there must be more interesting arrangements out there somewhere. Maybe a curve of some sort?</td>', 'That they are! Lighting''s a little bright, they seem to be glowing. Unless that''s the effect you wanted. Composition works, though there must be more interesting arrangements out there somewhere. Maybe a curve of some sort?', '2004-12-04 01:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
