(1045630, 124678, 3080, '<td valign="top">You say VIBGYOR The colors of the rainbow, then don''t actually put the colors in the photo.  you have 2 oranges, and 2 blues, but no indigo or violet, and the green isn''t really green.  Setting that aside, lol, you do have 7 of the subject in your photo.  however, focus is soft and lighting is aweful.  See how bright some of the areas are on the crayons?  makes it really hard to look at.  ~Heather~</td>', 'You say VIBGYOR The colors of the rainbow, then don''t actually put the colors in the photo.  you have 2 oranges, and 2 blues, but no indigo or violet, and the green isn''t really green.  Setting that aside, lol, you do have 7 of the subject in your photo.  however, focus is soft and lighting is aweful.  See how bright some of the areas are on the crayons?  makes it really hard to look at.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 01:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045633, 125151, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice attention to detail, with all the "7" dice visible. I like this picture - it''s sharp, well-lit, and just pleasant to look at. Good job.</td>', 'Nice attention to detail, with all the "7" dice visible. I like this picture - it''s sharp, well-lit, and just pleasant to look at. Good job.', '2004-12-04 01:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045634, 125208, 24970, '<td valign="top">Good composition. The light''s a little bright, though I''m guessing it''s from a window so you don''t have too much control. Maybe a translucent curtain to eliminate a bit of the glow? This also looks kinda cool in two-tone, gives it a rustic type feel.</td>', 'Good composition. The light''s a little bright, though I''m guessing it''s from a window so you don''t have too much control. Maybe a translucent curtain to eliminate a bit of the glow? This also looks kinda cool in two-tone, gives it a rustic type feel.', '2004-12-04 01:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045636, 125189, 24970, '<td valign="top">This picture glows a bit too much, it''s kinda eerie. Other than that, I really like it, is well laid out and has a nice peaceful, pleasant feel.</td>', 'This picture glows a bit too much, it''s kinda eerie. Other than that, I really like it, is well laid out and has a nice peaceful, pleasant feel.', '2004-12-04 01:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045639, 124764, 24970, '<td valign="top">Ooo! This is a fun shot. It''s well-composed, colorful, and I enjoy looking at it. I feel I really want to see the corners of the two big frames, though maybe there''s reasons for having it this way. If you do want to cut them off, maybe a bit farther in so they''re not just nicked?</td>', 'Ooo! This is a fun shot. It''s well-composed, colorful, and I enjoy looking at it. I feel I really want to see the corners of the two big frames, though maybe there''s reasons for having it this way. If you do want to cut them off, maybe a bit farther in so they''re not just nicked?', '2004-12-04 01:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045640, 125187, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines, even if they don''t really point us at anything. But as the subject Is the barbs in this case, I guess that''s ok. The flash (or natural light, can''t really tell) washed out the log on the right pretty badly, that''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice leading lines, even if they don''t really point us at anything. But as the subject Is the barbs in this case, I guess that''s ok. The flash (or natural light, can''t really tell) washed out the log on the right pretty badly, that''s a bit distracting.', '2004-12-04 01:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045652, 125093, 3080, '<td valign="top">The soft focus hurts my eyes.  I think this would work better had the focus been better.  lighting is ok.  I wonder if there were some other angle you could have taken this at to add some visual appeal?  The words definately look set up, I''m thinking that I"d like this to look like a real game.  I also am not sure I like the background. looks like pieces of paper put together to make a white background?  kind of looks tacky.  ~Heather~</td>', 'The soft focus hurts my eyes.  I think this would work better had the focus been better.  lighting is ok.  I wonder if there were some other angle you could have taken this at to add some visual appeal?  The words definately look set up, I''m thinking that I"d like this to look like a real game.  I also am not sure I like the background. looks like pieces of paper put together to make a white background?  kind of looks tacky.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-04 01:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045680, 125159, 22011, '<td valign="top">ROFL!  I''m sure someone else will have said it already....  Great concept, but you''re just missing one thing. 6</td>', 'ROFL!  I''m sure someone else will have said it already....  Great concept, but you''re just missing one thing. 6', '2004-12-04 02:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045682, 125066, 22011, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, and great use of the reflected light....  7</td>', 'Neat idea, and great use of the reflected light....  7', '2004-12-04 03:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045699, 124125, 24486, '<td valign="top">The trees make a lovely contrast to the composition of this photograph as does the frame</td>', 'The trees make a lovely contrast to the composition of this photograph as does the frame', '2004-12-04 03:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045738, 125031, 27845, '<td valign="top">Not funny. [Edit:] I realized my comment was no help to you. I''m going to elaborate a bit, I don''t want to be one of those who ain''t got anything constructive to say ;)<br/>The reflections in the orange head are distracting. The painted seven doesn''t look good, it gives the impression of you not being very interested in this challenge, which I''m sure isn''t true. The depth of field is good, but there''s still too much going on in the background. And this doesn''t fit the challenge very well. Just painting a 7 in there is the only link to the challenge I can see (though I might be missing sth).</td>', 'Not funny. [Edit:] I realized my comment was no help to you. I''m going to elaborate a bit, I don''t want to be one of those who ain''t got anything constructive to say ;)The reflections in the orange head are distracting. The painted seven doesn''t look good, it gives the impression of you not being very interested in this challenge, which I''m sure isn''t true. The depth of field is good, but there''s still too much going on in the background. And this doesn''t fit the challenge very well. Just painting a 7 in there is the only link to the challenge I can see (though I might be missing sth).', '2004-12-04 04:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1045741, 125136, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice title. I have to admit it perfectly describes the picture. The nice, bright colours, clear reflections and counter-reflections make this shot sth special. The crop is great, it emphasizes the impact of the circular movement and the movement to the center indicated by the forks. 10.</td>', 'Nice title. I have to admit it perfectly describes the picture. The nice, bright colours, clear reflections and counter-reflections make this shot sth special. The crop is great, it emphasizes the impact of the circular movement and the movement to the center indicated by the forks. 10.', '2004-12-04 04:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
