(1046081, 125202, 3032, '<td valign="top">Seems like they lay on a hill? The invisable downward diagonal and the stones (cast iron/bronze?) getting smaller higher up creates a good sense of depth here. It is also nice that these are bright and that the next ones in the background are dark / in the shadow. The darker upper right is also in a nice parralel to the brighter lower 2/3 section.<br/>For my taste the B&amp;W toning is a bit too flat middle gray, on the otherhand that may just be fine with a graveyard. I''d also rather see this scene without the white thingies (to put a flower in?) next to them. Pull ''em out!<br/> <br/>Nice work Sher, hope you win. :)</td>', 'Seems like they lay on a hill? The invisable downward diagonal and the stones (cast iron/bronze?) getting smaller higher up creates a good sense of depth here. It is also nice that these are bright and that the next ones in the background are dark / in the shadow. The darker upper right is also in a nice parralel to the brighter lower 2/3 section.For my taste the B&W toning is a bit too flat middle gray, on the otherhand that may just be fine with a graveyard. I''d also rather see this scene without the white thingies (to put a flower in?) next to them. Pull ''em out! Nice work Sher, hope you win. :)', '2004-12-04 14:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046107, 124568, 22479, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Is this for real? Rabbits, ducks, and a bird in flight? I don''t think so...but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, for now.<br/> <br/>Edit: Fantastic! This is easily my top pick for this challenge. Congratulations on a stunning shot. 10</td>', 'Stunning. Is this for real? Rabbits, ducks, and a bird in flight? I don''t think so...but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, for now. Edit: Fantastic! This is easily my top pick for this challenge. Congratulations on a stunning shot. 10', '2004-12-04 15:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046110, 125061, 22479, '<td valign="top">Ah a political statement. Bold move as you know you''re gonna get voted down for this one. Not only is this guy liked only by half of America, but he''s generally disliked across the world.<br/> <br/>I''ll take an objective stance on this one, although I voted for Kerry.<br/> <br/>You exposed this shot "W"onderfully. The composition is excellent overall and I think it "W"orks very "W"ell. The crop is perfect and the color saturation and hue is spot on. The backdrop adds a pleasing foundation for the placement of the buttons. Artistically, I cannot find any fault. The focus, DOF, and sharpness are "W"onderful as "W"ell. Printed material is especially difficult to capture "W"ell, and I think technically you did a s"W"ell job. 10</td>', 'Ah a political statement. Bold move as you know you''re gonna get voted down for this one. Not only is this guy liked only by half of America, but he''s generally disliked across the world. I''ll take an objective stance on this one, although I voted for Kerry. You exposed this shot "W"onderfully. The composition is excellent overall and I think it "W"orks very "W"ell. The crop is perfect and the color saturation and hue is spot on. The backdrop adds a pleasing foundation for the placement of the buttons. Artistically, I cannot find any fault. The focus, DOF, and sharpness are "W"onderful as "W"ell. Printed material is especially difficult to capture "W"ell, and I think technically you did a s"W"ell job. 10', '2004-12-04 15:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046112, 125018, 22479, '<td valign="top">Ha! Great use of shadows. You can almost see the beads of sweat forming on those poor pawns. Wonderful composition. Bumping up to 9.</td>', 'Ha! Great use of shadows. You can almost see the beads of sweat forming on those poor pawns. Wonderful composition. Bumping up to 9.', '2004-12-04 15:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046113, 124137, 22479, '<td valign="top">This is stunning. Love the background contrasting with the flowers. Bumping up. 8</td>', 'This is stunning. Love the background contrasting with the flowers. Bumping up. 8', '2004-12-04 15:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046114, 125204, 22479, '<td valign="top">Try as I may, I can''t get my left hand to contort into this position. Props to you for a wonderful shot. Bumping up, 8.</td>', 'Try as I may, I can''t get my left hand to contort into this position. Props to you for a wonderful shot. Bumping up, 8.', '2004-12-04 15:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046115, 125042, 22479, '<td valign="top">Simply amazing. These birds are a lucky bunch, in more ways than one. Bumping to 8.</td>', 'Simply amazing. These birds are a lucky bunch, in more ways than one. Bumping to 8.', '2004-12-04 15:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046125, 125062, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very cute. I really like this. If possible try maximizing the depth of field. Perhaps your camera doesn''t let you change the aperture of the lens opening, or perhaps you did this intentionally. I think it detracts from the overall picture. I would rate this very highly otherwise. <br/> <br/>Edit: I actually like the DOF just fine like this. It works well artistically. The smooth gradation in the background colors compliment the subject, and overall a wonderful composition! Bumping up to 9.</td>', 'Very cute. I really like this. If possible try maximizing the depth of field. Perhaps your camera doesn''t let you change the aperture of the lens opening, or perhaps you did this intentionally. I think it detracts from the overall picture. I would rate this very highly otherwise.  Edit: I actually like the DOF just fine like this. It works well artistically. The smooth gradation in the background colors compliment the subject, and overall a wonderful composition! Bumping up to 9.', '2004-12-04 15:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046127, 124896, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice, you chose a good backdrop for these dice. Wonderful composition. Excellent lighting. <br/> <br/>Edit: This is easily one of my favorites of the bunch. Bumping up to 8.</td>', 'Nice, you chose a good backdrop for these dice. Wonderful composition. Excellent lighting.  Edit: This is easily one of my favorites of the bunch. Bumping up to 8.', '2004-12-04 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046144, 125038, 24486, '<td valign="top">Always a cool effect. Not a bad macro either</td>', 'Always a cool effect. Not a bad macro either', '2004-12-04 15:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046146, 124764, 22479, '<td valign="top">Revisiting this photograph.<br/> <br/>I think this is quite remarkable. The background seals the deal so to speak for me. The frames are shot from an oblique angle yet the background gives the illusion of being shot square. This is a masterful composition. I think you could have brightened the colors to give it more pop as they are somewhat subdued as it stands. Overall excellent. 8</td>', 'Revisiting this photograph. I think this is quite remarkable. The background seals the deal so to speak for me. The frames are shot from an oblique angle yet the background gives the illusion of being shot square. This is a masterful composition. I think you could have brightened the colors to give it more pop as they are somewhat subdued as it stands. Overall excellent. 8', '2004-12-04 15:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046151, 123932, 22479, '<td valign="top">Seven lucky ladies. I like the overall composition and I like the way you framed it. The shadows are a bit harsh but the exposure on the bugs are on the money. Bumping up.</td>', 'Seven lucky ladies. I like the overall composition and I like the way you framed it. The shadows are a bit harsh but the exposure on the bugs are on the money. Bumping up.', '2004-12-04 15:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046152, 124615, 24486, '<td valign="top">Clever concept.Good lighting.</td>', 'Clever concept.Good lighting.', '2004-12-04 15:59:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1046155, 125177, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean. The flipped glass gives the impression that the shot is skewed but it seems dead level. Overall a good composition and framed excellently.</td>', 'Nice and clean. The flipped glass gives the impression that the shot is skewed but it seems dead level. Overall a good composition and framed excellently.', '2004-12-04 16:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046157, 125106, 22479, '<td valign="top">Works well. Must have been a pain to do this one just right. Bumping to 7.</td>', 'Works well. Must have been a pain to do this one just right. Bumping to 7.', '2004-12-04 16:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046159, 124314, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good contrast between the marbles &amp; the background</td>', 'Good contrast between the marbles & the background', '2004-12-04 16:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046160, 125142, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very tasteful and artistic presentation. Nice and subtle shades of teal in the backdrop. Bumping to 7.</td>', 'Very tasteful and artistic presentation. Nice and subtle shades of teal in the backdrop. Bumping to 7.', '2004-12-04 16:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046174, 125209, 22479, '<td valign="top">I am assuming you had resized this photograph. I would suggest about a 1.5 to 2 degree clockwise rotation and a slightly tighter crop to give this more visual impact. The main subjects are bunched too tightly in the upper left corner. Other than that, I think this is a very interesting composition and cleverly executed.</td>', 'I am assuming you had resized this photograph. I would suggest about a 1.5 to 2 degree clockwise rotation and a slightly tighter crop to give this more visual impact. The main subjects are bunched too tightly in the upper left corner. Other than that, I think this is a very interesting composition and cleverly executed.', '2004-12-04 16:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046181, 125035, 22479, '<td valign="top">Remarkable multiple exposures. I''m impressed by the way you were able to hit your poses with generally excellent exposure and uniform facial expressions. Well done! 7</td>', 'Remarkable multiple exposures. I''m impressed by the way you were able to hit your poses with generally excellent exposure and uniform facial expressions. Well done! 7', '2004-12-04 16:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046190, 125177, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and lighting.</td>', 'Very good composition and lighting.', '2004-12-04 16:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046193, 124252, 24642, '<td valign="top">A bigger aperture would create less depth that would help seperating the birds from the buildings.</td>', 'A bigger aperture would create less depth that would help seperating the birds from the buildings.', '2004-12-04 16:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046195, 124635, 24642, '<td valign="top">The composition is a bit to flat for my taste.</td>', 'The composition is a bit to flat for my taste.', '2004-12-04 16:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046196, 125080, 22479, '<td valign="top">cute.<br/> <br/>Edit: More comments...This is quite imaginative. I like the depth of focus you selected for this shot. Clear, detailed, and exposed nicely. The composition works well. I would imagine, not having actually tried this myself, that to get the clover leaflets arranged with some semblance of realism is a challenge in of itself. Bonus points for creativity and solid execution. Bumping up to 7.</td>', 'cute. Edit: More comments...This is quite imaginative. I like the depth of focus you selected for this shot. Clear, detailed, and exposed nicely. The composition works well. I would imagine, not having actually tried this myself, that to get the clover leaflets arranged with some semblance of realism is a challenge in of itself. Bonus points for creativity and solid execution. Bumping up to 7.', '2004-12-04 16:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046197, 124127, 24642, '<td valign="top">Creative and colourful shot with nice balance in composition and colour.</td>', 'Creative and colourful shot with nice balance in composition and colour.', '2004-12-04 16:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046203, 124251, 24642, '<td valign="top">A shot that fits nicely in the square format.  The silhouettes work well with the horizontal clouds.  I like the balance in this peaceful shot.</td>', 'A shot that fits nicely in the square format.  The silhouettes work well with the horizontal clouds.  I like the balance in this peaceful shot.', '2004-12-04 16:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046204, 124295, 22479, '<td valign="top">cute. <br/> <br/>Returning for further comments.....<br/>Very clever and funny! I think you have a remarkably creative mind. Bonus points for creativity.<br/> <br/>Concerning the technical merits of this shot. The subjects look somewhat grainy and soft on focus. There is almost a deliberate high key look due to the overexposure. I think artistically it fits given this particular composition.<br/> <br/>Bumping up.<br/></td>', 'cute.  Returning for further comments.....Very clever and funny! I think you have a remarkably creative mind. Bonus points for creativity. Concerning the technical merits of this shot. The subjects look somewhat grainy and soft on focus. There is almost a deliberate high key look due to the overexposure. I think artistically it fits given this particular composition. Bumping up.', '2004-12-04 16:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046207, 125112, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good idea with a clever title.  The composition is good.  Better lighting would really make this shot better. -5</td>', 'Good idea with a clever title.  The composition is good.  Better lighting would really make this shot better. -5', '2004-12-04 16:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046209, 125112, 22479, '<td valign="top">Creative idea. Your photograph has adequate sharpness, although it probably could have been sharpened a "whisker" more. There is quite a bit of noise on the cat''s fur which may have  been a technical limitation of your digital camera so I won''t hold that against ya. Overall the cat does not appear interested in her visitors in the slightest, but they are quite finicky and don''t follow directions very well haha. Overall a good effort.</td>', 'Creative idea. Your photograph has adequate sharpness, although it probably could have been sharpened a "whisker" more. There is quite a bit of noise on the cat''s fur which may have  been a technical limitation of your digital camera so I won''t hold that against ya. Overall the cat does not appear interested in her visitors in the slightest, but they are quite finicky and don''t follow directions very well haha. Overall a good effort.', '2004-12-04 16:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046210, 124934, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but there is something wrong with the exposure or post processing that makes the overall dull cast on this shot. -5</td>', 'I like the composition but there is something wrong with the exposure or post processing that makes the overall dull cast on this shot. -5', '2004-12-04 16:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046214, 124778, 22479, '<td valign="top">Sharp, focused, well exposed. Excellent color saturation Artistically a well framed shot. I prefer the black backdrop against which you shot your subject. Fits the challenge theme nicely.</td>', 'Sharp, focused, well exposed. Excellent color saturation Artistically a well framed shot. I prefer the black backdrop against which you shot your subject. Fits the challenge theme nicely.', '2004-12-04 16:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046216, 125170, 24642, '<td valign="top">The best coin shot I have seen so far.  The colors are nice and the composition is decent.  I would have tried a slightly higher viewpoint.  -6</td>', 'The best coin shot I have seen so far.  The colors are nice and the composition is decent.  I would have tried a slightly higher viewpoint.  -6', '2004-12-04 16:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046221, 124281, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and the lighting but I find the composition could be improved.</td>', 'I like the colours and the lighting but I find the composition could be improved.', '2004-12-04 16:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046227, 125194, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  The composition is decent but the lighting might be improved by not having the light source inside the frame.</td>', 'I like the idea.  The composition is decent but the lighting might be improved by not having the light source inside the frame.', '2004-12-04 16:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046228, 124061, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I like the tiltet viewpoint.</td>', 'Good composition.  I like the tiltet viewpoint.', '2004-12-04 16:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046231, 125203, 22479, '<td valign="top">Good composition and framing. The butterflies appear somewhat soft on focus, Overall a creative entry.</td>', 'Good composition and framing. The butterflies appear somewhat soft on focus, Overall a creative entry.', '2004-12-04 16:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046233, 125144, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I like the colours and the title.</td>', 'Good composition.  I like the colours and the title.', '2004-12-04 16:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046235, 124568, 3765, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Great exposure. Balanced composition. Fairy tale setting. I have counted four animals so far (three to go to get to seven). How did you do this or were you just very, very lucky being at the right place the right time? Great shot. 10 from me.</td>', 'Wonderful image. Great exposure. Balanced composition. Fairy tale setting. I have counted four animals so far (three to go to get to seven). How did you do this or were you just very, very lucky being at the right place the right time? Great shot. 10 from me.', '2004-12-04 16:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046236, 125043, 16148, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Nice texture and I like the background you have chosen.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well done!  Nice texture and I like the background you have chosen.  Good luck.', '2004-12-04 16:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046239, 124155, 22479, '<td valign="top">Needs a deeper DOF. Loss of focus on your seven berries.</td>', 'Needs a deeper DOF. Loss of focus on your seven berries.', '2004-12-04 16:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046240, 124881, 3765, '<td valign="top">Exposure is just right. Good use of the tele. Well done. 9</td>', 'Exposure is just right. Good use of the tele. Well done. 9', '2004-12-04 16:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046246, 124465, 16148, '<td valign="top">High quality shot and nice interpretation of the challenge.  I expect you will be in the top three.  Congratulations!</td>', 'High quality shot and nice interpretation of the challenge.  I expect you will be in the top three.  Congratulations!', '2004-12-04 16:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046247, 125029, 3765, '<td valign="top">A very interesting idea. Technically you''ve done fine. The compostion to me is out of balace somewhat. Experiment more with the bottles but without the coins. It''s a bit distracting though money usually isn''t. Still, 8.</td>', 'A very interesting idea. Technically you''ve done fine. The compostion to me is out of balace somewhat. Experiment more with the bottles but without the coins. It''s a bit distracting though money usually isn''t. Still, 8.', '2004-12-04 16:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046249, 125184, 3765, '<td valign="top">Good angle. Well lit. 8</td>', 'Good angle. Well lit. 8', '2004-12-04 16:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046261, 124928, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and composition.  I hope to see you in the top three.  I know we can only use basic editing for this challenge but I''d be curious to see this with selective desaturation.  I would leave the pencils yellow and everything else black and white.  Just a thought.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice perspective and composition.  I hope to see you in the top three.  I know we can only use basic editing for this challenge but I''d be curious to see this with selective desaturation.  I would leave the pencils yellow and everything else black and white.  Just a thought.  Good luck!', '2004-12-04 17:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046263, 123933, 23251, '<td valign="top">Great shot, IMHO it just needs something extra that the drop of water does not add.  Maybe 1 of a different colour or type or even dropping down instead of pointing up.  Very nice.</td>', 'Great shot, IMHO it just needs something extra that the drop of water does not add.  Maybe 1 of a different colour or type or even dropping down instead of pointing up.  Very nice.', '2004-12-04 17:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046275, 124499, 27845, '<td valign="top">NIce vortex effect. The fabric backgound doesn''t go well with the chrome bullets, but the reflections are great.</td>', 'NIce vortex effect. The fabric backgound doesn''t go well with the chrome bullets, but the reflections are great.', '2004-12-04 17:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046277, 123839, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot a lot.  The narrow tone range really highlights the droplets well.  Very interesting subject.  My only tiny suggestion is that maybe a deeper depth of field would have kept the bottom few droplets in sharper focus.</td>', 'I really like this shot a lot.  The narrow tone range really highlights the droplets well.  Very interesting subject.  My only tiny suggestion is that maybe a deeper depth of field would have kept the bottom few droplets in sharper focus.', '2004-12-04 17:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046282, 124764, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like how you build up symmetry and break it down at the same time. The two lower frames look as if their sides were mirrored by the green-orange frontier, but in fact they are so by one single point. The large double frames lie at the same angle on their respectives sides, but they vary in heighth.<br/>The one frame I don''t like is the upper one. It'' not perfectly symmetical, yet not rotated or shifted enough to suggest the opposite.<br/>The reflections are fine, but I''d have liked to see them on every frame, not just on the two big ones. You found a good intensity of the d´shadows. They''re not too hard, just strong enough to suggest that the frames stand out from the paper.<br/>Well done, good use of various techniques and nice composition, yet I have to admit it doesn''t really appeal to me. Perhaps it''s just too constructed. Yeah, yeah, there''s no way to satisfy me ;). I hope the comments are useful to you. 7.</td>', 'I like how you build up symmetry and break it down at the same time. The two lower frames look as if their sides were mirrored by the green-orange frontier, but in fact they are so by one single point. The large double frames lie at the same angle on their respectives sides, but they vary in heighth.The one frame I don''t like is the upper one. It'' not perfectly symmetical, yet not rotated or shifted enough to suggest the opposite.The reflections are fine, but I''d have liked to see them on every frame, not just on the two big ones. You found a good intensity of the d´shadows. They''re not too hard, just strong enough to suggest that the frames stand out from the paper.Well done, good use of various techniques and nice composition, yet I have to admit it doesn''t really appeal to me. Perhaps it''s just too constructed. Yeah, yeah, there''s no way to satisfy me ;). I hope the comments are useful to you. 7.', '2004-12-04 17:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046284, 124518, 27845, '<td valign="top">A great picture, I really like it. But I think the link to the challenge is weak, that''s why I''m taking one point away -&gt; 9.</td>', 'A great picture, I really like it. But I think the link to the challenge is weak, that''s why I''m taking one point away -> 9.', '2004-12-04 17:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046290, 125106, 27845, '<td valign="top">Interesting technique. I''d like to know how you did this.</td>', 'Interesting technique. I''d like to know how you did this.', '2004-12-04 17:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046292, 125168, 27845, '<td valign="top">Very witty...</td>', 'Very witty...', '2004-12-04 17:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046306, 125147, 9292, '<td valign="top">too overprocessed</td>', 'too overprocessed', '2004-12-04 18:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046314, 125204, 9292, '<td valign="top">very original</td>', 'very original', '2004-12-04 18:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046317, 125204, 25095, '<td valign="top">I fought like crazy trying to get a shot like this but with my hand just out open.  Great job.  Can''t wait to read your technique.</td>', 'I fought like crazy trying to get a shot like this but with my hand just out open.  Great job.  Can''t wait to read your technique.', '2004-12-04 18:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046319, 124894, 9292, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2004-12-04 18:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046322, 125052, 25095, '<td valign="top">love the colors and layout...good job</td>', 'love the colors and layout...good job', '2004-12-04 18:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046341, 124321, 29013, '<td valign="top">a little too centered. the bottom board is distracting to me.</td>', 'a little too centered. the bottom board is distracting to me.', '2004-12-04 19:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
