(1046373, 125048, 25355, '<td valign="top">What''s the main subject? A strange shape (only one - hooded person?) or vertical lines?</td>', 'What''s the main subject? A strange shape (only one - hooded person?) or vertical lines?', '2004-12-04 19:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
