(1046670, 124438, 29168, '<td valign="top">It''s very important, imo, to get the horizon line <i>level</i> in photos involving water like this because being otherwise creates an instant "something''s wrong" distraction, well for me anyhow. Lovely shot otherwise.</td>', 'It''s very important, imo, to get the horizon line level in photos involving water like this because being otherwise creates an instant "something''s wrong" distraction, well for me anyhow. Lovely shot otherwise.', '2004-12-05 01:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046672, 125113, 26151, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, I''m guessing it''s the boats that are your subject. I''m counting 9. maybe if you were only counting the boats in the foreground, I''d give you the benefit of the doubt. But there are only 6 in the foreground.</td>', 'I don''t know, I''m guessing it''s the boats that are your subject. I''m counting 9. maybe if you were only counting the boats in the foreground, I''d give you the benefit of the doubt. But there are only 6 in the foreground.', '2004-12-05 01:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
