(1046674, 124721, 25921, '<td valign="top">I didn''t really like this photo until I scrolled down in my browser and saw the biker.  Now I like it quite a bit.  The perspective is excellent.  Nicely done.  Is it really seven blocks to the top?</td>', 'I didn''t really like this photo until I scrolled down in my browser and saw the biker.  Now I like it quite a bit.  The perspective is excellent.  Nicely done.  Is it really seven blocks to the top?', '2004-12-05 01:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
