(1046693, 124034, 24970, '<td valign="top">I could see this being really cool with the lights right on the left side of the frame instead of leaving room for the cords to show. Nice clear picture, the lighting worked well.</td>', 'I could see this being really cool with the lights right on the left side of the frame instead of leaving room for the cords to show. Nice clear picture, the lighting worked well.', '2004-12-05 02:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046697, 125194, 24970, '<td valign="top">The direct glow from the light creates some problems with glare here, a less direct light might have been better, as long as you still got the silhouettes you seem to be going for. Creative shot, and well set up.</td>', 'The direct glow from the light creates some problems with glare here, a less direct light might have been better, as long as you still got the silhouettes you seem to be going for. Creative shot, and well set up.', '2004-12-05 02:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046699, 124724, 24970, '<td valign="top">By the title, it seems the yellow guy in front should be in focus rather than the circle of popular bears. Fun concept though, and well composed.</td>', 'By the title, it seems the yellow guy in front should be in focus rather than the circle of popular bears. Fun concept though, and well composed.', '2004-12-05 02:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046701, 124137, 24970, '<td valign="top">This is a really pretty shot. I''m not entirely sold on the composition, the line is cool but it doesn''t feel to me like it''s placed quite right in the frame. Maybe there''s a bit too much space on the bottom? And the stem poking out is a bit distracting. Nicely focused all the way down the flowers though, and this is a picture I enjoy looking at.</td>', 'This is a really pretty shot. I''m not entirely sold on the composition, the line is cool but it doesn''t feel to me like it''s placed quite right in the frame. Maybe there''s a bit too much space on the bottom? And the stem poking out is a bit distracting. Nicely focused all the way down the flowers though, and this is a picture I enjoy looking at.', '2004-12-05 02:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046703, 124127, 24970, '<td valign="top">I think if the horseshoes weren''t so centered vertically it would be a more interesting composition. Sorry, but beyond the cool arrangement you have them in, this picture doesn''t really hold my interest much.</td>', 'I think if the horseshoes weren''t so centered vertically it would be a more interesting composition. Sorry, but beyond the cool arrangement you have them in, this picture doesn''t really hold my interest much.', '2004-12-05 02:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046705, 125158, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice title, interesting composition, and good focus. And it makes me happy you chose a different pattern for the arrangement of your dots rather than the cliche combinations of 7.</td>', 'Nice title, interesting composition, and good focus. And it makes me happy you chose a different pattern for the arrangement of your dots rather than the cliche combinations of 7.', '2004-12-05 02:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046710, 125153, 24970, '<td valign="top">A compositing other than dead-center would be more interesting, and you might want to experiment with different lighting, this is pretty harsh and made a distracting shadow.</td>', 'A compositing other than dead-center would be more interesting, and you might want to experiment with different lighting, this is pretty harsh and made a distracting shadow.', '2004-12-05 02:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046720, 124518, 28764, '<td valign="top">This is a good one, I know that it has 7 steps but I can''t see the 7 subjects for it to step on. But I really like the picture, I''m just going to give it a "6".</td>', 'This is a good one, I know that it has 7 steps but I can''t see the 7 subjects for it to step on. But I really like the picture, I''m just going to give it a "6".', '2004-12-05 02:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1046722, 123696, 24970, '<td valign="top">Those are some really neat stones. Lighting''s pretty harsh, try more of them and dimmer/less direct maybe? (I''m not going to pretend to be an expert) Velvet-like material works well as a more solid, light-absorbing background.</td>', 'Those are some really neat stones. Lighting''s pretty harsh, try more of them and dimmer/less direct maybe? (I''m not going to pretend to be an expert) Velvet-like material works well as a more solid, light-absorbing background.', '2004-12-05 03:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
