(1048307, 124753, 16636, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but a dit too overblown out in the highlights for me - good luck.</td>', 'nice idea, but a dit too overblown out in the highlights for me - good luck.', '2004-12-06 03:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048308, 124818, 24970, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Has a neat mood to it and is technically very good. A less bold border would be great.</td>', 'I really like this. Has a neat mood to it and is technically very good. A less bold border would be great.', '2004-12-06 03:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048311, 124843, 26679, '<td valign="top">the number 7 is here but I can not find the Seven Main subjects which I thought was the theme. However, as a photograph, I feel that the bright lights to the left of the 7 have made it difficult to select the appropriate exposure, which has than caused yo difficulties in the using contrast and tone. I have had exactly the same problems, which untill I manage to solve, I find that I shy away from too many lights in a shot.</td>', 'the number 7 is here but I can not find the Seven Main subjects which I thought was the theme. However, as a photograph, I feel that the bright lights to the left of the 7 have made it difficult to select the appropriate exposure, which has than caused yo difficulties in the using contrast and tone. I have had exactly the same problems, which untill I manage to solve, I find that I shy away from too many lights in a shot.', '2004-12-06 03:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048313, 125203, 28688, '<td valign="top">Nice use of repetitive pattern! When I first saw the thumbnail, I didn''t realise actually mirrors were used to get reflection of 2 butterflies. The lighting was beautiful.</td>', 'Nice use of repetitive pattern! When I first saw the thumbnail, I didn''t realise actually mirrors were used to get reflection of 2 butterflies. The lighting was beautiful.', '2004-12-06 03:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048315, 124822, 26679, '<td valign="top">Nice image  6''s and 7''s woild also be a good name here.<br/>Great impact my only concern is that the lighting makes the orange segments look a little dried out.</td>', 'Nice image  6''s and 7''s woild also be a good name here.Great impact my only concern is that the lighting makes the orange segments look a little dried out.', '2004-12-06 03:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048319, 125012, 26679, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, you can just see the string you used to pull the dice out mid exposure. However the dsk shaped playing card does gives the feeling of a spotlight.</td>', 'Nice effect, you can just see the string you used to pull the dice out mid exposure. However the dsk shaped playing card does gives the feeling of a spotlight.', '2004-12-06 03:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048320, 125042, 26679, '<td valign="top">How long dod you have to wait for this.<br/>Good Composition</td>', 'How long dod you have to wait for this.Good Composition', '2004-12-06 03:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048323, 125025, 28688, '<td valign="top">Gives me a feeling that odd numbers always leave one in solitude, but that odd one out seems to be better off because there is less competition and it grows much better, with it''s branches extending out.</td>', 'Gives me a feeling that odd numbers always leave one in solitude, but that odd one out seems to be better off because there is less competition and it grows much better, with it''s branches extending out.', '2004-12-06 03:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048339, 125057, 24970, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is great. Creative, AND a good picture! What can I complain about? That their legs are out of sync? But that appears to be on purpose to add more artistic merit. Nice job.</td>', 'Oh, this is great. Creative, AND a good picture! What can I complain about? That their legs are out of sync? But that appears to be on purpose to add more artistic merit. Nice job.', '2004-12-06 04:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048345, 124756, 24970, '<td valign="top">I like this. It has appealing composition and color, and is just.....unique. Thanks.</td>', 'I like this. It has appealing composition and color, and is just.....unique. Thanks.', '2004-12-06 04:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048348, 125195, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very nice job. Can see a bit of reflection from the top of the vase if I look closely, but it doesn''t bother me too much. Well done, in my top 3.</td>', 'Very nice job. Can see a bit of reflection from the top of the vase if I look closely, but it doesn''t bother me too much. Well done, in my top 3.', '2004-12-06 04:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048349, 124881, 24970, '<td valign="top">Ooo. Very pleasing composition...the driveway leading in, angle on the cliffs, etc. Also the soft color - I just really enjoy looking at this picture. In my top 3.</td>', 'Ooo. Very pleasing composition...the driveway leading in, angle on the cliffs, etc. Also the soft color - I just really enjoy looking at this picture. In my top 3.', '2004-12-06 04:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048350, 125032, 28742, '<td valign="top">I need more candles please... ;-)</td>', 'I need more candles please... ;-)', '2004-12-06 04:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048351, 125035, 28742, '<td valign="top">You know what they say... seven heads are better than one!</td>', 'You know what they say... seven heads are better than one!', '2004-12-06 04:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048353, 124767, 28742, '<td valign="top">Erase the legs of guy #8! ;-)</td>', 'Erase the legs of guy #8! ;-)', '2004-12-06 04:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048354, 125066, 24970, '<td valign="top">This one caught my eye several times in thumbnails, I''m glad it finally came up for voting. Way to go making a mundane subject interesting. And I''m curious to see how the colors were accomplished. Would be very surprised if this didn''t place highly, it''s in my top 3.</td>', 'This one caught my eye several times in thumbnails, I''m glad it finally came up for voting. Way to go making a mundane subject interesting. And I''m curious to see how the colors were accomplished. Would be very surprised if this didn''t place highly, it''s in my top 3.', '2004-12-06 04:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048357, 123753, 9292, '<td valign="top">This shot is wonderful and the atmosphere is very extrange an well catched</td>', 'This shot is wonderful and the atmosphere is very extrange an well catched', '2004-12-06 04:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048361, 125092, 28742, '<td valign="top">it''s Geese. ;-)</td>', 'it''s Geese. ;-)', '2004-12-06 04:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048447, 125187, 16636, '<td valign="top">maybe could work as a good b/w image - good dof</td>', 'maybe could work as a good b/w image - good dof', '2004-12-06 08:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048551, 125056, 30251, '<td valign="top">Ahh, the lost art of light painting. Very nice look.</td>', 'Ahh, the lost art of light painting. Very nice look.', '2004-12-06 09:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048553, 125108, 30251, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and nice use of depth of field.</td>', 'Great lighting and nice use of depth of field.', '2004-12-06 09:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048560, 124811, 30251, '<td valign="top">Everything and the kitchen sink. Very nice framing.</td>', 'Everything and the kitchen sink. Very nice framing.', '2004-12-06 09:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048565, 125035, 29219, '<td valign="top">I like the photo but I wish your eyes were open for the center shot.</td>', 'I like the photo but I wish your eyes were open for the center shot.', '2004-12-06 09:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048566, 125048, 30251, '<td valign="top">Not sure what is going on here, but the mood and feel is fantasic.</td>', 'Not sure what is going on here, but the mood and feel is fantasic.', '2004-12-06 09:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048567, 125142, 30251, '<td valign="top">Love white on white. Great look, good shot.</td>', 'Love white on white. Great look, good shot.', '2004-12-06 09:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048568, 124724, 29219, '<td valign="top">Would be more powerful if the orange gummy was in focus.  Great focus on the Red bears.</td>', 'Would be more powerful if the orange gummy was in focus.  Great focus on the Red bears.', '2004-12-06 09:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1048569, 124590, 21202, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped off the top of this picture.  There is a lot of  attention diverting stuff above the fence.</td>', 'I might have cropped off the top of this picture.  There is a lot of  attention diverting stuff above the fence.', '2004-12-06 09:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
