(1049699, 124568, 24841, '<td valign="top">Not so much on meeting the challenge.....I LOVE this photo and I''m trying to make it work in my mind for the challenge...really really reaching here...with that said I still give it a 10!  a rabbit, little birds, flying bird, mist and sun rays...what a capture!  It looks like a fairy tale....It''s a favorite for me!</td>', 'Not so much on meeting the challenge.....I LOVE this photo and I''m trying to make it work in my mind for the challenge...really really reaching here...with that said I still give it a 10!  a rabbit, little birds, flying bird, mist and sun rays...what a capture!  It looks like a fairy tale....It''s a favorite for me!', '2004-12-06 23:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049701, 124037, 24841, '<td valign="top">Just perfect!</td>', 'Just perfect!', '2004-12-06 23:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049712, 125043, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Not quite sure why.  Dead flowers don''t seem like a very exciting subject, but this appeals to me.  I think it''s cause of how well it goes with the background and the toning of the image as well.  Definately seven of your subject, and I really can''t find anything I dislike or would like to see differently.  Placement of the subject within the photo is good, and lighting and focus and clarity are great,  I see no reason not to give this a 10.  great shot. ~Heather~</td>', 'I really like this. Not quite sure why.  Dead flowers don''t seem like a very exciting subject, but this appeals to me.  I think it''s cause of how well it goes with the background and the toning of the image as well.  Definately seven of your subject, and I really can''t find anything I dislike or would like to see differently.  Placement of the subject within the photo is good, and lighting and focus and clarity are great,  I see no reason not to give this a 10.  great shot. ~Heather~', '2004-12-06 23:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049714, 125158, 3080, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I didn''t get the title at first, but remembered there''s a pizza place called Dominoes, so then it kind of clicked.  I like the background you chose, pretty blue and nothing distracting about that at all.  I like the set up, nicely placed within the photo.  I think that the only thing I''d like to see a bit different is the bright lighitng on the tops of the dominoes.  Kind of blown out on a few of them.  Otherwise, this is a great image. ~Heather~</td>', 'Good shot.  I didn''t get the title at first, but remembered there''s a pizza place called Dominoes, so then it kind of clicked.  I like the background you chose, pretty blue and nothing distracting about that at all.  I like the set up, nicely placed within the photo.  I think that the only thing I''d like to see a bit different is the bright lighitng on the tops of the dominoes.  Kind of blown out on a few of them.  Otherwise, this is a great image. ~Heather~', '2004-12-06 23:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049729, 125158, 27842, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and arrangement.  A lower angle might be even better,</td>', 'Great lighting and arrangement.  A lower angle might be even better,', '2004-12-07 00:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049731, 125103, 3080, '<td valign="top">I had a nice long comment on this, then challenge switchover booted me off the image.  darn it.  Anyway, what I had said was basicly this... Fun image, little soft on focus, can''t see much detail in angel on bottom she''s too small, lighting is a little dark, need something to make it punch.  Although I think it''s an alright image, it''s just not appealing to me personally.  There''s the short version of what I had typed before.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I had a nice long comment on this, then challenge switchover booted me off the image.  darn it.  Anyway, what I had said was basicly this... Fun image, little soft on focus, can''t see much detail in angel on bottom she''s too small, lighting is a little dark, need something to make it punch.  Although I think it''s an alright image, it''s just not appealing to me personally.  There''s the short version of what I had typed before.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-07 00:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049734, 125151, 27842, '<td valign="top">Really nice action and the color really adds to the image.  I think better lighting (diffused) in stead of flash  could have made this a 9 or 10.  You could have increased exposure by 1 or more stops to really make the background appear pure white.</td>', 'Really nice action and the color really adds to the image.  I think better lighting (diffused) in stead of flash  could have made this a 9 or 10.  You could have increased exposure by 1 or more stops to really make the background appear pure white.', '2004-12-07 00:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049742, 125193, 3080, '<td valign="top">looks like 7 bad habbits.  You shouldn''t store your pens upside down, all the ink runs to the bottom and then the pens don''t work.  Oh well.  I supose I''ll have to use my immagination for a change.  The pens seem dark to me, especially on the tips.  I like the placement of the cup and pens in the photo.  The little reflections on the ''bottom'' side of the cup are a bit distracting, however the background works for this photo in my opinion.  Focus and clarity look good, and it''s a cute image.  ~Heather~</td>', 'looks like 7 bad habbits.  You shouldn''t store your pens upside down, all the ink runs to the bottom and then the pens don''t work.  Oh well.  I supose I''ll have to use my immagination for a change.  The pens seem dark to me, especially on the tips.  I like the placement of the cup and pens in the photo.  The little reflections on the ''bottom'' side of the cup are a bit distracting, however the background works for this photo in my opinion.  Focus and clarity look good, and it''s a cute image.  ~Heather~', '2004-12-07 00:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
