(1049816, 125204, 19936, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  I sat here trying to do that with my fingers, what a riot.  Good light, focus and composition.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Great idea!  I sat here trying to do that with my fingers, what a riot.  Good light, focus and composition.  One of my top picks.', '2004-12-07 01:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049818, 124827, 19936, '<td valign="top">Crap!  I mean, what a better dice shot than mine.  I love the DOF used here, the background color is also appealing.  Not sure I like the two dice in focus being different colors.  Good shot though.</td>', 'Crap!  I mean, what a better dice shot than mine.  I love the DOF used here, the background color is also appealing.  Not sure I like the two dice in focus being different colors.  Good shot though.', '2004-12-07 01:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
