(1049830, 125106, 19936, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Would love to see how you did this.  Excellent focus while still showing movement.</td>', 'Great shot!  Would love to see how you did this.  Excellent focus while still showing movement.', '2004-12-07 01:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
