(1049957, 125066, 3306, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the arrangement. The lighting is excellent. I like how the soft shadows cast a slight green to the right side and red on the left. I can see this hanging in an art deco designed restaurant! One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Love the colors and the arrangement. The lighting is excellent. I like how the soft shadows cast a slight green to the right side and red on the left. I can see this hanging in an art deco designed restaurant! One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2004-12-07 06:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049958, 125177, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautifully arranged and technically excellent.</td>', 'Beautifully arranged and technically excellent.', '2004-12-07 06:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049959, 125151, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I especially like stop action pictures and this one represents the theme beautifully. There is a shadow in the lower left corner which seems out of place and slightly distracting. Otherwise a great shot.</td>', 'Very nicely done. I especially like stop action pictures and this one represents the theme beautifully. There is a shadow in the lower left corner which seems out of place and slightly distracting. Otherwise a great shot.', '2004-12-07 06:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049960, 125195, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is an amazingly beautiful picture. The lighting is superb. The subjects are well balanced and nicely arranged. All 7 of them!! I would love to see this framed.</td>', 'This is an amazingly beautiful picture. The lighting is superb. The subjects are well balanced and nicely arranged. All 7 of them!! I would love to see this framed.', '2004-12-07 06:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049961, 124939, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the simple arrangement and the soft lighting along with the reflections. You have made a very nice composition. Good job</td>', 'I like the simple arrangement and the soft lighting along with the reflections. You have made a very nice composition. Good job', '2004-12-07 06:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049962, 124476, 3306, '<td valign="top">Simple and very creative. I like it!</td>', 'Simple and very creative. I like it!', '2004-12-07 06:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049966, 124764, 3306, '<td valign="top">You have a very creative compostion here. I really like the setup and the colors you used. Just wondering why you decided to crop off the corners of the large frames? Not that I don''t approve, Just wondering:)</td>', 'You have a very creative compostion here. I really like the setup and the colors you used. Just wondering why you decided to crop off the corners of the large frames? Not that I don''t approve, Just wondering:)', '2004-12-07 06:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049987, 124764, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really like the funky colors along with the great composition. I think sticking the corners of the two biggest frames just outside the shot looks better than keeping them in would.</td>', 'I really like the funky colors along with the great composition. I think sticking the corners of the two biggest frames just outside the shot looks better than keeping them in would.', '2004-12-07 07:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049989, 125158, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think that blue makes a nice background for this shot.  I think this shot would look cool too if the lighting was harsh and had dramatic shadows without loosing the nice blue background.</td>', 'I think that blue makes a nice background for this shot.  I think this shot would look cool too if the lighting was harsh and had dramatic shadows without loosing the nice blue background.', '2004-12-07 07:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049990, 125078, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like this very narrow focus depth, and think that having too much in focus would take away the unfamiliar feel of the shot.</td>', 'I like this very narrow focus depth, and think that having too much in focus would take away the unfamiliar feel of the shot.', '2004-12-07 07:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049991, 124081, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field, reflections on surface, and composition, though the subjects are not especially interesting to me personally.</td>', 'I like the depth of field, reflections on surface, and composition, though the subjects are not especially interesting to me personally.', '2004-12-07 07:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049993, 123608, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the sky as an unusual background, for these subjects.  They light sepia tones work well here.  I also like how surface they are set on is not shown.</td>', 'I like the sky as an unusual background, for these subjects.  They light sepia tones work well here.  I also like how surface they are set on is not shown.', '2004-12-07 07:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049995, 124615, 27767, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and focus.  I like the light falling in the center of the toothpicks and the subtle texture of the surface.</td>', 'Nice detail and focus.  I like the light falling in the center of the toothpicks and the subtle texture of the surface.', '2004-12-07 07:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049996, 125042, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the strong diagonal line through the shot.  This shot begs to be taken for this challenge :)</td>', 'I like the strong diagonal line through the shot.  This shot begs to be taken for this challenge :)', '2004-12-07 07:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1049998, 124354, 27767, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, though I think I would like it more if the depth of field extended to include the body and head of woody.  Good texture on the cards though.</td>', 'Interesting idea, though I think I would like it more if the depth of field extended to include the body and head of woody.  Good texture on the cards though.', '2004-12-07 07:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050002, 123731, 27767, '<td valign="top">I think that maybe simplifying this setup a little would make a more attractive shot.  With all these shapes and colors piled together I don''t see a natural focal point or path for the eye. Maybe using a deeper depth of field would help to bring the front and back die into focus as well.</td>', 'I think that maybe simplifying this setup a little would make a more attractive shot.  With all these shapes and colors piled together I don''t see a natural focal point or path for the eye. Maybe using a deeper depth of field would help to bring the front and back die into focus as well.', '2004-12-07 07:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050009, 125187, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the way all the main lines converge on the top right corner.  Good detail on the rusted barbs too. Background weeds are a tiny bit distracting, but bluring them out too much may loose the furthest barbs too.</td>', 'I like the way all the main lines converge on the top right corner.  Good detail on the rusted barbs too. Background weeds are a tiny bit distracting, but bluring them out too much may loose the furthest barbs too.', '2004-12-07 07:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050015, 125093, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea.  One tiny thing I notice is that the tiles that spell "fortune" are slightly out of focus.  In this shot, I think that having the "fortune" in sharp focus and then letting the far side blur a little would be a little better.</td>', 'Very creative idea.  One tiny thing I notice is that the tiles that spell "fortune" are slightly out of focus.  In this shot, I think that having the "fortune" in sharp focus and then letting the far side blur a little would be a little better.', '2004-12-07 07:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050019, 125153, 27767, '<td valign="top">Cool bracelets, though they don''t seem to look good in this setup.  I think that taking them off the arm and maybe arranging them on a table or other surface with some interesting lighting would show them off better.  The focus looks just a tiny bit off on the close sides of the bracelets too.</td>', 'Cool bracelets, though they don''t seem to look good in this setup.  I think that taking them off the arm and maybe arranging them on a table or other surface with some interesting lighting would show them off better.  The focus looks just a tiny bit off on the close sides of the bracelets too.', '2004-12-07 07:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050020, 124743, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really like the light colors in this shot, and the arangement of ROIGBIV too. The clouds give a very light and interesting background to have the pins stand out against.</td>', 'I really like the light colors in this shot, and the arangement of ROIGBIV too. The clouds give a very light and interesting background to have the pins stand out against.', '2004-12-07 07:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
