(1050096, 124127, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like the colors, great choice of background and excellent textures. Might either cropped on shot a bit more left so the space in the center was not so centered.</td>', 'Like the colors, great choice of background and excellent textures. Might either cropped on shot a bit more left so the space in the center was not so centered.', '2004-12-07 09:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050098, 125136, 19978, '<td valign="top">The color, the leading lines, the composition; all work together to provide a fascinating feast for the eye. This was a great idea, well executed. My technical side would have liked to have seen sharper focus, especially on the individual tines of the forks, but the overall effect is not diminished. Great job!</td>', 'The color, the leading lines, the composition; all work together to provide a fascinating feast for the eye. This was a great idea, well executed. My technical side would have liked to have seen sharper focus, especially on the individual tines of the forks, but the overall effect is not diminished. Great job!', '2004-12-07 10:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050099, 124476, 19978, '<td valign="top">A very nice abstract effect created by an everyday object most people would never even think to use in a composition. It''s simplicity is it''s best feature. Very impressive. The flat black background and lack of shadows works very well here.</td>', 'A very nice abstract effect created by an everyday object most people would never even think to use in a composition. It''s simplicity is it''s best feature. Very impressive. The flat black background and lack of shadows works very well here.', '2004-12-07 10:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050103, 123839, 19978, '<td valign="top">A beautiful abstract. The light and shadow play and the lines leading from the edges to the center line of drops provide lots of visual interest, with the eye always being drawn back to the seven principle drops. This would be a lovely abstract print - you should be pleased with this effort!</td>', 'A beautiful abstract. The light and shadow play and the lines leading from the edges to the center line of drops provide lots of visual interest, with the eye always being drawn back to the seven principle drops. This would be a lovely abstract print - you should be pleased with this effort!', '2004-12-07 10:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050107, 125204, 18095, '<td valign="top">Thank goodness it wasn''t lucky eights Superb</td>', 'Thank goodness it wasn''t lucky eights Superb', '2004-12-07 10:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050117, 125099, 23356, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I would have liked it more if the background parcels were more in focus.  Only my opinion though. - 6</td>', 'Nice photo, I would have liked it more if the background parcels were more in focus.  Only my opinion though. - 6', '2004-12-07 10:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050119, 125161, 23356, '<td valign="top">I like this picture,  Very clear, great contrast between the fresh new growth and surrounding Autumnal colours.  Great photo, =8</td>', 'I like this picture,  Very clear, great contrast between the fresh new growth and surrounding Autumnal colours.  Great photo, =8', '2004-12-07 10:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050120, 124767, 23356, '<td valign="top">and a half?  Only kidding, nice photo =6</td>', 'and a half?  Only kidding, nice photo =6', '2004-12-07 10:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050123, 125120, 23356, '<td valign="top">My favourite so far, = 8</td>', 'My favourite so far, = 8', '2004-12-07 10:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050124, 125048, 23356, '<td valign="top">I had problems making out what this was, sorry only a 4</td>', 'I had problems making out what this was, sorry only a 4', '2004-12-07 10:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050128, 125208, 17505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful on many levels. Great color choices, nice placements and an overall solid composition. I''d like to know how you created the effect withough photoshop filters, please post. 10.</td>', 'Beautiful on many levels. Great color choices, nice placements and an overall solid composition. I''d like to know how you created the effect withough photoshop filters, please post. 10.', '2004-12-07 10:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050132, 124049, 17505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The pen''s a little distracting, seemingly out of focus and the paint flaking off it bugs me, but it''s a minor detail. Overall a wonderful shot and better than the competition for the story value. 9.</td>', 'Beautiful. The pen''s a little distracting, seemingly out of focus and the paint flaking off it bugs me, but it''s a minor detail. Overall a wonderful shot and better than the competition for the story value. 9.', '2004-12-07 10:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050135, 124518, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Beautiful light.  It''s hard to see the steps, so I''m sure you''re getting marked down by people with dark monitors. Good Luck. 9.</td>', 'Nice capture. Beautiful light.  It''s hard to see the steps, so I''m sure you''re getting marked down by people with dark monitors. Good Luck. 9.', '2004-12-07 10:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050138, 124127, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Good colors, althought I think you''re oversaturated them slightly, and I love the contrast between the straight lines and the curves. Very nice. 9.</td>', 'Interesting. Good colors, althought I think you''re oversaturated them slightly, and I love the contrast between the straight lines and the curves. Very nice. 9.', '2004-12-07 10:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050141, 123753, 17505, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. I love the lines and the choice of black &amp; white. Nicely done. 9.</td>', 'Excellent capture. I love the lines and the choice of black & white. Nicely done. 9.', '2004-12-07 10:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050145, 125044, 26710, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but I only see 6 of them...</td>', 'Interesting, but I only see 6 of them...', '2004-12-07 10:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050147, 124125, 17505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Great texture.</td>', 'Beautiful. Great texture.', '2004-12-07 10:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050150, 125038, 17505, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Nice job of framing and lighting. The burst effect of the watch face suits this photo perfectly. 10.</td>', 'Excellent! Nice job of framing and lighting. The burst effect of the watch face suits this photo perfectly. 10.', '2004-12-07 10:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050156, 124354, 24065, '<td valign="top">I am not one of the woody-haters.  In fact, my humor entry used one.  However, I think the lighting in the photo leaves this woody a little flat.  Great focus and dof.  Good natural colors.  The wrinkled area above Woody''s head to the left is a little distracting.  These are the kinds of comments I wish someone would leave for me, so I hope you find them helpful  :)</td>', 'I am not one of the woody-haters.  In fact, my humor entry used one.  However, I think the lighting in the photo leaves this woody a little flat.  Great focus and dof.  Good natural colors.  The wrinkled area above Woody''s head to the left is a little distracting.  These are the kinds of comments I wish someone would leave for me, so I hope you find them helpful  :)', '2004-12-07 11:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050157, 124724, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but the focus is so loose that it''s hard to look at. It actually hurts my eyes when I try to focus on the foremost bear. Good statement though.</td>', 'Nice try, but the focus is so loose that it''s hard to look at. It actually hurts my eyes when I try to focus on the foremost bear. Good statement though.', '2004-12-07 11:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050161, 124277, 24065, '<td valign="top">Great composition, lighting, and color.  I''m afraid you might get hurt by the number 7 not being an obvious part of the composition -- but I''ve never ribboned, so what do I know?</td>', 'Great composition, lighting, and color.  I''m afraid you might get hurt by the number 7 not being an obvious part of the composition -- but I''ve never ribboned, so what do I know?', '2004-12-07 11:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050162, 123839, 23356, '<td valign="top">I love the photo, not sure if it strictly meets that criteria of the challenge but neither did mine. =8</td>', 'I love the photo, not sure if it strictly meets that criteria of the challenge but neither did mine. =8', '2004-12-07 11:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050163, 125147, 17505, '<td valign="top">Much too much postprocessing. <br/>It looks false without seeming artistic.</td>', 'Much too much postprocessing. It looks false without seeming artistic.', '2004-12-07 11:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050166, 123912, 24065, '<td valign="top">You''ve certainly met the challenge, but I personally don''t care for the grainy look nor the slant of this photo (I got blasted on one of my entries for the slant, too).  The 7 ball could also be in a little sharper focus.  I am trying to offer comments that I would like to see on my entry so I can improve, so I hope you find it helpful.  :)</td>', 'You''ve certainly met the challenge, but I personally don''t care for the grainy look nor the slant of this photo (I got blasted on one of my entries for the slant, too).  The 7 ball could also be in a little sharper focus.  I am trying to offer comments that I would like to see on my entry so I can improve, so I hope you find it helpful.  :)', '2004-12-07 11:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050168, 125174, 24065, '<td valign="top">Great focus, dof, lighting, and color.</td>', 'Great focus, dof, lighting, and color.', '2004-12-07 11:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050169, 125136, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very creative entry, good color, focus, dof and composition.</td>', 'Very creative entry, good color, focus, dof and composition.', '2004-12-07 11:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050171, 125204, 24065, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, lighting, and it certainly meets the challenge :)</td>', 'Nice focus, lighting, and it certainly meets the challenge :)', '2004-12-07 11:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050172, 125188, 24065, '<td valign="top">Nice color, composition and focus.</td>', 'Nice color, composition and focus.', '2004-12-07 11:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050174, 124251, 23356, '<td valign="top">Great photo, I always admire a picture that makes me feel I want to be there. Congratulations on a job well done =8</td>', 'Great photo, I always admire a picture that makes me feel I want to be there. Congratulations on a job well done =8', '2004-12-07 11:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050175, 124995, 24065, '<td valign="top">I''ve counted several times, but I see only 6.  There may be one tucked away in that little dark corner that I can''t see, so I didn''t dedcut for it (I figured you knew how to count).  I''m thinking this would make a nice photograph with some brightness-contrast adjustment.</td>', 'I''ve counted several times, but I see only 6.  There may be one tucked away in that little dark corner that I can''t see, so I didn''t dedcut for it (I figured you knew how to count).  I''m thinking this would make a nice photograph with some brightness-contrast adjustment.', '2004-12-07 11:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050177, 124133, 23356, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, slightly overstaurated? or could be my screen. =7</td>', 'Nice photo, slightly overstaurated? or could be my screen. =7', '2004-12-07 11:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050180, 125093, 23356, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea, could be slightly clearer, =7</td>', 'Very clever idea, could be slightly clearer, =7', '2004-12-07 11:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050181, 125105, 24065, '<td valign="top">This was a super idea for the challenge. The little cups and saucers are precious.  The color on the background seems to be a little off, the focus seems a little soft, and there seems to be a lot of noise or graininess.  I hope these observations will be helpful.  :)</td>', 'This was a super idea for the challenge. The little cups and saucers are precious.  The color on the background seems to be a little off, the focus seems a little soft, and there seems to be a lot of noise or graininess.  I hope these observations will be helpful.  :)', '2004-12-07 11:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050182, 125051, 24065, '<td valign="top">This was a cute idea for the challenge.  I think it might be improved with some diffused lighting -- the flash appears to have created harsh shadows in the background and blown-out shine on the faces.  I might also suggest getting parallel with the characters instead of looking down on them.  And finally, I''d crop it a little closer.  Hope this is helpful :)</td>', 'This was a cute idea for the challenge.  I think it might be improved with some diffused lighting -- the flash appears to have created harsh shadows in the background and blown-out shine on the faces.  I might also suggest getting parallel with the characters instead of looking down on them.  And finally, I''d crop it a little closer.  Hope this is helpful :)', '2004-12-07 11:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050185, 125064, 24065, '<td valign="top">You know, I was trying to think of something with Bingo but just couldn''t come up with it.  Good idea!  I don''t care for the grainess of the photo, but I know that''s just a personal preference and so I didn''t deduct for it.  The lighting appears to be good as there are no blown-out spots.  It''s major weakness, in my opinion, is a soft focus.  Secondarily, I would suggest a stronger contrast.  Hope this is helpful :)</td>', 'You know, I was trying to think of something with Bingo but just couldn''t come up with it.  Good idea!  I don''t care for the grainess of the photo, but I know that''s just a personal preference and so I didn''t deduct for it.  The lighting appears to be good as there are no blown-out spots.  It''s major weakness, in my opinion, is a soft focus.  Secondarily, I would suggest a stronger contrast.  Hope this is helpful :)', '2004-12-07 11:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050187, 124843, 24065, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition.</td>', 'Nice color and composition.', '2004-12-07 11:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
