(1050415, 124465, 27845, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture. I can''t help but listen to the echo in my mind which says ''Lucky seven, lucky seven, lucky seven,...'' all the time. Very nice symmetric composition, flawless I''d say. The reflections make a nice star. The border is too close to the bullets for my taste. The picture would have been better without it. A stunning shot. I hope you''ll get rewarded for it :) 10.</td>', 'This is a great picture. I can''t help but listen to the echo in my mind which says ''Lucky seven, lucky seven, lucky seven,...'' all the time. Very nice symmetric composition, flawless I''d say. The reflections make a nice star. The border is too close to the bullets for my taste. The picture would have been better without it. A stunning shot. I hope you''ll get rewarded for it :) 10.', '2004-12-07 15:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050418, 125174, 27845, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I really like this picture. There''s something very special to it that I can''t seize. Good job.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I really like this picture. There''s something very special to it that I can''t seize. Good job.', '2004-12-07 15:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050421, 125062, 18217, '<td valign="top">very cute!<br/></td>', 'very cute!', '2004-12-07 15:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050423, 125038, 27845, '<td valign="top">...just as long as I stay-ay... Oh, sorry, but this shot really reminds me of Eagle-Eye Cherry''s song with the same title :) I like how the text stands out against the rest. That creates some contrast. I also like the clock''s ''iris'', the lines that move towards the center.</td>', '...just as long as I stay-ay... Oh, sorry, but this shot really reminds me of Eagle-Eye Cherry''s song with the same title :) I like how the text stands out against the rest. That creates some contrast. I also like the clock''s ''iris'', the lines that move towards the center.', '2004-12-07 15:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050432, 124281, 27845, '<td valign="top">Very shaky link to the challenge, but hey! it looks good. I don''t like the plate in the upper right corner and the reflections in the spoon. I appreciate how you show a source of food, the wheat, and the plate as symbol for the wait for food. The viewer has to imagine what''s between. Even if you didn''t mean to show that ;)</td>', 'Very shaky link to the challenge, but hey! it looks good. I don''t like the plate in the upper right corner and the reflections in the spoon. I appreciate how you show a source of food, the wheat, and the plate as symbol for the wait for food. The viewer has to imagine what''s between. Even if you didn''t mean to show that ;)', '2004-12-07 15:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050436, 123608, 27845, '<td valign="top">A bit oversharpened, but it really has the ''advertisement look''. I like the tone. I''d buy that.</td>', 'A bit oversharpened, but it really has the ''advertisement look''. I like the tone. I''d buy that.', '2004-12-07 15:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050443, 125099, 24065, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and good colors.  I know just enough to tell you that there is something lacking in the composition and the lighting, but I don''t know enough to tell you what it is or how to correct it.  I hope more talented participants will give you some helpful specifics.</td>', 'Nice idea and good colors.  I know just enough to tell you that there is something lacking in the composition and the lighting, but I don''t know enough to tell you what it is or how to correct it.  I hope more talented participants will give you some helpful specifics.', '2004-12-07 15:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050447, 124615, 27845, '<td valign="top">Now this one''s got the controversy I like. Reminds me of what I like to do. A great idea, but I think the setup''s not so good. The reflection is too strong, the angle too flat, the tip of the lower stick is out of focus. I do like the textures of the paper and the sticks.</td>', 'Now this one''s got the controversy I like. Reminds me of what I like to do. A great idea, but I think the setup''s not so good. The reflection is too strong, the angle too flat, the tip of the lower stick is out of focus. I do like the textures of the paper and the sticks.', '2004-12-07 16:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050450, 125153, 28858, '<td valign="top">soft focus</td>', 'soft focus', '2004-12-07 16:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050451, 124961, 24065, '<td valign="top">Good dof and color and it meets the challenge.  I like the background on the top, but find the wood-grainy bottom distracting from the image.  That could be cropped out and you''d still have a nice photo.</td>', 'Good dof and color and it meets the challenge.  I like the background on the top, but find the wood-grainy bottom distracting from the image.  That could be cropped out and you''d still have a nice photo.', '2004-12-07 16:02:44.000000', NULL, 1);
