(1050452, 124568, 27845, '<td valign="top">How the heck did you get all those animals in there? You''re incredibly lucky I''d say! (Well that fits the challenge, doesn''t it?). That''s also why I excuse the otherwise weak link to the challenge.</td>', 'How the heck did you get all those animals in there? You''re incredibly lucky I''d say! (Well that fits the challenge, doesn''t it?). That''s also why I excuse the otherwise weak link to the challenge.', '2004-12-07 16:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
