(1050739, 124754, 3080, '<td valign="top">Why yes, yes they are.  The first few things that stand out to me are the lighting and focus.  Lighting is quite harsh resulting in a lot of distracting reflections.  The focus is also quite soft.  I find that the focus is clearer on the background than on the rings.  Which is another issue.  The background.  i''m not quite sure what the background is suposed to be.  I try to read it, but it''s unreadable, which just makes it annoying.  Definately 7 of the subject though. ~Heather~</td>', 'Why yes, yes they are.  The first few things that stand out to me are the lighting and focus.  Lighting is quite harsh resulting in a lot of distracting reflections.  The focus is also quite soft.  I find that the focus is clearer on the background than on the rings.  Which is another issue.  The background.  i''m not quite sure what the background is suposed to be.  I try to read it, but it''s unreadable, which just makes it annoying.  Definately 7 of the subject though. ~Heather~', '2004-12-07 19:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
