(1050924, 125205, 3080, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice about this shot is that the largest section of the photo is out of focus.  The thing that my eyes are really drawn to is soft, while the little guy in the corner is in focus more.  Also there are some black dots near the center of the photo and one in the bottom right of the photo that I find a tad distracting.  The reflections of the candies make it appear to have more than just 7 of the subject, however, reflections don''t count in my opinion. ~Heather~</td>', 'The first thing I notice about this shot is that the largest section of the photo is out of focus.  The thing that my eyes are really drawn to is soft, while the little guy in the corner is in focus more.  Also there are some black dots near the center of the photo and one in the bottom right of the photo that I find a tad distracting.  The reflections of the candies make it appear to have more than just 7 of the subject, however, reflections don''t count in my opinion. ~Heather~', '2004-12-07 22:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050929, 125050, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately looks like there are seven of the subject, but the photo isn''t really clear as to what we''re looking at.  I am not finding anything that really pulls me in and holds me there.  I like the color, but this is just not my thing.  the large blown out area in the middle doesn''t help either. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately looks like there are seven of the subject, but the photo isn''t really clear as to what we''re looking at.  I am not finding anything that really pulls me in and holds me there.  I like the color, but this is just not my thing.  the large blown out area in the middle doesn''t help either. ~Heather~', '2004-12-07 22:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
