(1050938, 125210, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure why you chose to shoot rotate it this way, but I find that it is very distracting to the overall impact of the photo.  Definately 7 of the subject.  Actually, 7 of 2 different subjects.  Which is ok too.  Focus seems ok, and all, but I think that the way you make it look like the candles are on the ''wall'' is distracting.  I think it adds nothing to the photo. ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m not really sure why you chose to shoot rotate it this way, but I find that it is very distracting to the overall impact of the photo.  Definately 7 of the subject.  Actually, 7 of 2 different subjects.  Which is ok too.  Focus seems ok, and all, but I think that the way you make it look like the candles are on the ''wall'' is distracting.  I think it adds nothing to the photo. ~Heather~', '2004-12-07 22:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
