(1050959, 124089, 3080, '<td valign="top">I hate to be a picky bastard about this, but I''m seeing more than 7 cranes.  If the 4 big things aren''t cranes, then I''m only seeing 6 cranes.  If they ARE cranes, then I see 10.  Either way, it isn''t 7.  I could easily be wrong, but I zoomed in and that''s what I found.   Anyway, about the image itself...I think it''s very beautiful.  I love the blue at the bottom against the orange at the top.  The way the sun comes from behind is great as well.  Nice focus and clarity and the photo is overall very nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'I hate to be a picky bastard about this, but I''m seeing more than 7 cranes.  If the 4 big things aren''t cranes, then I''m only seeing 6 cranes.  If they ARE cranes, then I see 10.  Either way, it isn''t 7.  I could easily be wrong, but I zoomed in and that''s what I found.   Anyway, about the image itself...I think it''s very beautiful.  I love the blue at the bottom against the orange at the top.  The way the sun comes from behind is great as well.  Nice focus and clarity and the photo is overall very nice. ~Heather~', '2004-12-07 22:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050962, 124879, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well, there are definately seven deer in the photo.  The deer are hard to see and not very clear at all, but upon close inspection, they are definately there.  I''m not sure why all the trees are leaning to the right, but I find that a bit distracting.  there isn''t really much color in the photo, so it''s a bit dullish looking.  I''m not personally drawn into the photo, but it is good for the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'Well, there are definately seven deer in the photo.  The deer are hard to see and not very clear at all, but upon close inspection, they are definately there.  I''m not sure why all the trees are leaning to the right, but I find that a bit distracting.  there isn''t really much color in the photo, so it''s a bit dullish looking.  I''m not personally drawn into the photo, but it is good for the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-07 22:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050970, 123753, 19503, '<td valign="top">What a great photo. The composition is great, the texture and soft focus of snow and tree in the background makes it feel like a painting. Any ideas on how to improve this picture? The tree in the foreground might be a little on the bright side imho. GJ</td>', 'What a great photo. The composition is great, the texture and soft focus of snow and tree in the background makes it feel like a painting. Any ideas on how to improve this picture? The tree in the foreground might be a little on the bright side imho. GJ', '2004-12-07 22:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050971, 124764, 27847, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, what can I say that''s bad about this photo??? Thinking, thinking ... you should used different frames, yeah that''s it! OK, I take all that back and in return I will send a ribbon your way. What can I say, I really, really, really like this Photo. Love it, hope it brings you a ribbon.</td>', 'Hmmm, what can I say that''s bad about this photo??? Thinking, thinking ... you should used different frames, yeah that''s it! OK, I take all that back and in return I will send a ribbon your way. What can I say, I really, really, really like this Photo. Love it, hope it brings you a ribbon.', '2004-12-07 22:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050973, 125169, 27847, '<td valign="top">What a simple shot, so simple that you might get a ribbon for it. Excellent shot, love the bulb colors and the use of white space.</td>', 'What a simple shot, so simple that you might get a ribbon for it. Excellent shot, love the bulb colors and the use of white space.', '2004-12-07 22:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050976, 124067, 3080, '<td valign="top">It''s a neat photo.  I find the shadows and reflections on the wall to be distraction however.  I think there are 7, but one is kind of hidden and not really clear to see.  I like the color, I like how the balls match the stem.  The glass is nice and I like the splashes.  your glass is tilted slightly to the left, which is bothersome for me.  overall neat image for the challenge....just needs some cleaning up. ~Heather~</td>', 'It''s a neat photo.  I find the shadows and reflections on the wall to be distraction however.  I think there are 7, but one is kind of hidden and not really clear to see.  I like the color, I like how the balls match the stem.  The glass is nice and I like the splashes.  your glass is tilted slightly to the left, which is bothersome for me.  overall neat image for the challenge....just needs some cleaning up. ~Heather~', '2004-12-07 22:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050979, 124058, 6532, '<td valign="top">Good DOF</td>', 'Good DOF', '2004-12-07 22:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050990, 124608, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have pondered this photo for a long time.  I have come to the conclusion that it''s missing something for me.  the lighting is harsh in many spots, you don''t have the colors of the rainbow correct, and the line up seems totally random, with no organization what so ever.  I like the color, and I like the idea.  you definately have 7 of your subject. ~Heather~</td>', 'I have pondered this photo for a long time.  I have come to the conclusion that it''s missing something for me.  the lighting is harsh in many spots, you don''t have the colors of the rainbow correct, and the line up seems totally random, with no organization what so ever.  I like the color, and I like the idea.  you definately have 7 of your subject. ~Heather~', '2004-12-07 22:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1050994, 123824, 3080, '<td valign="top">This photo is really hard to look at. There is so much clashing texture with that plate in the background that I think it just doesn''t work.  also I think the DOF doesn''t work here.  too shallow. there is way too much of the photo out of focus.  definately sore on the eyes.  you do have 7 of the subject, so right on with the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'This photo is really hard to look at. There is so much clashing texture with that plate in the background that I think it just doesn''t work.  also I think the DOF doesn''t work here.  too shallow. there is way too much of the photo out of focus.  definately sore on the eyes.  you do have 7 of the subject, so right on with the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-12-07 23:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
