(1051331, 124568, 17185, '<td valign="top">About time I explained how LUCKY I was to catch this. I saw the ibis wandering along the edge of the dam, asked my pup to stay...shes never behind me when I get close to the dam, not sure why she was this day.....moved stealthily closer, all the while trying to get my camera focussed on the spot where I expected the bird to fly. I think I took about 6 more steps before it took off, and I managed to shoot two images as it did. This one was the better of the two. When I returned home and looked closer, I discovered that there was a kangaroo and two ducks also at the edge of the dam, hadn''t even noticed them when I took the shots. I did, however, see a couple of roos bounding away soon after taking the photos, with my pup in pursuit!</td>', 'About time I explained how LUCKY I was to catch this. I saw the ibis wandering along the edge of the dam, asked my pup to stay...shes never behind me when I get close to the dam, not sure why she was this day.....moved stealthily closer, all the while trying to get my camera focussed on the spot where I expected the bird to fly. I think I took about 6 more steps before it took off, and I managed to shoot two images as it did. This one was the better of the two. When I returned home and looked closer, I discovered that there was a kangaroo and two ducks also at the edge of the dam, hadn''t even noticed them when I took the shots. I did, however, see a couple of roos bounding away soon after taking the photos, with my pup in pursuit!', '2004-12-08 00:47:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1051334, 124608, 22734, '<td valign="top">An image that truly impressed me. Keep batting away.</td>', 'An image that truly impressed me. Keep batting away.', '2004-12-08 00:48:41.000000', NULL, 0),
