(1051403, 124383, 8891, '<td valign="top">I definitely agree with Daniel on this, Kylie! This is wonderful and I liked it very much in the challenge. You really should have gotten a better finish.It is a striking image and one you should be very proud of!  Great shadows and colors! A beauty! RoB</td>', 'I definitely agree with Daniel on this, Kylie! This is wonderful and I liked it very much in the challenge. You really should have gotten a better finish.It is a striking image and one you should be very proud of!  Great shadows and colors! A beauty! RoB', '2004-12-08 01:08:34.000000', NULL, 0),
