(1051472, 124995, 16900, '<td valign="top">Well, for those of you that could not tell the 7th wall, I was using the illusion of a shadow to create the 7th wall.  I was hoping to make it interesting with the shadow.  I bumped up the levels and contrast as much as possible without losing one of the walls, which was a bit of a compromise.  Thank you for all who commented.</td>', 'Well, for those of you that could not tell the 7th wall, I was using the illusion of a shadow to create the 7th wall.  I was hoping to make it interesting with the shadow.  I bumped up the levels and contrast as much as possible without losing one of the walls, which was a bit of a compromise.  Thank you for all who commented.', '2004-12-08 01:29:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1051476, 124998, 28337, '<td valign="top">Ok, This shot was not set up! :)<br/> <br/>It was actually taken in a starbucks store... Anyway, thanks for the input.</td>', 'Ok, This shot was not set up! :) It was actually taken in a starbucks store... Anyway, thanks for the input.', '2004-12-08 01:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
