(1051547, 124164, 20608, '<td valign="top">Thanx for the comments and just for the record these are NOT my nails the belong to a friend who posed for this shot at his workplace where they play Dominoes in their lunch break (industrial hence dirty nails i guess). I will remember that pet hate and to be honest the thought never even crossed my mind but that is why I am here to learn thanks everyone.</td>', 'Thanx for the comments and just for the record these are NOT my nails the belong to a friend who posed for this shot at his workplace where they play Dominoes in their lunch break (industrial hence dirty nails i guess). I will remember that pet hate and to be honest the thought never even crossed my mind but that is why I am here to learn thanks everyone.', '2004-12-08 02:20:22.000000', NULL, 0),
