(1051721, 125204, 10413, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by graphicfunk:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on your 4th finish Shannon. This should have taken a ribbon. The craftmanship is superb and its artistic impact is too strong to ignore. Very good work! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>My thoughts exactly but GF words things better. :)  Congratulations on your 4th place.</td>', 'Originally posted by graphicfunk: Congratulations on your 4th finish Shannon. This should have taken a ribbon. The craftmanship is superb and its artistic impact is too strong to ignore. Very good work!   My thoughts exactly but GF words things better. :)  Congratulations on your 4th place.', '2004-12-08 07:33:04.000000', NULL, 0),
