(1051861, 125204, 17203, '<td valign="top">Thanks, Mag. I''m betting that some of the low scores came from people who just didn''t notice the extra fingers. I got a few comments from folks who said they didn''t get it at first. I could have put "Seven Fingers Crossed..." in the title, but I prefer subtlety over a sledgehammer.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-08 09:44:11.</i></td>', 'Thanks, Mag. I''m betting that some of the low scores came from people who just didn''t notice the extra fingers. I got a few comments from folks who said they didn''t get it at first. I could have put "Seven Fingers Crossed..." in the title, but I prefer subtlety over a sledgehammer.', '2004-12-08 09:43:49.000000', '2004-12-08 09:44:11.000000', 0),
