(1052886, 125106, 29443, '<td valign="top">A 10 second exposure, using a small focused light source in line with the balls so that only the end ball was illuminated. I quickly removed each ball at about one and a half second increments, exposing the next ball in line to the light.<br/></td>', 'A 10 second exposure, using a small focused light source in line with the balls so that only the end ball was illuminated. I quickly removed each ball at about one and a half second increments, exposing the next ball in line to the light.', '2004-12-08 18:30:20.000000', NULL, 0),
