(1053717, 124465, 22479, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by samtrundle:</b></div><hr/><i> Okay the setup here is ridiculous, I scored you a 7 during the challenge, but clearly without stopping to think about how challenging the creation of this photo must have been. <br/> <br/>If I had thought it through you would have got a 9 or a 10 from me. <br/> <br/>I would apologise, but you''ve got a blue ribbon for your troubles, so I don''t think you are feeling particularly horrible about it. <br/> <br/>Congratulations on a brilliant effort. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Congratulations, anireno! My sentiments perfectly mirror what samtrundle already said. On more consideration, I agree that this was quite an impressive and creative setup. Good luck!</td>', 'Originally posted by samtrundle: Okay the setup here is ridiculous, I scored you a 7 during the challenge, but clearly without stopping to think about how challenging the creation of this photo must have been.  If I had thought it through you would have got a 9 or a 10 from me.  I would apologise, but you''ve got a blue ribbon for your troubles, so I don''t think you are feeling particularly horrible about it.  Congratulations on a brilliant effort.   Congratulations, anireno! My sentiments perfectly mirror what samtrundle already said. On more consideration, I agree that this was quite an impressive and creative setup. Good luck!', '2004-12-09 01:56:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1053730, 124764, 22125, '<td valign="top">Well done second best in the family Ev.lol.</td>', 'Well done second best in the family Ev.lol.', '2004-12-09 02:04:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1053733, 124764, 22479, '<td valign="top">Wow so close...congratulations on a fantastic entry!</td>', 'Wow so close...congratulations on a fantastic entry!', '2004-12-09 02:07:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1053750, 124568, 22479, '<td valign="top">Wow I think you got robbed here. Still a strong finish but I was hoping this would ribbon. There are about 9 rays of light here, but I say who cares?? This is just an amazing shot. Certainly does not deserve 4 1''s and 5 2''s. Good luck!</td>', 'Wow I think you got robbed here. Still a strong finish but I was hoping this would ribbon. There are about 9 rays of light here, but I say who cares?? This is just an amazing shot. Certainly does not deserve 4 1''s and 5 2''s. Good luck!', '2004-12-09 02:18:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1053957, 124755, 29462, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and encouragement, early days lots to learn, quick round up of the queries, the building is on Bishop''s Gate City of London, the statues are on the roof looking down and slightly to left (i flipped it), I really struggled to get the balance between light and dark, dark to hide the flag pole behind last statue and a lamp column in foreground (glad it was out) tried quiet a few angles of shot but all others resulted in illuminated back drops, there is a tower block behind the building.<br/> <br/>Thanks Again<br/> <br/>Pete</td>', 'Thanks for the comments and encouragement, early days lots to learn, quick round up of the queries, the building is on Bishop''s Gate City of London, the statues are on the roof looking down and slightly to left (i flipped it), I really struggled to get the balance between light and dark, dark to hide the flag pole behind last statue and a lamp column in foreground (glad it was out) tried quiet a few angles of shot but all others resulted in illuminated back drops, there is a tower block behind the building. Thanks Again Pete', '2004-12-09 05:57:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1054033, 125204, 25095, '<td valign="top">I didn''t realize this was so easy, I actually tried a long exposure with 5 fingers showing then again with 2 more, some of my shots came very close to postable but just not enough.  Good job...and yes after I read how you did it I tried it too :).</td>', 'I didn''t realize this was so easy, I actually tried a long exposure with 5 fingers showing then again with 2 more, some of my shots came very close to postable but just not enough.  Good job...and yes after I read how you did it I tried it too :).', '2004-12-09 07:33:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1054084, 125095, 24128, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments :)<br/> <br/>I have to admit that I thought I was ''selling out'' a little with this pic, I was not sure about the texture of the wood and was tempted to do it all smooth.<br/> <br/>It feels really good to get my first top ten finish :)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments :) I have to admit that I thought I was ''selling out'' a little with this pic, I was not sure about the texture of the wood and was tempted to do it all smooth. It feels really good to get my first top ten finish :)', '2004-12-09 08:37:19.000000', NULL, 0),
