(1054363, 125113, 24613, '<td valign="top">I Really like this shot and gave it an 8.  And now a lesson on counting for land lovers!  7 sail boats are moored and two are beached.  See how easy that is? :)</td>', 'I Really like this shot and gave it an 8.  And now a lesson on counting for land lovers!  7 sail boats are moored and two are beached.  See how easy that is? :)', '2004-12-09 12:48:30.000000', NULL, 0),
