(1055197, 125046, 15920, '<td valign="top">I voted on this image and never got back to give you a comment, and I meant to.  First, the colors on this shot are perfect, the timing is excellent with the tip of the flag folding over on itself, and the crop, with the flag itself as the subject is decent.<br/> <br/>I voted you a six, with the above items foremost in my mind.  What might get a better score is to crop so that the stripes are more prominent as Heather suggested below.  Also, you might consider something like Neat image to take out a little noise and give a little sharpening that doesn''t destroy the image.<br/> <br/>One last thought: because this is an international site, it is generally hard to do well with an national flag, but, that said, this would be perfect for "Wind."<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'I voted on this image and never got back to give you a comment, and I meant to.  First, the colors on this shot are perfect, the timing is excellent with the tip of the flag folding over on itself, and the crop, with the flag itself as the subject is decent. I voted you a six, with the above items foremost in my mind.  What might get a better score is to crop so that the stripes are more prominent as Heather suggested below.  Also, you might consider something like Neat image to take out a little noise and give a little sharpening that doesn''t destroy the image. One last thought: because this is an international site, it is generally hard to do well with an national flag, but, that said, this would be perfect for "Wind." Good luck.', '2004-12-09 21:50:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1055503, 125056, 2677, '<td valign="top">A glow stick?? Am I right?  Looks very cool</td>', 'A glow stick?? Am I right?  Looks very cool', '2004-12-10 01:34:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1055540, 125142, 23458, '<td valign="top">Im surprised at the low score here, I thought this would be a relatively dpc safe image. Personally I think the slinky shot was better, but this is a really terrific hi-key image. <br/> <br/>Haven''t read the comments below, but at a guess I''d say the issue was that people had trouble discerning seven petals. I gave this a 7 during voting, but at a second glance I''d probably bump that up one.</td>', 'Im surprised at the low score here, I thought this would be a relatively dpc safe image. Personally I think the slinky shot was better, but this is a really terrific hi-key image.  Haven''t read the comments below, but at a guess I''d say the issue was that people had trouble discerning seven petals. I gave this a 7 during voting, but at a second glance I''d probably bump that up one.', '2004-12-10 02:24:21.000000', NULL, 0),
