(1064912, 124383, 15920, '<td valign="top">Kylie:<br/> <br/>I gave this a seven and meant to get back to comment.  Colors and cropping were the two things that stood out in my mind, but, the lighting casting the interesting shadows was decent as well.<br/> <br/>"cracking image" isn''t a phrase I use much, but I think I agree.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Kylie: I gave this a seven and meant to get back to comment.  Colors and cropping were the two things that stood out in my mind, but, the lighting casting the interesting shadows was decent as well. "cracking image" isn''t a phrase I use much, but I think I agree.  Nicely done.', '2004-12-15 20:44:22.000000', NULL, 0),
