(6797121, 125176, 35602, '<td valign="top">The focus is really good on this.  The choice of red as a background also works to give the photo some pop.  As to why the photo scored so low, can''t help you there.  I would have probably given this about a 6, mostly because I am not necessarily seeing why 7 pairs of hands can be considered lucky.  If it is your family, then you are lucky to have seven members.  However, I am not sure most would know that.  I think this was mostly a failure because the voters could not see a real connection between the challenge and the photo.  But that is only my opinion.  Believe me I have a slew of stinkers myself.  Look at my earliest entries and you will know how I struggled as well.</td>', 'The focus is really good on this.  The choice of red as a background also works to give the photo some pop.  As to why the photo scored so low, can''t help you there.  I would have probably given this about a 6, mostly because I am not necessarily seeing why 7 pairs of hands can be considered lucky.  If it is your family, then you are lucky to have seven members.  However, I am not sure most would know that.  I think this was mostly a failure because the voters could not see a real connection between the challenge and the photo.  But that is only my opinion.  Believe me I have a slew of stinkers myself.  Look at my earliest entries and you will know how I struggled as well.', '2012-06-17 16:46:25.000000', NULL, 0),
